2 CONT 3a. William. (John (p. 1), Isaac) Born in 1646. Married Agnes on March 8, 1675, at Salem, MA. In 1703, William and Agnes resided at Salem, New London County, CT. WiIliam lived at.Salem and Beverly, MA. William was a tailor, and li
2 CONC ved at Salem, MA, from 1676 to 1686. William bought a lot from John Lambert, Jr., of Salem, a mariner, on May 5, 1686. (This John Lambert, Jr., reportedly became a pirate and was executed for piracy at. Boston, MA, on June 30, 170
2 CONC 4.) William moved from Salem, MA, to Salem, New London, Ct. William sold his house in .1702 and moved from Salem, MA, to Salem, CT. William died about 1703. After the death of William, it. appears that Agnes married Simon Lovett a
2 CONC nd had three children — William, Sarah and Grace Lovett. [NO]
2 CONT
