2 CONC ry, Fulton, Schenectady, Columbia and Greene, Volume 1 by Cuyler Reynolds Lewis Historical Publishing Company, 1911 - Hudson River Valley (N.Y. and N.J.) - 1847 pages.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=b4k-AAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA336&ots
2 CONC =NOIxU6vTAq&dq=captain%20William%20tyng%20of%20Boston&pg=PA336#v=onepage&q=captain%20William%20tyng%20of%20Boston&f=true page 336]
