2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah (Davis) Treadway Swetland was the daughter of Jabez Davis and Experience (Linnell) Hatch. She was the wife of John Oliver Swetland. They were married Colchester, Connecticut January 19, 1704. John died in 1750.
