2 CONT ===Elizabeth Brattle
2 CONT * Spouse: Nathaniel Oliver, Birth:	8 Mar 1651/2, Boston Suffok MA.  Parents: Peter Oliver (1616-1670) and Sarah Newgate (1621-1692)
