1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ===5. Katherine BRATTLE===
2 CONT
2 CONT * Birth: 26 September 1664 
2 CONT * Death: 5 August 1725 Boston
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage: Firstly 20 May 1680 in Boston to John EYRE. John EYRE was born 19 February 1653/54 Watertown, Mass. and died 17 June 1700 Boston. 
2 CONT
2 CONT They had issue:
2 CONT # - Katharine EYRE
2 CONT # - Bethia EYRE who married John WALLEY on 18 March 1713/14 [our line]. They had issue too in turn: John WALLEY born 6 October 1716
2 CONT
2 CONT On 13 Nov 1707, seven years after her first husband's death, Katherine remarried Waitstill WINTHROP who had once been one of the Salem witch trial judges (and was a grandson of Massachusetts's first governor, John WINTHROP).
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
2 CONT From Hudson-Mohawk Genealogical and Family Memoirs: A Record of ..., Volume 1 edited by Cuyler Reynolds
2 CONT
2 CONT >Catherine Brattle, wife of John Eyre, was a daughter of Captain Thomas and Elizabeth (Tyng) Brattle, of Boston.  ... Elizabeth Tyng, eldest daughter of Captain William Tyng, was born in England, 1638; married, in 1656, Captain Th
2 CONC omas Brattle ....
2 CONT
2 CONT ------
2 CONT
