2 CONT John Sweetland Junior was born in 1687. He was the son of John Sweetland and Rebecca (Clark) Sweetland. He married Mehitable "Elizabeth" (Fuller) Sweetland on April 30, 1716 in Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay. He passed away
2 CONC  in 1776.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Sweetland-68 Profile last modified 15 Feb 2020 | Created 15 Jul 2013
2 CONT
2 CONT John Sweetland Junior was born on 22 May 1687 in Marblehead, Essex, Massachusetts Bay to John Sweetland and Rebecca (Clark) Sweetland. He is the brother of Deborah (Sweetland) Peck. He married Mehitable (Fuller) Sweetland — marrie
2 CONC d 30 Apr 1716 in Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay. He is the father of John Sweetland III, Mehitable (Sweetland) Razee, Rebackah (Sweetland) Godding and Esther Sweetland. John died on Apr 1776 in Attleboro, Bristol, Massachus
2 CONC etts Bay.
