1 NAME John /Lovett/ (II)
2 GIVN John
2 SURN Lovett
2 NSFX (II)
2 _MARNM Lovett
2 NICK JOHN Lovett Jr
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1637
2 ADDR
3 CTRY England
1 DEAT
2 DATE 10 SEP 1727
2 PLAC Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts Bay, British Colonial America
2 ADDR
1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1) John (John 1) born 1637 in England. Died Sept. 10, 1727. Married Bethiah Rootes, daughter of Josiah and Suzanna Rootes. During the witch- craft hysteria at Salem, Suzanna Rootes was accused of being a witch. She was arrested Ma
2 CONC y 21, 1692 and was convicted as guilty. Fortu- nately she was only imprisoned. The Lovetts lived at Beverly.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT *http://smithharper.org/wp-content/uploads/2017/01/BethiaLovett.pdf
2 CONT *https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Lovett-498
