1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Experience Linnell Davis=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1664 Barnstable, Barnstable County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH Dec 1736 (aged 71–72) Barnstable, Barnstable County, Massachusetts, USA [10]
2 CONT * BURIAL Burial Details Unknown
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID  139059856 Info. by: Thomas Lumbard (#48741379).
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Her parents were David Linnell and Hannah Shelley. They were born in England and lived/died in Barnstable, Barnstable Co, MA. Which is where they are presumed to be buried, also.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT Experience remarried after her spouse Jabez Davis died. She married Benjamin Hatch.  Her death record is found on ancestry.com BUT it is transcribed incorrectly. The actual record simply says she died in December 1736. There is so
2 CONC mething written in regard to the date, but it is illegible.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT David Linnell 1627–1688
2 CONT Hannah Shelley Linnell 1637–1709
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
2 CONT Jabez Davis 1664–1710 m 8/20/1689
2 CONT Benjamin Hatch 1655–1736 m 2/13/1711/2
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Hannah Linnell Davis 1660 – unknown
2 CONT Mary Linnel Sargeant 1660–1754
2 CONT Susannah Linnell Phinney 1673–1752
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 11x all born in Barnstable, Barnstable, Mass.
2 CONT Sarah (Davis) Sweetland
2 CONT Lieut. Nathan Davis 3/2/1690–1785 twin? m. Elizabeth Phinney 11/24/1714
2 CONT Reuben Davis 3/2/1689/90 twin? or typo?
2 CONT Samuel Davis 9/25/1692–1733
2 CONT Bathsheba Davis 1/16/1693/4 
2 CONT Isaac Davis 4/23/1696-10/16/1739
2 CONT Abigail Davis 4/26/1698 m Joseph Hamlin 9/1718
2 CONT Jacob Davis 10/1699
2 CONT Mercy "Mary" Davis Hatch 2/16/1701–1767 named Mary named in father's September, 1710 will
2 CONT Ebenezer Davis bapt. 6/23/1706- not named in his father's will of September, 1710
2 CONT Solomon Davis bapt. 9/4/1706- m Mehitabel Sturtevant of Sandwich
2 CONT
