2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT Jabez Davis parents were John Davis and Hannah Linnell. They were born in England and lived in Barnstable, Barnstable Co, MA where they died and are presumed to be buried.  He married August 20, 1689, Experience, daughter of David
2 CONC  Lynnell; 10 children; Jabez died 1710  "Jabez Davis signed his will on 29 Sep 1710. Administration was granted on Saturday, 3 Jan 1710/11, which would have been the first available court date. So in all probability, he died in De
2 CONC cember."
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT Jabez Davis and Experience (Linnell) Davis were first cousins. Experience's father, David Linnell and Jabez's mother Hannah Linnell were siblings.
