2 CONT Davis, Samuel, s. Jabez and Experience, Sept. 25, 1692 (Vol. 4, p. 223)
2 CONT Davis, Bathsheba, d. Jabez and Experience, Jan. 16, 1694. (Vol. 4, p. 224)
2 CONT Davis, Isaac, s. Jabez and Experience, Apr. 23, 1696. (Vol. 4, p. 224)
