2 CONT Davis, Jacob, s. Jabez and Experience, Oct. __, 1699. (Vol. 4, Page 224)
2 CONT Davis, Mercy, d. Jabez and Experience, Feb. 16, 1701. (Vol. 4, Page 224) [8]
