2 CONT Sarah Davis 8/12/1717-8/23/717 
2 CONT Elisabeth Davis Butterfield 9/15/1718–1783
2 CONT Isaac Davis 1/1/1720–1780
2 CONT Sarah Davis Hopkins 1722–1790
2 CONT Nathan Davis 8/10/1735 in Harwinton CT d.?
2 CONT
