2 CONT
2 CONT John Pierce Brewster was the son of Samuel Brewster and Tabitha Baldwin. Samuel was the son of William Brewster and Patience. William was the son of Benjamin Brewster and Anne Addis. Benjamin was the son of Jonathan Brewster and L
2 CONC ucretia Oldham. Jonathan was the son of Elder William Brewster and Mary. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Here is what I have on the family group of John Pierce, and his son Pierce. I descend from John Pierce's son Nathaniel. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Name:John Pierce BREWSTER
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:1738 1 Burial:Sup. Kiever Cemetery, Beaver Brook, NB Father:Samuel BREWSTER (1700-1776) Mother:Tabitha BALDWIN (1699-)
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Came to Halifax in 1750's and to Shepody in 1760's. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT He and his wife are supposed to be buried in Beaver Creek, but Bill Brewster has not been able to locate them there. A genealogy group there says he has a stone about a mile and a half off the road, but that needs to be confirmed.
2 CONC
2 CONT
2 CONT A large part of Albert County was called Hopewell Twp in early times. 
2 CONT
2 CONT >From information received from Robert Miller, a descendant of Nathaniel, whose
2 CONT father researched the family,
2 CONT
2 CONT "The pioneer Brewster in Albert County named Nathaniel Brewster was the son of John Pierce Brewster, who had six sons - four of them came to Albert County. Their names were Nathaniel, William, Thomas, and Pierce. Two other sons- J
2 CONC ohn and Alexander went from (Goshen) to Ohio." 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:Margaret MORRISON
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth:ca 1742 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 M:Alexander BREWSTER
2 CONT
2 CONT 2 M:John BREWSTER
2 CONT
2 CONT 3 M:Nathaniel BREWSTER Birth:1764 1 Death:21 Apr 1836Hopewell, NB 1 Spouse:Ann PEARSON
2 CONT
2 CONT 4 F:Anna BREWSTER Birth:ca 1771Hopewell, NS 2 Spouse:Thomas PECK
2 CONT
2 CONT 5 M:Thomas BREWSTER Birth:ca 1774 1 Death:28 Oct 1832New Horton, Hopewell, Albert Co, NB 1 Spouse:Ruth WEST
2 CONT
2 CONT 6 M:Capt. William BREWSTER Birth:1775 1 Death:12 Jan 1819At Sea 1 Spouse:Ann PINEO Marriage:1797 1 Spouse:Emeline READ
2 CONT
2 CONT 7 M:Pierce BREWSTER Birth:1777 1 Death:29 Jan 1851 1 Spouse:Temperance ROBINSON Marriage:11 Feb 1807 1
2 CONT
2 CONT 8 F:Margaret BREWSTER Birth:1779Germantown, Hopewell, NB 1 Death:19 Aug 1830Harvey Bank, Westmoreland, NB 1 Spouse:Samuel WEST Marriage:ca 1800Hopewell, NB 1
2 CONT
