1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Eaton-627
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph was born in 1664. He was the son of Joseph Bassett and Mary Lapham. He passed away in 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT The will of Joseph Bassett of Bridgewater, husbandman, was dated 12 Jan 1735/6 and proved 7 Feb 1736/7. The will names his oldest daughter Bethia Bassett; 2nd daughter Mehetebell Holloway of Middleboro; 34d daughter Lydia Phillips
2 CONC  of Norton. Bethia was named executor. The inventory says he died 8 Nov 1736.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Bethiah Eaton was born about 1668, daughter of Samuel and Martha (Billington) Eaton. She died before 12 Jan 1735/6 (husband's will).[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 5 Nov 1691 in Taunton, Massachusetts, Joseph Bassett,[2] s/o Joseph and Mary (Lapham) Bassett.[3][4][1]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Bassett’s will names the three daughters: 
2 CONT #oldest, Bethia Bassett (named executor); married William Coddington 
2 CONT #2nd Mehetebell Holloway of Middleboro; married Nathaniel Holloway 
2 CONT #3rd Lydia Phillips of Norton; married Samuel Phillips 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
