2 CONT She was the wife of Daniel Whittemore, Jr. Lydia died in 1755 and Daniel died in 1756, so she could not have married Samuel Phillips in 1727.  Samuel Phillips was married to Lydia Bassett daughter of Joseph Bassett and Bethiah Eat
2 CONC on.  Lydia and Daniel started having children in 1690 with the last one born in 1715.
