2 CONT ===Notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ebenezer and Rebecca (Jeffries) Wentworth had children … 97. Samuel, born 15 November 1714; married ''Rebecca, daughter of James and Rebecca (Lloyd) Oliver, of Boston Mass''.  She was granddaughter of Nathaniel Oliver (born 1652),
2 CONC  who married Elizabeth, daughter of Capt. Thomas Brattle. Samuel removed from Portsmouth to Merrimack, N.H. about 1771, where he died childless aged about 70. His widow (as such appears in deed 17 July 1789) married a Simpson, of 
2 CONC Merrimack, who died suddenly while on a visit to Portsmouth.[1]
2 CONT
