1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Brattle Oliver, son of Nathaniel Oliver (d. 1704) and Elizabeth Brattle, was born 1 June 1689 at Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts, and died there in 1736.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Ann Gillam 11 Mar 1714 at Boston. Ann was born 7 November 1693 in Boston, the daughter of Benjamin Gillam (d. 1706) and his wife Abigail.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brattle Oliver and Ann Gillam had two children:
2 CONT # Anna Oliver  b. 18 Nov 1715 Boston, MA, chr 20 Nov 1715 Boston, MA ; m. Jonathan Lowder (1713-1769) on 23 June 1736.  They had 5 children.
2 CONT # Edward Brattle Oliver b. 20 Nov 1719, Boston, MA d. 3 Apr 1797, Boston, MA, m. Ann Hubbard (1721-) on  8 Aug 1745 Boston They had one child Hubbard Oliver (1745-1819).  He m. 2nd to Esther Parkman (1726- ) on 17 March 1747.  The
2 CONC y had 7 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
