2 CONT * [http://arcade.nyarc.org/record=b1080334~S7 Frick Art Reference Library]  '''Martha Fitch''' (September 25, 1704 - March 6, 1763), born in Boston, was the daughter of Col. Thomas Fitch. Her first husband was James Allen. After h
2 CONC is death, she married in 1755, as his second wife, William Brattle (1702-1776). He was a preacher, lawyer, and physician, a major general of militia, a loyalist, and friend of General Gage. He embarked with the British troops for 
2 CONC Halifax in 1776. Martha Fitch Allen Brattle had no children.
