2 CONT *History and Genealogy of the Families of Old Fairfield, Volume 1 edited by Donald Lines Jacobus  [https://books.google.com/books?id=5xYVpaBmRnEC&lpg=PA191&ots=m6RQCr66Pc&dq=John%20Mico%20mary%20brattle&pg=PA191#v=onepage&q=John%2
2 CONC 0Mico%20mary%20brattle&f=false page 191] "John Mico m at Boston, 20 Aug 1689, Mary Brattle."
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Mico-15
