1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Child of MARY LEGG and EDWARD BRATTLE is: 
2 CONT
2 CONT i.	 	MARY4 BRATTLE, b. February 24, 1694/95, Marblehead, Essex Co., Massachusetts; d. Unknown.  Mary, who married, March 20, 1712, James Smith, merchant of Boston, and probably died without issue before her father, as he does not 
2 CONC name her or any child of hers in his will.
