2 CONC ry of Framingham, Massachusetts Author: William Barry Publication: Boston: J. Munroe and Co., 1847 Repository:  Note: HeritageQuest Online via Dover Public Library or NEHGS Media: Book Page: p. 266, Genealogical Register, GRAVES T
