1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Anna Shepard
2 CONT *Gender: Female 
2 CONT *Birth: 8 September 1663, Charlestown, Suffolk, Massachusetts 
2 CONT *Christening: 13 July 1663, Charlestown, Suffolk, Massachusetts 
2 CONT *Death: 24 July 1708 Quincy, Norfolk, Massachusetts 
2 CONT *Parents: Thomas Shepard   &  Anna Tyng
2 CONT *Spouses: 1)  Daniel Quincy ;[twin] Marriage 8 November 1682 Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts 2) Moses Fiske 
2 CONT
2 CONT Ancestor of John Quincy Adams 6th US President.
2 CONT
2 CONT "Anna Shepard, daughter of Rev. Thomas and Anna (Tyng) Shepard of Charlestown, was born September 8, 1663. She married November 8, 1682 at Boston to Daniel Quincy, who died August 10, 1690. She married 2nd on January 7, 1700 to Re
2 CONC v. Moses Fiske of Braintree as his 2nd wife. She died July 24, 1708 and is buried beside her 2nd husband in the Hancock Cemetery, Quincy, Massachusetts."
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Children 
2 CONT # Ann Quincy - 1 Jun 1685/John Holman 
2 CONT # John Quincy - 21 Jul 1689/Elizabeth Norton
2 CONT # Shepard Fiske-Dr.-19 Apr 1704-14 Jun 1779/Patience Alger
2 CONT # Margaret Fiske-16 Dec 1705/Nathan Bucknam
2 CONT
2 CONT
