2 CONT *Diary of Samuel Sewall. 1674-1729. v. 1 [-3] by Sewall, Samuel, 1652-1730 [https://archive.org/stream/diaryofsamuelsew01sewaiala#page/134/mode/2up/ page 135] Thursday, May 6, 1686.  "Mr. Wharton buried a child since our going ...
