1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mehitable "Elizabeth" (Fuller) Sweetland was born in about 1692. She was the daughter of Jonathan Fuller and Mary (Stevens) Fuller. She married John Sweetland Junior on April 30, 1716 in Attleboro, Bristol, Massach
2 CONC usetts Bay. Together, they were the parents of John Sweetland, Mehitable Sweetland, Rebecca Sweetland, Esther Sweetland, and William Sweetland. She passed away in about 1752.
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
