2 CONT 12 December 1760–3 September 1856
2 CONT  •
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Stephen
2 CONT When Stephen Sweetland was born on 12 December 1760, in Attleboro, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Samuel Sweetland, was 49 and his mother, Esther Robbins, was 45. He married Mabel Hayden a
2 CONC bout 1789, in Cushing, Knox, Maine, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. He lived in Hope, Waldo, Maine, United States in 1850. He died on 3 September 1856, in Hope, Knox, Maine, United States, 
2 CONC at the age of 95, and was buried in Hope Grove Cemetery, Hope, Knox, Maine, United States.
2 CONT
