2 CONT *"Massachusetts, Town Clerk, Vital and Town Records, 1626-2001," database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:Q29P-9N5K : 3 November 2017), Thomas in entry for Samuell Woodburie, 07 May 1689; citing 
2 CONC Birth, Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts, United States, , town clerk offices, Massachusetts; FHL microfilm 864,850
2 CONT * https://www.familysearch.org/tree/person/family/LZDG-VSH
2 CONT *"Massachusetts, Town Clerk, Vital and Town Records, 1626-2001", database with images, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:Q29L-ZK3V : 10 February 2018), Thomas J Woodberry in entry for Kesia Woodberry, 1691.
