2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Lovett-952
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Lovett''' was born about 1667 in Beverly, Massachusetts.  He was christened on 1 March 1668 at Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America[1]. Son of John Lovett and Bethia Rootes.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Mary Pride. Town records of Beverly name their 9 children as Mary, Hannah, Jane, Josiah, Abigail, Joanna, Bethiah, Sarah and John.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Mary, 1695-1766, m. John Cressey?
2 CONT # Hannah, 1697
2 CONT # Jane, 1700-1745, m. Barnabas Rayment (1701-1735)
2 CONT # Josiah Lovett Sr. (1704-1774)
2 CONT # Abigail, 1709-?
2 CONT # Joanna, 1698-1745, m. Caleb Coy (1666-)?
2 CONT # Bethiah (Lovett) Balch (bef.1707-1745)
2 CONT # Sarah, 1710-?
2 CONT # John Lovett (1718-1797)
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Entry of "[151] [1668] 31: 3m." reports, "The 31: 3: 1668 were Baptized, Symon, John and Susanna, sonns & daughter of John Lovet jur by Bethia [Rootes] his wife ...."[1]
2 CONT
