1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Peter Shaw was christened on 29 Jun 1681. Father's name is William per the Christening Record.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Bethia Lovett, daughter of John Lovett & Bethia Roote, in 1705.  She married second to Nehemiah Hayward, Ruth Clarke’s widower.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jemima Woodbury, daughter of Isaac & Elizabeth (Herrick) Woodbury, married Peter Shaw (son of Peter Shaw and Bethia Lovett) at Ipswich. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Comments 
2 CONT
2 CONT Also seen as son of https://www.geni.com/people/Peter-Shaw/6000000003779616621 
