2 CONT Rachel (Rayment) Bradford (1659 - bef. 1697)
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel Bradford formerly Rayment aka Raymond
2 CONT Born 14 Feb 1659 in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Daughter of John Rayment and Rachel (Scruggs) Rayment
2 CONT Sister of John Rayment, Thomas Raymond, Bethia Raymond, Abigail Raymond, Eliza Raymond, Abigail Raymond, Jonathan Rayment, Nathaniel Raymond [half] and Benjamin Rayment [half]
2 CONT Wife of William Bradford — married 14 Nov 1676 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of Abigail (Bradford) Deland, Rachel Bradford, William Bradford, John Bradford, Bethia (Bradford) Howard and Rebecca Bradford
2 CONT Died before 1 Feb 1697 before age 37 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts Baymap
