2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel was born Salem, 14 : 12 m : 1659 [14 February 1659],[1][2] She was baptized Beverly, 13 November 1670.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel married at Beverly ,14 November 1676, William Bradford[4] of Beverly .[5][6]
2 CONT
2 CONT Rachel (Rayment) Bradford died, probably Beverly, before 1 February 1696/7, for on that date, her father John Rayment senr, yeoman, deeded "for & in consideration of mine own love & affection unto my son in law william Bradford" o
2 CONC f Beverly, husbandman, "& ye love I bear unto the chilldren of his by his former wife my Daughter Ratchell," a twenty acre parcel of "Upland & swamp Ground situate ... in ye Township of Beverly" and "one Mare & two Cows & some oth
2 CONC er moveable goods of mine," which are already in his possession.[7][8][9]
2 CONT
2 CONT William Bradford married again, Jane (Allison) Shaw, daughter of Ralph and Anne (Dixon) Allison and widow of Peter Shaw of Scarborough, Maine and Beverly. William Bradford died 15 Jun 1717, aged about 78.[10]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT William Bradford and his wife Rachel, were the parents of seven children, all recorded Beverly,
2 CONT
