2 CONT William Bradford (bef. 1686 - 1761)
2 CONT
2 CONT William Bradford
2 CONT Born before 3 Oct 1686 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of William Bradford and Rachel (Rayment) Bradford
2 CONT Brother of Abigail (Bradford) Deland, Rachel Bradford, John Bradford, Bethia (Bradford) Howard and Rebecca Bradford
2 CONT Husband of Grace (Elliot) Bradford — married 23 Dec 1707 in Beverly, Essex, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Robert Bradford, Mercy (Bradford) Gage, Rachel (Bradford) Dresser, William Bradford, Samuel Bradford, Patience Bradford, Bethiah Bradford and Lucy (Bradford) Wilkins
2 CONT Died 9 Mar 1761 after age 74 in Middleton, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Scott Prentice private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 17 Feb 2021 | Created 22 Dec 2014
2 CONT This page has been accessed 887 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT William was baptized on 3 Oct 1686 in Beverly, Massachusetts, the son of William Bradford and Rachel Rayment. He married, in 1707 at Beverly, Massachusetts, to Grace Elliot. They moved from Beverly to Boxford between 1720 and 1723
2 CONC . He passed away in 1761 in Middleton, Essex, Massachusetts. Descendants of this family lived in New Hampshire.
2 CONT
2 CONT His father may be half 3rd cousin of Mayflower descendant William Bradford (1655-1687) . The families are frequently confused. [Unsourced]
2 CONT
