2 CONT ----
2 CONT ===Older notes 
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: there ate at least two Abigail Bradford Mayflower descendants.  Abigail Bradford (above), b. 5 September, 1682, in Beverly, Essex, Massachusetts (daughter of William Bradford, III and Rebecca Sampson), [NO]  and Abigail Brad
2 CONC ford, b. 24 September, 1728, Duxbury, (daughter of Gamaliel Bradford and Abigail Bartlett, both of whom were Mayflower descendants). The parents of Gamaliel were Samuel Bradford (b. 1667, Plymouth) and Hannah Rogers (b. 1668, Duxb
2 CONC ury).
