2 CONC ;—(34) Maltiah, Melatiah, or Malatiah,3[†] b. Oct. 4, 1693;—(35) Timothy,3[†] b. Oct. 19, 1695;—(36) Hannah, or Harmah,3 b. May 7, 1698;—(37) Solomon,3 b. 1704.
