2 CONT John Linnell (1671 - 1747)
2 CONT
2 CONT John Linnell
2 CONT Born 1671 in Barnstable, Plymouth Colonymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of David Linnell and Hannah (Shelley) Linnell
2 CONT Brother of Samuel Linnell, Elisha Linnell, Experience (Linnell) Hatch, Hannah (Linnell) Davis, Abigail (Linnell) Jones, Mary (Linnell) Sargent, Jonathan Linnell and Susanna (Linnell) Phinney
2 CONT Husband of Ruth (Davis) Linnell — married 1696 in Barnstable, Barnstable, MAmap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Father of Thankful (Linnell) Bearse, Samuel Linnell, John Linnell, Bethia (Linnell) Bearse, Joseph Linnell, Hannah Linnell and Jabez Linnell
2 CONT Died 9 Feb 1747 at about age 76 in Barnstable, Barnstable, Province of Massachusetts Baymap
