2 CONT John Davis married Hannah Linnell March 15, 1648/49 in Nausett, MA.;  daughter of Robert Lynell and Jemimah House. She was born April 17,1625 in London, England and died l70l in Barnstable, Mass., had 12 children in Horsemonden, E
