2 CONC al and Town Records, 1626-2001," database with images, FamilySearch : 13 July 2016, Barnstable > Barnstable > Town records 1640-1774 vol 1-2 > image 268 of 663; town clerk offices, Massachusetts. Barnstable Town Records Vol. 1:407
