2 CONC ible] Janury 1720 ↑ 6.0 6.1 6.2 6.3 Baker, Peggy M. (revised by) Originally compiled by Alice W. A. Westgate and revised by Ann T Reeves 2000. Mayflower Families Through Five Generations: Descendants of the Pilgrims who landed at 
