1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Joseph Swetland=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1762
2 CONT * DEATH 1814
2 CONT
2 CONT When Joseph Swetland was born in 1762, in Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Israel Swetland, was 26 and his mother, Dorcas Dewey, was 24. He married Rebecca Mix in 1794, in Groton, Groton, Tompkins, New Yor
2 CONC k, United States. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 6 daughters. He died in 1814, in Cleveland, Cuyahoga, Ohio, United States, at the age of 52.
2 CONT
