1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Amos Thurston was born on 30 Dec 1769 in Sharon, Litchfield, Connecticut, USA as the fourth child of Amos Thurston and Mary Sweatland. He had seven siblings, namely: Rowland Sweatland, Sally, Mary, Emily, Sybel, Ir
2 CONC a, and Jerusha. He died on 21 Jul 1852 in Norwich, Chenango, New York, USA. When he was 26, He married Lucy Dart in Nov 1796.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was employed as a Farmer. He was affiliated with the Episcopal church religion. He lived in Chenango, New York, United States in 1840. He lived in Norwich, Chenango, New York in 1850. He was buried in 1852 in Norwich, Chenango,
2 CONC  New York, USA (Norwich Quarter Cemetery).
2 CONT
2 CONT Amos Thurston and Lucy Dart had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT Allen Thurston was born on 27 Oct 1797 in Norwich, Chenango, New York, USA. He died on 22 Aug 1851 in Preston, Wayne, Pennsylvania, USA. Sally Thurston was born on 09 Jan 1799. Gaines Thurston was born on 01 Dec 1800. Washington T
2 CONC hurston was born on 02 Jun 1802. He died on 02 Nov 1815. Lucinda Thurston was born on 07 Apr 1806. She died on 05 Mar 1833. Mary Thurston was born on 17 Apr 1808. William Thurston was born on 18 Dec 1809. Inscription: Age 82
