1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Eunice Rood Youngs / Day=
2 CONT * BIRTH 23 Jun 1734 Lisbon, New London County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 13 Aug 1806 (aged 72) Vermont, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL North Royalton Cemetery, North Royalton, Windsor County, Vermont, USA
2 CONT * PLOT section 1, row 3, #5
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 39173563 photos added by Sarah Pullen
2 CONT
2 CONT When Eunice Rood was born on 23 June 1734, in Lisbon, New London, Connecticut, United States, her father, Jabez Rood, was 40 and her mother, Mehitable Standish, was 41.  She married Ebenezer Youngs on 24 January 1753, in Hebron, T
2 CONC olland, Connecticut, United States. Son of Joseph Young and Mary?.    They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter.  She married 2nd on 09 May 1764 Hebron, Connecticut to Benjamin Day.  Son of Benjamin Day and Margaret F
2 CONC oote.  She died on 13 August 1806, in Royalton, Windsor, Vermont, United States, at the age of 72, and was buried in North Royalton, Royalton, Windsor, Vermont, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT Her duty finish’d to mankind
2 CONT To God her spirit she resign’d.
2 CONT
