2 CONT ==content to clean up==
2 CONT From "LOLADENN1": The Hallett family records refer to their daughter who married Richard Curtis as '''Ann''' or '''Anna''' Hallett, but the Curtis family records refer to her as '''Lydia''' Hallett. Some records also refer to her 
2 CONC as Lydia or Anna Hollett. Since there are no records that would indicate that Richard Curtis married more than once, it can be assumed that either Anna or Lydia is the Christian name and the other a nickname. Richard refers to his
2 CONC  wife as Lydia and states that she is the mother of his children, but marriage records list her as Ann. 
2 CONT
