2 CONT *Birth:	July 7 1650 - Dorchester, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America
2 CONT *Death:	Sep 17 1690 - Milton, Suffolk {Norfolk County after 26 Mar 1793], Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America
2 CONT *Parents:	Robert Babcock, Joanna Phillips
2 CONT *Wife:	Hannah Eames
2 CONT *Children:  Josiah Babcock, Sarah Babcock, Lydia Babcock, Hannah Vose (born Babcock), James Babcock, Mary Vose (born Babcock), Mary Babcock, John Babcock, Elizebeth Sumner (born Babcock), Robert Babcock, Samuel Babcock, Jr., Willi
2 CONC am Badcock
2 CONT
