2 CONT
2 CONT # Elizabeth Moore, born 20 Jul 1679,[4] married Daniel Edwards and had 7 children[3]
2 CONT # Experience Moore, born 12 May 1680[4]
2 CONT # Martha Moore, born 22 Feb 1681[4]
2 CONT # Joshua Moore, born 1683, died 1756, married Dorothy Badcock[3]
2 CONT # William Moore, born 1685, died unmarried 23 Jan 1700[3][8]
2 CONT # Abigail Moore, born 1687, died 1719, married Caleb Badcock[3]
2 CONT # His first wife Mary died 3 Apr 1700 in Windham, CT.[8]
2 CONT
