2 CONT
2 CONT Ebenezer Sprague was born on 12 Dec 1711 in Lebanon, New London Co., CT. (158) He died afte r 1771.(320)
2 CONT
2 CONT "Sprague Families in America", by W. V. Sprague, page 28. Ebenezer Sprague moved to Sharon, CT. in 1739. In the French and Indian War he served as foll ows: enlisted April 16, 1759; disc. Dec. 14, 1759, 1st Regt. with Co., of Capt
2 CONC . Brainard of W indsor. In 1st Regt., 9th Co., of Capt. Walcott of Windsor, 1761.
2 CONT
2 CONT He was married to Elizabeth Thatcher (daughter of Rudolphus (Ralph) Thatcher and Patience Ski ff) on 12 Dec 1734 in Lebanon, New London Co., CT. Elizabeth Thatcher died on 28 Feb 1744 i n Sharon, Litchfield Co., CT.
