1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ae 90 [he was born 30 April 1716 in Lebanon, Connecticut. He married 13 Feb 1745/1746 in Sharon, Connecticut to Lydia Barrows. they had 7 children: Thomas, Lydia, Sarah, Elizabeth, Hulda, Sybil and Jonathan. Lydia 
2 CONC died in 1767 and Jonathan married 2nd Mary Chamberlain on the 4th of March, 1773.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan was a member of Captain Walcott's 9th company in the Campaign of 1761 in the French and Indian Wars. His last will and testament is dated 13 Dec 1782 in Sharon, Connecticut. He lists his "dutiful wife Mary" and all 7 of h
2 CONC is children. -courtesy of B. Stoddard]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:
2 CONT * Thomas Sprague b: 24 FEB 1747 d: 1 FEB 1813 + Prudence Eggleston b: 19 AUG 1745 d: 1 FEB 1813
2 CONT * Jonathan Sprague b: 9 APR 1766 d: 6 FEB 1837 + Sarah Tousley b: 17 JUN 1774 d: 10 AUG 1842
2 CONT * Lydia Sprague b: 5 JAN 1751 d: WFT Est. 1778-1845 + John Heath b: 20 APR 1742 d: WFT Est. 1777-1833
2 CONT * Sarah Sprague b: 14 MAR 1754 + Samuel Landon b: ABT. 1752
2 CONT * Elizabeth Sprague b: 26 MAR 1756 + Isaac Chamberlain b: 29 OCT 1756 d: 14 JUL 1833
2 CONT * Huldah Sprague b: 26 JAN 1759 d: 6 MAR 1846 + Isaac Chamberlain b: 29 OCT 1756 d: 14 JUL 1833
2 CONT * Sibble Sprague b: 26 DEC 1762 + Enoch Wood b: ABT. 1760
2 CONT
2 CONT -courtesy James Smith]
