2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Alice HAND was born 2 Jan 1671 at East Hampton, Suffolk, New York and died Aft 1709 Saybrook, New Haven, CT She was married 26 Nov 1690 at Guilford, New Haven, Connecticut to William SHIPMAN who was born 6 Jun 1656 at Old Saybr
2 CONC ook, Middlesex, Connecticut and died 9 Sep 1725 at Saybrook, New Haven, Connecticut. He was the son of Edward SHIPMAN born Abt 1625 at Hull, Yorkshire, England and Elizabeth COMSTOCK born Abt 1631 Cumstock, Devonshire, England. Th
2 CONC e Shipman(s)  were residents of Saybrook, Middlesex, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT William  SHIPMAN and Alice HAND SHIPMAN had 12 children.	
