2 CONC toduplicationService, 1984 Microfilm made of typescript (55 leaves) prepared in 1961 (?) by Marjorie Oulton Calkin Sherling, Long Island City, New York. -- Caption title. Hugh Calkin (1600-1690) married Ann Eaton, and immigrated f
2 CONC rom England to Norwich, Connecticut. John Calkin (1693-1776), a direct descen- dant, married Catherine Foster and immigrated to Nova Scotia. Their son, Ezekiel Calkin (b.1728), immigrated from Connecticut to New Brunswick, and mar
2 CONC ried twice. Descendants and relatives lived in Nova Scotia, New Brunswick, Prince Edward Island and elsewhere. Some descendants immigrated to New England, New York, Michigan, California and elsewhere.
