2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Parents were Josiah Closson born 1655 in Little Compton, Rhode Island died 13 Feb 1699 in Little Compton, Rhode Island and Mary Williamson born 7 July 1654 in Marshfieled, Plymouth, Massachusetts and died between 1721-1726 in Litt
2 CONC le Compton, Rhode Island. Josiah and Mary were married 10 March 1679 in Plymouth, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Nehemiah was Christened May 25, 1718 in Congregational Church Of Little Compton. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: Sarah born 30 November 1710; baptism May 25, 1718 Ruth born 9 November 1712;baptism May 25, 1718  John born 11 February 1713/1714; baptism May 25, 1718 Lydia born 28 April 1715; baptism May 25, 1718 Mary born 7 April 171
2 CONC 7;baptism May 25, 1718 Nathan born 10 March 1719/1720 Hannah born 15 July 1721 Elizabeth Closson born 20 June 1722 died 27 Feb 1725 Elizabeth born 9 June 1727 Mercy born abt 1728 died young
2 CONT
2 CONT Will dated Dec 10, 1770 AD Filed Feb 1774 Probated thru May 12, 1778
