1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Probably not the son of https://www.geni.com/people/John-Lewis-of-Lynn/6000000015343432098?through=6000000002314938100
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Lewes-173
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin Lewes's birth is unrecorded. Otis claims he was the son of Thomas Lewes, son of George Lewes of Barnstable, without documentation.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin died September 6, 1752 in Colchester, CT and is buried in Westchester Cemetery.[2][3]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sources
