2 CONT #  Find A Grave, database and images (https://www.findagrave.com : accessed 12 September 2018), memorial page for Benjamin Lewis (1674–6 Sep 1752), Find A Grave Memorial no. 7139499, citing Westchester Cemetery, Westchester, New L
