2 CONT William Bassett Sr. migrated to New England during the Puritan Great Migration (1620-1640).
2 CONT
2 CONT NOTE: This William Bassett is distinct from William Bassett of New Haven, Connecticut who married Hannah Ives Dickerman).
2 CONT
2 CONT He is also distinct from the William Bassett of Lynn, MA who was about the same age and who arrived 1635 on the Abigail and married Sarah Hood(?).
