2 CONC s a "widow" when he witnessed Thomas's Will 1 Oct 1651. Her first husband was Thomas Lapham, who died 15 Jun 1648. Thomas was servant of Nathaniel Tilden. Mary was pregnant with Joseph Lapham at the time Thomas died. After Thomas 
2 CONC Lapham's death, Mary married William Bassett, Fortune Passenger, 1621. Birth date shown is Christening Date.
