2 CONT 276, Grand Rapids Library William Bassett - Until his death in 1667 he held a position for which his birth and talents befitted him, and was close in the councils of the dignitaries of the colony.  He was three times married, his 
2 CONC third wife, Elizabeth Tilden, and he was the father of the following children: William; Elizabeth; Nathaniel; Joseph; Sarah; and Jane. (From Steven Bassett)
