2 CONT # Sarah Bassett+ b. 1630, d. 1711
2 CONT # Ruth Bassett b. c 1634
2 CONT # Joseph Bassett+ b. 1635, d. 1712
2 CONT # Nathaniel Bassett (of Yarmouth)+ b. 1638, d. 16 Jan 1710
