2 CONT WILLIAM BASSETT was born in Plymouth in 1624, the son of William Bassett and his wife Elizabeth ________.  He was a resident of Duxbury and Sandwich.  He was a yeoman and innkeeper.  William Bassett married MARY RAINSFORD, daughte
2 CONC r of Edward and Mary Rainsford, of Boston, who was born 1 June 1632 and d. 12 April 1694 at Falmouth, Mass.  He died before 29 May 1670 and his widow was appointed administratrix of his estate.  She married (2) James Percival of S
2 CONC andwich.
