2 CONT Children: Nathaniel Bassett Jr, Mary Bassett Mulford, Sarah Bassett Nickerson Rogers, Joseph Bassett, Nathan Bassett, and William Bassett(whose second wife was Sarah Jenkins Bassett).
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT On the 2nd of March, 1651/2, Nathaniell Bassett and Joseph Prior, for disturbing the church of Duxburron on the Lord's day, were sentenced each of them to pay a fine of twenty shillings or to be bound to a post for the space of tw
2 CONC o hours, in some public place, with a paper on their heads on which their capitol crime would be written. 
2 CONT
