2 CONT
2 CONT Mehetabel Basset was born June 22d Ano Dom 1697 and died before 25 May 1754, on which date her husband Nathaniel remarried Abiah (Crane) Babbitt.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mehatabel Bassitt, of Bridgewater, married (by Benjamin Ruggles) at Middleboro, Massachusetts 20 Jun 1733 Nathaniel Holloway fo Middleborough, (c 1702-bef. 1757).
2 CONT
2 CONT Mehitable and Nathaniel had no children. Nathaniel had two children by his second wife, who were called his only heirs.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT 5th Generation descendant of John Billington and 4th generation descandant of Francis Eaton.
