2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Basset-601
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Basset was born April 29 y Anno Dom 1703 And Died after 17 May 1764 in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Samuel PHILLIPS 17 Nov 1726 at Bridgewater.
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Phillips was born at Taunton on 10 Feb 1697 (VR 1:335), and died after 23 Apr 1771 (deed), the son of James and Elizabeth (French) Phillips. He married Lydia BASSETT 17 Nov 1726 at Bridgewater.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Daniel abt 1726, m. (1) Elizabeth Fisher, m. (2) Rachel Lincoln
2 CONT # Joseph abt 1727
2 CONT # Lydia (Phillips) Wetherell (abt.1735-1826)
2 CONT
