2 CONC ied (Patience Reed, March 15, 1722, (2) Abigail Wooley, June 5, 1746; he died March 31, 1783. iii. Joseph, b. in 1698, ra. Ruth Eustis, April 30,1724; d. 1736, iv. Benjamin, b. in 1700; married Sarah Kendall, of Chelsea, Mass., De
2 CONC c. 10,1723. v. Elias, b. in 1702; married Rhoda Holt, Nov. 13, 1728, of Andover, Mass. ^ he died at Concord, N. H., Dec. 29, 1793,88.90; [See Boston Columbian Centinel]; children: (a) Rhoda, b. Aug^ 18,1729; m. Reuben Abbot; died 
2 CONC Jan. 27,1735; he of Concord; (b) Elias, b. Jan. 23,1731, d. Dec.27, 1736; (c) mmothv, b. March 14, 1733, d. Dec. 3, 1736; (d) Rachel, b. Aug. 17, 1735; m. -^— Coburn; vi. Patience, b. in 1704, m. Timothy Lamson. vii. David, b. Apr
2 CONC il 16,1706; m. (1) Alice Kendall, of Boston, not of Bedford, Mass., as stated, ante
