2 CONT        Benjamin  4. Son of John (3), born in 1700; died at Chelsea, Mass. Issue,  i. Benjamin, b. Oct. 9, 1724. ii. Esther, b. Oct. 5, 1729. iii. Phoebe, b.Feb. 6,1731. iv. Rebecca, b. June 16,1734. v. Abraham, b. March 7, 1736. v
2 CONC i. Amos, b. Feb. 26, 1738. The father was chosen collector of taxes and constable for Rumney Marsh, for several years.
