2 CONT Brother of John Whittemore Jr, Jeremiah Whittemore, Benjamin Whittemore, Elias Whittemore, Ruth (Whittemore) Thompson, David Whittemore, Deborah (Whittemore) Gleason and Pelatiah Whittemore
2 CONT Husband of Ruth (Eustis) Kendall — married 30 Apr 1724 (to 30 Dec 1735) in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
