2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT JOSEPH WHITTEMORE 1699-1735
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Whittemore was born about 1699 in Malden, Essex, Massachusetts, the son of John Whittemore 1665-1730 and Ruth BASSETT (Twin) Whittemore 1671-1760 of Middlesex, Massachusetts. Joseph was one of 10 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Father, John and Mother, Ruth BASSETT Whittemore:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 - John Whittemore 1694–1771
2 CONT 2 - Jeremiah Whittemore 1696–1783
2 CONT 3 - Joseph Whittemore 1699–1735
2 CONT 4 - Patience Whittemore 1701–
2 CONT 5 - Benjamin Whittemore 1701–
2 CONT 6 - Elias Whittemore 1703–1792
2 CONT 7 - Ruth Whittemore 1704–
2 CONT 8 - David Whittemore 1706–
2 CONT 9 - Deborah Whittemore 1708–1741
2 CONT 10 - Pelatiah Whittemore 1710–
2 CONT JOSEPH Whittemore married RUTH EUSTIS 1698-1765 on the 30th of April 1724 in Boston, Middlesex, Massachusetts. Ruth EUSTIS was the daughter of William Eustis 1659-1736 and Sarah CUTLER Eustis 1666-1748.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth EUSTIS and Joseph WHITTEMORE were the parents of 7 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 - Samuel Whittemore 26 Mar 1732
2 CONT 2 - Ruth Whittemore 19 Feb 1724/25
2 CONT 3 - Joseph Whittemore, JR 19 Nov 1726
2 CONT 4 - Hannah Whittemore 20 Sep 1728
2 CONT 5 - Abigail Whittemore 2 Aug 1730
2 CONT 6 - Mary Whittemore 6 Feb 1733/34
2 CONT 7 - Nathan Whittemore 16 Sep 1735
2 CONT Sadly, Joseph Whittemore died at the young age of 36 on the 30th of December 1735 in Chelsea, Suffolk, Massachusetts and is buried in the Rumney Marsh Burial Ground in Revere, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, USA. Wife, Ruth EUSTIS 
2 CONC Whittemore remarried to Abraham Kendall and they were the Parents of a daughter, Elizabeth Kendall 1739–1784. Bio and research by 6th Great Granddaughter, Carole Anne Brown-44556 Whittemore on the 28th of September 2016.
2 CONT
