2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Bell was born on 15 November 1668, in Taunton, Plymouth Colony, British Colonial America, her father, James Bell, was 36 and her mother, Hesther Lugg, was 36. She married Samuel Crossman on 19 December 1689, in Taun
2 CONC ton, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. She died on 22 December 1695, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 27.
