1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/LC6R-7ZW/elizabeth-bell-crossman-1691-1752
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Bell Crossman
2 CONT Female
2 CONT 31 October 1691–11 May 1752
2 CONT •
2 CONT LC6R-7ZW
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth Bell
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Bell Crossman was born on 31 October 1691, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States, her father, Samuel Crossman, was 24 and her mother, Elizabeth Bell, was 22. She married John White Jr on 28 December 1709
2 CONC , in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. She died on 11 May 1752, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 60.
2 CONT
