2 CONT "Deacon John Briggs , Jun., is supposed to have been the son of William and Sarah (Macomber) Briggs,
2 CONT of Taunton; and was born 19th March, 1680. He was doubtless the same person who was sometimes
2 CONT called John Briggs, second and senior.  He probably lived in the easterly part of the town, and married,
2 CONT previous to 1713, Hannah Rocket. He may have been the man who married (for second wife?) Hannah
2 CONT Wetherell in 1721. His will was probated Aug. 26, 1756; and in it, he mentions eight children. We presume
2 CONT he was the John Briggs, second, who was deacon of the church."
