1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =John Ames=
2 CONT * BIRTH 14 Apr 1672 Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH Jan 1756 (aged 83) Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Old Graveyard, West Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA  Show Map
2 CONT * PLOT Section E marker #268 MEMORIAL ID 64971048 Photos by Chip5610
2 CONT
2 CONT John Ames was the eldest son born to John Ames and Sarah (Willis) Ames in Bridgewater, Plymouth Colony.  He and his youngest brother, David, moved to New London, Connecticut in 1696.  John married Sarah Washburn on 12 January 1697
2 CONC  in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Province of Massachusetts Bay. They had 9 known children. 
2 CONT
2 CONT John died in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Province of Massachusetts Bay. His will is dated 1755 and was proven in 1756. Inscription: MR. JOHN AMES Born at West Bridgewater April 14, 1672 Married Sarah Washburn Jan 12, 1697 Died Jan 1756
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT MR. JOHN AMES
2 CONT Born at West Bridgewater
2 CONT April 14, 1672
2 CONT Married Sarah Washburn
2 CONT Jan 12, 1697
2 CONT Died Jan 1756
2 CONT Family Members
