1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Sarah Washburn Ames=
2 CONT * BIRTH 1675
2 CONT * DEATH 1746 (aged 70–71)
2 CONT * BURIAL Old Graveyard West Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA  Show Map
2 CONT * PLOT Section E marker #269 MEMORIAL ID 64971062 by Chip5610 & Alan Howard
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah is a descendant of Mayflower passengers Francis Cooke and Hester Cooke and daughter of John Washburn 1620–1686 Elizabeth Mitchell 1629–1684.  It is presumed that she was born in Bridgewater, Plymouth Colony, Province of Mass
2 CONC achusetts Bay. as her family is living here at the time.  She married John Ames on 12 January 1697 Bridgewater, Plymouth, Province of Massachusetts Bay. They had 9 known children.  Sarah's death record has not been found. It is pr
2 CONC esumed that she died in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Province of Massachusetts Bay. 
2 CONT
