2 CONT Daniel was born in Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Province of Massachusetts Bay and married married Hannah Keith 01/28/1742 in Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Province of Massachusetts Bay by Rev. John Angier.  They had 7 children, s
2 CONC ons Timothy, Noah, Daniel, and Job were in the Revolutionary War.  He died of smallpox in Bridgewater, Plymouth county, Massachusetts, USA.  He is also a descendant of Mayflower passengers Francis Cooke and Hester Cooke
