1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Prior-878
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Bassett formerly Prior aka Pryer, Fobes, Eaton
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 21 Jan 1738 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Joseph Pryer and Ann (Moore) Pri­or
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Mary (Pryer) Latham
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Josiah Fobes Jr — married 6 Nov 1766 in Bridgewater, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Eaton — married 15 May 1780 in Middleborough, Plymouth, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Joseph Bassett Jr. — married 14 Jan 1798 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT [children unknown] Died 29 Sep 1839 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts, United States
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 3 Jul 2019 | Created 5 Jan 2015
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was born to Joseph Prior and Ann Moore. She was baptized on 21 January, 1738/39 in the East Parish of Bridgewater.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married Josiah Fobes, Jr. on 6 November 1766. He died in 1776.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah, as Sarah Fobes, married John Eaton of Middleborough on 15 May 1780.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah, as Sarah Eaton - widow of Greenwich, married Joseph Bassett on 14 January 1798 in Bridgewater. He died in 1803.
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: In memory of MRS. SARAH widow of Lieut. Joseph Bassett who died Sept. 29, 1839 in the 103d year of her age.
2 CONT
2 CONT Plymouth Colony and Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT From John Maltby: Lt. Joseph Bassett (Jr.), son of Joseph and Elisabeth (Ames) Bassett, had married Phebe Cushman, as his 1st wife, in 1756, but she died in 1796 and he remarried to Sarah (Pri­or) (Fobes) Eaton, daughter of Joseph
2 CONC  and Ann (Moore) Prior, and widow of Josiah Fobes (Jr.), of Bridgewater, and of John Eaton, of Greenwich, CT,[1] on 14 Jan. 1798 in Bridgewater.[2] Joseph died testate in 1803 in Bridgewater, and his will mentioned his wife Sarah.
2 CONC  Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ Mitchell, History of Bridgewater, pp. 112, 160, 280. ↑ Bridgewater VRs, Vol. 2, p. 43. http://famousancestry.info/writers/horatio-alger-author/ Find A Grave: Memorial #43917605 "Massachusetts, Compiled Marriages, 1633-1850" Mrs.
2 CONC  Sarah Eaton Spouse Joseph Bassett Marriage Date 14 Jan 1798 City Bridgewater County Plymouth Source Family History Library, Salt Lake City, UT, Film # 0164691. Sarah Pryer Event Type Marriage Marriage Date 6 Nov 1766 Marriage Pla
2 CONC ce Bridgewater, Massachusetts Spouse Name Josiah Fobes "Massachusetts, Town Birth Records, 1620-1850" Sarah Pryer Birth Date Jan 21, 1738 Birth Place Bridgewater Father's First Name Joseph Gender Female Source Vital Records of Bri
2 CONC dgewater "Massachusetts, Town and Vital Records, 1620-1988" Sarah Bassett Birth Date abt 1736 Death Date 29 Sep 1839 Death Place Bridgewater, Massachusetts Death Age 103 Spouse Name Joseph John A. Maltby Genealogies - Elisabeth Am
2 CONC es - child # 705
2 CONT
