2 CONT ## "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:FC35-2JR : 14 January 2020), Brattle Oliver in entry for Edward Brattle Oliver, Birth Date	20 Nov 1719.
