2 CONT
2 CONT Lancelot Oliver BIRTH	1704 Ireland DEATH	24 Jun 1781 (aged 76–77) Massachusetts, USA BURIAL	 Caldwell Cemetery Barre, Worcester County, Massachusetts, USA  MEMORIAL ID	99937824 · View Source
2 CONT
2 CONT MEMORIAL PHOTOS 2 FLOWERS 2
2 CONT
2 CONT Picture of  Added by Kim B Lancelot Oliver was born in Ireland, 1704. He came to Boston with a large group of Ulster Scots, about 1719. He married Mary Walker, 1741. Mary was a sister to William Walker of Worcester, MA. (See memor
2 CONC ial # 96771739) Mary Walker Oliver died 20 Aug 1788, and is buried at Chester, Hampden, MA. Lancelot had children William, Margaret, David, Robert, Alexander, Katherine, and James. Reference: "Immigrants to New England", p.148, by
2 CONC  E. S. Bolton.
2 CONT
2 CONT Please click the link below for Lancelot's wife Mary to read additional information about Lancelot and Mary, including an additional memorial for Lancelot in Ohio and a transcription of his Last Will and Testament. Research provid
2 CONC ed by Mary E. Warner (Findagrave contributor #47253369)
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Members Spouse Photo	 Mary Walker Oliver 1706–1788
2 CONT
2 CONT Children James Oliver 1741–1784
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 Alexander Oliver 1744–1828
2 CONT
2 CONT Photo	 David Oliver 1747–1821
2 CONT
2 CONT John Oliver 1755–1777
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription In Memory of Mr. Lanslot (Lancelot) Oliver who died June ye 24th 1781 in the 78th (?) year of his age
