2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Parnell Gray Parker Nowell 1602–1687
2 CONT Thomas Coytemore 1612–1644
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Rebecca Graves Adams 1630–1664
2 CONT Capt. John Graves 1633–1664
2 CONT William Graves
2 CONT Thomas Graves 1638–1697
2 CONT Nathaniel Graves 1639–1679 
2 CONT Susannah Graves Symmes 1643–1681
2 CONT Joseph Graves 1645–1689
2 CONT Thomas Greaves 1683–1747
