1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT ==comments==
2 CONT
2 CONT Not the son of [http://www.geni.com/people/Thomas-Gray/6000000000560132997?through=6000000010289508307 Thomas Gray] d 1607 & [http://www.geni.com/people/Katherine-Coytmore/6000000009815792814?through=6000000010289508307 Katherine 
2 CONC Myles].  Their only surviving son was Thomas:
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~amorrow/fg06/fg06_274.html
2 CONT
2 CONT From his will:  names wife Katherine, daughter of Robert Myles, brother-in-law Thomas Wyseman, son Thomas, daughters Susan, Parnell, Katherine (all u18). He gave his wife a life estate, remainder in fee tail to Thomas, to be divid
2 CONC ed among his daughters if Thomas had no lawful heirs. If they had no heirs either, it went to Katherine’s heirs.
