2 CONT Samuel married (2) Eunice TYNG daughter of Edward TYNG and Mary (Tyng) on Jul 29 1679. Eunice was born on Mar 8 1655 in Boston, Suffolk Co., Massachusetts. She died on Jan 14 1720 in Boston, Suffolk Co., Massachusetts. 
