1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Rev. Moses Fiske was born on 12 April 1642 in Wenham, Massachusetts and died on 10 August 1708 in Braintree (Quincy) at the age of 66.
2 CONT
2 CONT * Parents: son of Rev. John Fiske and Ann Gipps.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes
2 CONT * Moses Fiske graduated in 1662 from Harvard.1 He was ordained on 11 September 1672 at Braintree.2 
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT #  firstly Sarah Symmes, daughter of Capt. William Symmes and Mary Sparhawk, on 7 November 1672 at Charlestown there were 14 children of this marriage. (Also seen as 9 september 1671).3,4 
2 CONT # secondly Ann Shepard, daughter of Rev. Thomas Shepard and Anna (or Hannah) Tyng, on 7 January 1700/1.1,5 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Rev. Moses Fiske and Ann Shepard
2 CONT # Dr. Shephard Fiske6 b. 19 Apr 1703, d. 14 Jun 1779
2 CONT # Margaret Fiske6 b. 16 Dec 1705
2 CONT
