2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Oliver was born on 4 September 1696 at Cambridge, Middlesex, Massachusetts. She was the daughter of Dr.James Oliver and Mercy Bradstreet [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Oliver married Jacob Wendell, son of Johannes Wendell and Elizabeth Staats, on 12 August 1714 at Boston, Suffolk County, Massachusetts. [2] [3] [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Oliver died on 22 July 1762 at Boston, Suffolk County, Massachusetts, at age 65.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Oliver-3942
2 CONT
