2 CONT
2 CONT [sibling(s) unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Jacobus Wendell — married 12 Aug 1714 (to 7 Sep 1761) in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts [uncertain]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Jacob Wendell, Elizabeth (Wendell) Wibird, Mary Wendell, Sarah (Wendell) Hunt, Mercy (Wendell) Oliver, Katherine (Wendell) Cooper, John Micro Wendell, Ann Wendell, Oliver Wendell, Abraham Wendell, Susannah Wendell and Ma
