2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Mabel
2 CONT When Mabel Hayden was born on 12 October 1768, in Scituate, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, William Hayden, was 23 and her mother, Sarah Lydia Wade, was 26. She married Stephen Sweetland a
2 CONC bout 1789, in Cushing, Knox, Maine, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. She died on 20 January 1846, in Hope, Knox, Maine, United States, at the age of 77, and was buried in Hope Grove Cemetery
2 CONC , Hope, Knox, Maine, United States.
