2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT BORN 7 Feb 1703  BETHIA ROOT.   Woodbury, Litchfield, CT.
2 CONT Daughter of John and Dorcus Root (is this info is correct?) according to
2 CONT 'Root Genealogical Records 1600-1870' by Jas. Pierce Root.  (have)
