1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Randall-9175
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac Randall was probably born in England.[1] He married, perhaps at Beverly, Essex County, Massachusetts Bay Colony, before 1684,[2] Abigail Lovett. She was born, probably Mackerel Cove, then Salem, Essex County, after 27 May 16
2 CONC 59 (date sister of the same name died),[3] the daughter of John and Mary (_____) Lovett.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Isaac was of Beverly at the time of his death, before 23 April 1684, the date Robert Bradford and Paul Thorndike finalized the inventory of his estate. Isaac Randall's estate totaled £107 00s 06d and included £20 "sent to England,
2 CONC  now in sd Randall's sister's hands." In June, 1684, administration was granted to his widow, Abigail Randall.[5]
2 CONT
2 CONT There were no known children of Isaac's marriage to Abigail.
