1 NOTE {geni:about_me}  Mary Trask Dodge
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 24 Mar 1736 Beverly, Essex County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: 25 Apr 1812 Beverly, Essex County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Spouse:    William Dodge, b. Bapt: 2 Jan 1731 Beverly, Essex Co, Mass; d.  3 Jun 1810 Beverly, Essex Co, Mass
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Trask and William Dodge married August 1, 1764, soon after the death of William's first wife, Mary Baker.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary was the daughter of Edward Trask II and Abigail Lovett who married April 9, 1735 in Newbury, Essex, Massachusetts. Edward was born September 10, 1707 in Beverly to Edward Trask (son of the immigrant, Osmond, with his second w
2 CONC ife, Elizabeth Galley) and Mercy Elliot (daughter of Andrew Elliot II and granddaughter of Andrew Elliot I, both of which immigrated to Massachusetts from East Coker, Somerset, England with Osmond Trask). Abigail Lovett was born A
2 CONC ugust 28, 1709 in Beverly to John Lovett III and Mary Pride.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT * Abigail ''Dodge'', 1770–1849; m. Ebenezer Trask, 1769–1834
2 CONT * Joanna ''Dodge'', 1779–1836; m. Edward Trask, 1783–1856
2 CONT * Ezekiel Dodge, 1782–1869; m. Anna Cleaves, 1783–1866
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: North Beverly Cemetery Beverly, Essex County, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT
2 CONT Genealogy of the Dodge Family of Essex County, Mass. 1629-1894 – Joseph Thompson Dodge, pgs.33, 34
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/47848869/mary-dodge
