1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Lovett, daughter of Noah Lovett and Deborah Hodge, was born on 30 Jun 1739 at Norwich, New London, Connecticut, and died before 1813 at Genesee, New York, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Lovett married Isaac Newton, son of Isaac Newton and Sarah Fuller, on 19 April 1758 at East Windsor, Hartford, Connecticut.  He was born between 1732 and 1737 at Mansfield, Tolland, Connecticut, and died in 1812 in Batavia (
2 CONC town), Genesee, New York, United States.
2 CONT
2 CONT His WILL dated March 19, 1812 in Batavia mentions wife Sarah; sons Lemuel, Isaac, Joseph and John; daughters Martha Wheaton and Sarah Eddy.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT # 	Ruth Whitecotton (born Newton)
2 CONT # Ruth Newton
2 CONT # Sarah Eddy (born Newton)
2 CONT # Isaac Newton
2 CONT # Sarah Newton
2 CONT # Martha Newton
2 CONT # Amos Newton
2 CONT # John Newton
2 CONT # Lemuel Newton
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
