2 CONT Married 3 times
2 CONT
2 CONT *1) December 1, 1728 to Peter Shaw
2 CONT *2) November 14, 1774 to John Thompson
2 CONT *3) February 2,1777 to J. Poland
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Peter Shaw (son of Peter Shaw and Bethia Lovett) at Ipswich. Marriage intentions are dated 1 Dec 1728, and the marriage in church records took place 12 Jan 1728/9 - By Rev. Samuel Wigglesworth, Pastor in the Hamlet. [1
2 CONC ]
