2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Rachel (Small) Bradford — married after 1770 in Amherst, Hillsborough, New Hampshire
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Samuel Bradford, Patience (Bradford) Lovejoy, Mary (Bradford) Averill, Enos Bradford, Joseph Bradford, William Bradford, Huldah Bradford, Olive (Bradford) Boutell, Eunice (Bradford) Pettengill, Hannah (Bradford) Tuttle a
2 CONC nd Lambert Bradford
