2 CONC nd Interest in & unto all the Lands & Tenements to us belonging as we are the Children & only Heirs of Mr. Richard Rundal late of Cape Porpus Mariner viz One hundred Acres of Land at Kenebunk River or what ever was granted to the 
2 CONC sd Richard Rundal by the Town of Cape Porpus Jany 23d 1681 or at any other Time to him granted whether Lying at Kenebunk River or at Cape Porpus any other where ..."; witnessed by Sarah Sargent and Anna Bradstret; acknowledgment N
