2 CONT This Richard of Cape Porpus; no wife's name is given, but the two early children's births listed as:
2 CONT
2 CONT *Richard Randall, b. 6 Mar 1659 (he had no heirs in 1727)
2 CONT *Sarah Randall, b. 24 Mar 1661.
2 CONT *Dau. Priscilla is listed, but birthdate not given. Her date of birth can be reasonably determined as about 1666 by 1727 deposition (sourced separately).
2 CONT
2 CONT Reports about Sarah's marriage 1st to Joseph Cole, her captivity in Canada also her later marriage to Capt. Thomas West of Beverly. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Includes report that in 1727, sisters and widows, Sarah West and Priscilla Presbury were the "only heirs" of Richard Randall, "late of Cape Porpus." They then deeded a Cape Porpus town grant of 1681-2 to Edward and Stephen Presbur
2 CONC y of Newbury, shipwrights. 
2 CONT
