1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''''Bethiah Hopkins
2 CONT
2 CONT Added by Elwin Nickerson - 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Bibles State and Gavestones State my Great grandmothers Name As Bethiah-  
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Henry Atkins (1st)- and (2nd) Stephen Hopkins.Buried Family Lot Harwich
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT Added by Elwin Nickerson - My Great Grandmothers Name was spelled Bethiah- Not Bethia- 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family Bibles and Gravestones in Family Plots Spelled as Bethiah- 
2 CONT
2 CONT Spelled with tradition Bethiah Nickerson. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Their are some spellings as Bethia , but not in this case. 
2 CONT
