2 CONC Warner-Harrington 313; Barnstable Co. Prob. 2:52; Reg. 6:42; Atkins 233; Newcomb 20; Farwell (1929) 278; Sv. 1:73; Atkins 2; Cape Cod Lib 37:20; Linnell-Snow 18
