1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Sargent was the 2nd child of John 1639 Sargent and Deborah Hillier. He was b. Feb. 16,1664/5; married Mary Linnell (d. about 1755; dau. of David); res. in Malden and Reading, Mass., and Mansfield, Conn.; he d.
2 CONC  April 16,1755.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children were: John (1689), Sarah (1691/2), Mary (1694), Ruth (1697), Isaac (1699/1700), Jacob (1702), and John (1705).
2 CONT
2 CONT ***John Sargent and Deborah Hillier had 4 children: Joseph (1663), John (1664/5), Mary (1667), and Jabez (1669)
