1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Sargent-48
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth (Sargent) Hall (1696 - 1799)
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Hall formerly Sargent aka Sargeant
2 CONT Born 29 Mar 1696 in Malden, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Daughter of John Sargent and Mary (Linnell) Sargent
2 CONT Sister of John Sargent, Sarah Sargent, Mary (Sargent) Arnold, Isaac Sargent, Jacob (Sargent) Sargeant and John Sargent Jr
2 CONT Wife of Theophilus Hall — married 2 Mar 1719 in Mansfield, Windham, Connecticut Colonymap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of Mary Hall, Ruth (Hall) Freeman, Nathaniel Hall, Ann Hall, Mary Hall, Isaac Hall, Tabitha (Hall) Hanks and Azariah Hall
2 CONT Died 1799 at about age 102 in Mansfield, Windham, Connecticut, United Statesmap
2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Richard Draper private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 19 Feb 2024 | Created 12 Sep 2010
2 CONT This page has been accessed 692 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Sargeant or Sargent, daughter of John Sargeant or Sargent and Mary Sargeant or Sargent, was born on 29 Mar 1697 in Malden, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony.[1][2][3][4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Sargent and Theophilus Hall were married 2 Mar 1718/1719 in Tolland, Connecticut. Ruth was the daughter of (illegible) Sergeant and his wife Mary. Theophilus was the son of Lieut Wm Hall and Ester his wife.[5][6][7] Theophilu
2 CONC s Hall died 28 Aug 1747.[8]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Theophilus Hall and Mary: [9]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Hall b. 25 Feb 1721 d. 8 Dec 1726[10]
2 CONT Ruth Hall b. 28 Jul 1722[11]
2 CONT Nathaniel Hall b. 8 Feb 1723/4[12]
2 CONT Ann Hall b. 15 Apr 1726[13]
2 CONT Mary Hall b. 11 Mar 1727/8 d. 9 Jan 1754[14]
2 CONT Isaac Hall b. 30 Dec 1730[15]
2 CONT Tabitha Hall b. 9 Jun 1734[16]
2 CONT Azariah Hall b. 2 Apr 1737[17]
2 CONT Ruth was mentioned on a memorial in Olde Mansfield Center Cemetery, Mansfield, Tolland County, Connecticut, United States with a death date of 1799.[18]
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Although a family tree is not a reliable Pre-1700 source, the tree linked below may have additional reliable sources that could be used to improve this profile. Sands-1865 17:45, 19 September 2023 (UTC) These include:
2 CONT
2 CONT Hall, David Brainard. The Halls of New England Genealogical and Biographical (Joel Munsell's Sons, Albany, NY, 1883) p. 218 https://archive.org/details/hallsofnewenglan00hall/page/218/mode/2up where she is named as Ruth, daughter 
2 CONC of Ensign Jonathan Sargeant of Mansfield. No sources are cited.
2 CONT Sargent, Aaron; Sargent, John S. Sargent Genealogy (A. Sargent, 1895 Somerville, Massachusetts) p. 35 https://archive.org/details/sargentgenealog00unkngoog/page/n59/mode/1up where Ruth is identified as the daughter of John. Her fa
2 CONC ther John on page 33 is identified as the spouse of Mary Linnell; he was a resident of Malden and Redding, Massachusetts and Mansfield, Connecticut. No sources are cited.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
