2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan was born 04 Aug 1701 the son of Jonathan and Elizabeth Linnell[1]Source Text: "Jonathan Linnel the Son of Jonathan and Elizebeth Linnel was born at Eastham the fourth day of august: 1701".
