2 CONT Brief Life History of Thankful
2 CONT
2 CONT When Thankful Linnell was born on 12 November 1696, in Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts, United States, her father, John Linnell, was 27 and her mother, Ruth Davis, was 22. She married James Bearse on 12 November 1726, in Bar
2 CONC nstable, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 2 daughters. She died on 7 June 1759, in Centerville, Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 62
2 CONC , and was buried in Centerville, Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts, United States.
