2 CONT John Linnell (1702)
2 CONT
2 CONT John Linnell
2 CONT Born 15 Jun 1702 in Barnstable County, New Plymouth Colony, Massachusettsmap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Son of John Linnell and Ruth (Davis) Linnell
2 CONT Brother of Thankful (Linnell) Bearse, Samuel Linnell, Bethia (Linnell) Bearse, Joseph Linnell, Hannah Linnell and Jabez Linnell
2 CONT Husband of Mercy (Phinney) Linnell — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
