2 CONT PROBLEMS/QUESTIONSProfile manager: Jason Quick private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 7 Oct 2024 | Created 6 Sep 2020
2 CONT This page has been accessed 74 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT John Linell Jr. was born on June 15, 1702, son of John Linnel/Lynnell and Ruth Davis. [1] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT John married Mary/Mercy Phinney on October 24, 1734. [3] [2]
2 CONT
2 CONT In his father's will dated October 1, 1717, with a codicil dated July 5, 1748, he left son John 19 acres of upland marsh.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT He also is named a beneficiary in his mother Ruth's will dated March 24, 1747/48 and proved on July 5, 1748. [4]
2 CONT
