2 CONT
2 CONT Ebenezer Phinney Sr.
2 CONT Male
2 CONT 18 February 1673–10 April 1754
2 CONT •
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Ebenezer
2 CONT
2 CONT When Ebenezer Phinney Sr. was born on 18 February 1673, in Eastham, Barnstable, Plymouth Colony, British Colonial America, his father, John Phinney, was 34 and his mother, Mary Rogers, was 28. He married Susannah Linnell on 14 Nov
2 CONC ember 1695, in Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. He died on 10 April 1754, in Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, Br
