2 CONT BIRTH: "Barnstable, Mass. Vital Records," MAYFLOWER DESCENDANT, 11(1909):131 (FHL #974.4 D25md).
2 CONT
2 CONT MAR: Ibid, 11:132.
2 CONT
2 CONT DEATH: No death rec found in original source records. A death date of 10 Apr 1754 is found in Howard Finney, FINNEY-PHINNEY FAMILIES IN AMERICA (Richmond, VA, 1957), 5 (FHL #929.273 F497fh). However, this date must be incorrect in
2 CONC  light of Ebenezer's will and probate dates. See the will of Ebenezer Phinney of Barnstable, 26 Nov 1754, proved 10 Jan 1755, Barnstable Co. Probate, 9:122-24 (FHL #904602).
