2 CONT Mehitable Phinney was born on 14 August 1696 at Barnstable. She was the daughter of Ebenezer Phinney and Susanna Linnell. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mehitable Phinney married Samuel Higgins, son of Jonathan Higgins, on 9 October 1718 at Barnstable. Her married name was Higgins. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mehitable Phinney died on 28 May 1778 at Eastham at age 81. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Is a descendant of Pilgrim Thomas ROGERS. (see #33i).
