2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mehitable Phinney was born on 14 August 1696 in Barnstable, Barnstable, Province of Massachusetts Bay, the daughter of Ebenezer and Susanna (Linnell) Phinney.[1][2][3] She was baptized in the Barnstable church on 11 October 1696.[
2 CONC 4]
2 CONT
2 CONT She was married in Barnstable on 09 October 1718 to Samuel Higgins,[5][6] the son of Jonathan and Lydia (Sparrow) Higgins, born in Eastham on 05 October 1694.[7][3] Samuel was a carpenter in Eastham.[7]
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel died in Eastham on 25 July 1776 in his 83rd year, and was buried in the Orleans cemetery.[8][9][10] Mehitable died there on 28 May 1778.[11][7]
2 CONT
2 CONT No probate records are found in Barnstable County for Samuel or Mehitable.[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children born Eastham:[12][13][3]
2 CONT
