2 CONT Jonathan, b. 3 Apr 1728.
2 CONT Samuel, b. 6 Aug 1730.
2 CONT Eliakim, b. 21 Jan 1732/3.
2 CONT Sylvanus, b. 12 Oct 1736.
2 CONT Lydia, b. 9 Oct 1737.
2 CONT Prince, b. 28 Apr 1741.
