2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Phinney was born on 23 Mar 1698 in Barnstable, the daughter of Ebenezer and Susanna (Linnell) Phinney. She married her first cousin Job Davis, son of Dolar and Hannah (Linnell) Davis, on 23 March 1698 at Barnstable. Job died 
2 CONC on 4 Apr 1751 age 50. Widow Mary Davis was named administratrix on 7 May 1751 of the estate of Job Davis late of Barnstable, deceased. She died ca. 1796 aged 98.[1] Children born Barnstable:[1]
