2 CONT
2 CONT Jane (Taylor) Phinney (1709 - 1787)
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane Phinney formerly Taylor
2 CONT Born 15 Oct 1709 in Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap
2 CONT ANCESTORS ancestors
2 CONT Daughter of Abraham Taylor and [mother unknown]
2 CONT Sister of Joseph Taylor and Christopher Taylor [half]
2 CONT Wife of Jabez Phinney — married 12 Mar 1732 in Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colonymap
2 CONT DESCENDANTS descendants
2 CONT Mother of Joseph Phinney, Mary (Phinney) Hathaway, Anne (Phinney) Shaw, Hannah (Phinney) Crosby, Joseph Phinney and John Phinney
2 CONT Died 10 Jul 1787 at age 77 in Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts, United Statesmap
2 CONT Profile manager: Daniel Linn private message [send private message]
2 CONT Profile last modified 9 Nov 2022 | Created 5 Jul 2011
2 CONT This page has been accessed 452 times.
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane (Taylor) Phinney was born on 15 Oct 1709 in Barnstable, Barnstable, daughter of Abraham Taylor (1683 - >1758).
2 CONT
2 CONT Her siblings were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Taylor (1715 - 1786)
2 CONT Christopher Taylor (~1716 - ~1774)
2 CONT Jane married Jabez Phinney (1708 - 1776) on 12 Mar 1732 in Barnstable. Their children were:
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Phinney (1733 - )
2 CONT Mary (Phinney) Hathaway (1735 - 1821)
2 CONT Anne (Phinney) Shaw (1738 - 1780)
2 CONT Hannah (Phinney) Crosby (1741 - )
2 CONT Joseph Phinney (1744 - 1829)
2 CONT John Phinney (1748 - ).
2 CONT Jane died on 10 Jul 1787 in Barnstable aged 77.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes
2 CONT
2 CONT Removed Mary (Butler) Taylor (abt.1689-abt.1713) as mother. She was living in CT. The marriage source for her father Abraham Taylor lists his wife as Mary Beetle, presumably born in Massachusetts Bay Colony.
2 CONT
