2 CONT Other than being a carpenter and Master Builder nothing is known of him until he sailed to America and landed in Boston in May 1634. Very little is known of his exact passage to America because there are no ship records of Dolor b
2 CONC eing on it. As Stated before his departure was 1634 possibly in the company of his friend Simon Willard, Dolor's Brother in law and best friend. Dolor's Family  was to come to the Colonies a year later.
