2 CONT ** Reference: [http://www.werelate.org/wiki/Person:Dolor_Davis_%25281%2529 WeRelate Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Mar 9 2017, 4:17:46 UTC''
