2 CONT SAMUEL, eldest son of Barnabas & Patience (James) Davis, was born at Tetbury, Gloucester, 26 June 1629; m. by 1658 Mary Waters (eldest known child b. Charlestown 22 November 1658), daughter of Lawrence WATERS {1634, Watertown} (on
2 CONC  4 January 1664[/5?], Josiah Whitcomb and Rebecca Waters were married at Lancaster; in 1664 Samuel Davis of Groton, who had wife Mary, was called brother by Rebecca Whitcomb).
