2 CONT Birth:March 24, 1643/44 in Barnstable, MA
2 CONT  	 Death:  June 06, 1715 in Plainfield, CT; married 	
2 CONT Parents: Dolar Davis, Margery Davis (born Willard) 
2 CONT
2 CONT Siblings: John Davis, Mary Lewis (born Davis), Samuel Davis, Simon Davis, Elizabeth [2] Davis, Nicholas Davis
2 CONT
2 CONT Partner:Stephen Hall December 03, 1663 in Barnstable MA; born May 12, 162S in Concord, Middlesex Co, MA; died October 01, 1724 in Plainfield, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT  Notes for Ruth Davis: married Steven Hall 12/3/1663. Had at least 6 children
2 CONT
