2 CONT Brief Life History of Nicolas
2 CONT Nicolas Davis was born about 1627, in East Farleigh, Kent, England. He married Sarah Ewer on 18 June 1645, in Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 3 daughters
2 CONC . He died on 9 August 1672, in Newport, Rhode Island, British Colonial America, at the age of 46.
2 CONT
