1 NOTE {geni:about_me} "Ruth was born on 10 April 1652 at Barnstable, Barnstable, Massachusetts.1 She was the daughter of Roger Goodspeed and Alice Layton.”
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation 5: Ruth Goodspeed, born 10 April 1652 at Misteake, now Marston’s Mills, Massachusetts, died in 1691; married on 2 February 1675 in Barnstable to John Davis, son of John Davis and Hannah Linnell.  He was born 6 January 1
2 CONC 650 in Barnstable, and died 1729 in Falmouth, Massachusetts. Five children.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===references 
