2 CONC cal Dictionary of the First Settlers of New England" James Savage Pub. Boston, 1860-1862, pp. 424-426 New England Historic and Genealogical Society Register A GENEALOGICAL MEMOIR OF THE LO-LATHROP FAMILY-1884, PAGE 45-46, BETHIA (
2 CONC #20)
