1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Dudley-2327
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Asahel Dudley was born on June 7, 1719 in Guilford (New Haven) Connecticut.[1] His parents were William Dudley and Ruth Strong. He married Elizabeth Hatch on January 5, 1741. Together they had ten children:
2 CONT
2 CONT William Dudley b. 23 Apr 1743 [2]
2 CONT Levi Dudley b. 1744, d. 3 Apr 1746 [3]
2 CONT Levi Dudley b. 30 Mar 1746 [4]
2 CONT Asael Dudley b. 4 Aug 1748 [5]
2 CONT Ruth Dudley b. 22 Sep 1751 [6]
2 CONT Eber Dudley b 28 Aug 1753 [7]
2 CONT Elizabeth Dudley b. 10 Apr 1756 [8]
2 CONT Lois Dudley b. 9 May 1759 [9]
2 CONT Issac Dudley b. 6 Apr 1761 [10]
2 CONT Mabel Dudley b. 5 Dec 1763 [11]
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on December 31, 1808 in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut[12] and was buried in Wilcox Cemetery, Berlin, Hartford, Connecticut Find A Grave: Memorial #17881890
2 CONT
2 CONT Asahel Dudley (1719 - 1808)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Asahel Dudley===
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 7 Jun 1719 in Guilford (New Haven) Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of William Dudley and Ruth (Strong) Dudley
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Lucy (Dudley) Baldwin, Medad Dudley, Jared Dudley and Mabel (Dudley) Russell
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Elizabeth (Hatch) Dudley — married 5 Jan 1741 in Westfield, Hampden, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Asahel Dudley, Ruth (Dudley) Wilcox, Lois (Dudley) Wilcox and Mabel (Dudley) Howe
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 31 Dec 1808 at age 89 in Middletown, Middlesex, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 12 Jun 2022 | Created 4 Aug 2015
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
