2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary, m. Capt. Samuel Guild of Dedham, Nov. 29, 1676 ; d. 1703 or earlier
2 CONT
2 CONT ===biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT From http://www.genealogy.com/ftm/h/e/r/David-W-Herring-OH/WEBSITE-0001/UHP-0334.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Woodcock (daughter of John Woodcock and Sarah Curtis) was born March 9, 1650/51 in Roxbury, Suffolk, MA, and died 1703 in Dedham, Suffolk, MA.She married Samuel Guild on November 29, 1676 in Dedham, Suffolk, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes for Mary Woodcock:
2 CONT Information taken from URL "Woodcock Genealogy" <.earthlink.net> More About Mary Woodcock and Samuel Guild: Marriage: November 29, 1676, Dedham, Suffolk, MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Mary Woodcock and Samuel Guild are:
2 CONT # Samuel Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Nathaniel Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Mary Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Deborah Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # John Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Isreal Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Ebenezer Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Joseph Guild, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Guild, d. date unknown.  Married Jacob Stanley.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From Burleigh, Charles. The Genealogy and History of the Guild, Guile and Gile Family (1887)[https://books.google.com/books?id=G5lPAAAAMAAJ&lpg=PA132&dq=alice%20m%20guild&pg=PA26#v=onepage&q&f=false  Page 26]
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Guild2 (John1), son of John and Elizabeth (Crooke) Guild, born in Dedham, Mass., Nov. 7, 1647, married, Nov. 29, 1676, Mary Woodcock, daughter of Samuel and Ann (Herring) Woodcock, of Dedham. [SIC: this is a later Woodcock 
2 CONC couple; this Mary's parent were John Woodcock & Sarah Curtis]. She was born March 9, 1631-2 [SIC: March 9, 1650/51  in Roxbury].
2 CONT
2 CONT He was a member of Capt. Moseley's Company in King Philip's war in 1675; was made a freeman at Salem, May, 1678. In 1703 he was one of a committee to invest and manage school funds, a selectman of Dedham from 1693 t0 1713i an^ a d
2 CONC elegate to the General Court in 1719. He died at Dedham, Jan. 1, 1730.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children born at Dedham:
2 CONT * -4- 9 Samuel,* b. Oct. 12, 1677; m. Sarah Hartshorn.
2 CONT * -4-10 Nathaniel,8 b. Jan. 12, 1678; m. Mehitable Farrington (or Hartshorn).
2 CONT * 11 Mary,8 b. May 9, 1681; d. May 27, 1768; m., May, 1714, John Fuller, of Dedham.
2 CONT * 12 John,8 b. June 18, 1683; d. Oct. 29, 1684.
2 CONT * 13 Deborah,8 b. Sept. 16, 1685.
2 CONT * +14 John,8 b. Oct. 2, 1687; m. Abigail Robinson.
2 CONT * --15 Israel,8 b. June 11, 1690; m. Sarah
2 CONT * --10 Ebenezer,8 b. July 23, 1692; m. Abigail Daggett.
2 CONT * -j-17 Joseph,8 b. Sept. 13, 1694; m. Abigail Fisher, Hannah Curtis, Beulah Peck,
2 CONT * 18 Elizabeth,' b. April 14, 1697. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
