1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Caution: Not to be confused with https://www.geni.com/people/Abagail-Butt/6000000001868060142, b. Feb. 2, 1688, in Franklin, Connecticut, daughter of Jonathan Rudd. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail was born to Joseph and Sarah Burt Hartshorn in Reading, Massachusetts Bay, on 28 Apr 1686.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail somehow traveled to southeastern Connecticut by early 1706.
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Hartshorn married Nathaniel Rudd of Norwich West Farms, as his second wife, in Franklin, New London, Connecticut Colony, on 31 Jan 1706.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel and Abigail had, in Franklin:[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT # Nathaniel, b. 6 Apr 1707, m. Mary Backus
2 CONT # Joseph, b. 31 Oct 1708, m. Sarah Moseley
2 CONT # Daniel, b. 12 Mar 1710, m. Mary Metcalf
2 CONT # Sarah, b. 23 Jan 1712
2 CONT # Abigail, b. 6 Aug 1713
2 CONT # Lydia, b. 12 Apr 1715, m. Joseph Welch
2 CONT # Ann, b. 7 Feb 1717
2 CONT # Susanna, b. 15 May 1719
2 CONT # Gideon, b. 2 Feb 1722, m. Thankful Allen
2 CONT # Patience, b. 6 Nov 1723, m. Samuel Bushnell
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Abigail Rudd formerly Hartshorn===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 28 Apr 1686 in Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Joseph Hartshorn and Sarah (Burt) Hartshorn
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Susannah Hartshorn, Sarah (Hartshorn) Guild, Mary (Hartshorn) Fairbanks, Mehitabel (Hartshorn) Guild, Joseph Hartshorn II, Tabitha (Hartshorn) Rockwell, Rebeckah (Hartshorne) Hartshorn, Thomas Hartshorn, Ebenezer Hartsho
2 CONC rn and Martha (Hartshorn) Marsh
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Nathaniel Rudd — married 31 Jan 1706 in CT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Nathaniel Rudd, Joseph Rudd Sr., Daniel Rudd, Sarah Rudd, Abigail Rudd, Lydia (Rudd) Welch, Ann Rudd, Susanna Rudd, Gideon Rudd and Patience (Rudd) Bacon
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail and her husband Nathaniel both died in 1727, leaving several minor children. Their oldest son, Nathaniel Jr., was awarded guardianship of his minor siblings, Joseph, Sarah, Abigail and Lydia  - source: probate record of Ab
2 CONC igail Rudd. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ Middlesex, Vital Records of Reading Massachusetts, to the year 1850, p, 118.
2 CONT ↑ Barbour, George, Connecticut Town Marriage Records - The Barbour Collection, town of Franklin, p. 81 in transcription, Vol. 2, page 314 in original, viewed on ancestry.com
2 CONT
