1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Martha Hartshorn Marsh=
2 CONT * BIRTH	2 Jul 1700 Dedham, Norfolk County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH	14 Jan 1781 (aged 80) Sturbridge, Worcester County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL	Old Burial Ground, Sturbridge, Worcester County, Massachusetts, USA, PLOT No plot or marker located in 2017., MEMORIAL ID 151860507 Draft 4 September 2015 by Vicki Edwards
2 CONT
2 CONT Martha was likely the daughter of Joseph and Sarah Burt Hartshorn. She married John Marsh on 6 October 1719 in her home town of Dedham, Massachusetts. Together Martha and John had at least 8 children.
2 CONT
