2 CONT
2 CONT Born 23 May 1715 in Norwich, New London, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Benjamin Abell and Lydia (Hazen) Abell
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Andrew Abell, Lydia (Abell) Hyde, Simon Abell, Alice Abell, Hannah (Abell) Lathrop, Elijah Abell, Alpheus Matthew Abell, Oliver Abell and Isaiah Abell
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Abigail Hyde — married [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Abigail (Guild) Abell — married 13 Jun 1739 in Norwich, New London, Connecticut
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Lydia Abell, Phineas Abell, Abigail Abell, Rhoda Abell and Frederick Abell
2 CONT
2 CONT Died [date unknown] in Norwich, New London, Connecticut
2 CONT
