2 CONT Note: #N520 Note, there was a conflation of Benjamin Sr and JR. It is Sr who died at 82. It is Jr who married Abigail Guild and had children in the 1740s. Please delete the following which is info for the father.
2 CONT
2 CONT Benjamin was born in 1687. Benjamin died May 28 1769, age 82 in CT. Birth would be abt 1687 [8]
