2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary
2 CONT
2 CONT When Mary Damon was born on 22 August 1683, in Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Samuel Damon, was 27 and her mother, Mary Davis, was 26. She married Thomas Taylor II on 23 March 1
2 CONC 704, in Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 4 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 13 May 1733, in her hometown, at the age of 49.
