2 CONT
2 CONT The Life Summary of Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Putnam was born on 11 August 1662, in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Deacon Nathaniel Putnam Sr., was 42 and her mother, Elizabeth Hutchinson, was 32. She married Georg
2 CONC e Flint on 2 March 1679, in Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 5 daughters. She died on 6 March 1697, in Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial Am
2 CONC erica, at the age of 34, and was buried in Burying Point Cemetery, Salem, Essex, Massachusetts, United States.
