2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Elizabeth
2 CONT
2 CONT When Elizabeth Flint was born on 19 February 1685, in North Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, George Flint I, was 33 and her mother, Elizabeth Putnam, was 22. She married Ebenezer 
2 CONC Damon on 19 August 1709, in Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 2 daughters. She lived in Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts, United States in 1685. S
2 CONC he died in October 1762, in Wakefield, Reading, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 77.
