1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ==Biography==
2 CONT '''Nathaniel Flint''' was born on January 4, 1694, in North Reading, Middlesex County, Massachusetts. His parents were [https://www.geni.com/profile-76705777 Sgt. George Flint] and [https://www.geni.com/profile-31537062 Elizabeth 
2 CONC Flint]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Nathaniel married [https://www.geni.com/profile-39311763 Mary Flint] on December 20, 1720. Together they had the following children:
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34657017462 Nathaniel Flint, Jr.];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498110 Elizabeth Flint];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498118 Hannah Flint];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498144 Mary Flint];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498154 Lois Flint];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498158 Phebe Flint];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498185 Ephraim Flint];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498193 Benjamin Flint];
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/profile-34639498203 Timothy Flint]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He died on November 12, 1760, in Tolland, Hartford County, Connecticut, and was buried in Reading, Middlesex County, MA, United States. 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT ----
2 CONT Married Mary Stearns,
2 CONT Nathaniel Flint married Mary Stearns 20 Dec 1720 at Reading, MA. To this union were born ten children: Nathaniel Jr, Mary (I), Hannah, Lois, Phebe, Nathan, Ephraim, Benjamin, Timothy, & Mary (II).
