1 NOTE {geni:about_me} John Woodward was b. 28 Mar 1649, Dorchester, Suffolk, Massachusetts  d. 05 Oct 1724, New London, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT John & Anna (Dewey) Woodward were married on 18 May 1671 in Northampton, Hampshire, MA. John was a farmer at Northampton and Westfield. He moved to Lebanon about 1696.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John & Anna: 
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Elizabeth Woodward,   b. 17 Mar 1672, Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. John Woodward,   b. 02 Apr 1674, Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts 
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Samuel Woodward,   b. 20 Mar 1676, Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts 
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Henry Woodward,   b. 18 Mar 1680, Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Thomas Woodward,   b. 22 Apr 1682, Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts 
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Israel Woodward,   b. 06 Feb 1685, Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts 
2 CONT
2 CONT The Lebanon, New London Co., CT Library list of burials gives John's date of death as 17 Oct 1724. John Woodward married Anna Dewey on 18 May 1671 in Northampton, Hampshire, MA. John was a farmer at Northampton and Westfield. He m
2 CONC oved to Lebanon about 1696.
2 CONT
2 CONT Find A Grave Memorial # 46184952.
2 CONT
