2 CONT The Life Summary of Hannah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Hannah Birchard was born on 10 June 1711, in Norwich, New London, Connecticut, United States, her father, John Birchard, was 40 and her mother, Hannah Loomis, was 32. She married John Lyman Sr . on 28 February 1730, in Lebano
2 CONC n, New London, Connecticut, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. She died on 28 June 1746, in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut, United States, at the age of 35, and was buried in Old Cemetery, Leb
2 CONC anon, New London, Connecticut, United States.
