2 CONT * BURIAL Baptist Village Cemetery, East Longmeadow, Hampden County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * GPS-Latitude: 42.0560501, Longitude: -72.4711794
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 273374524 photos added by Kelly Weaver
