2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT In Memory of
2 CONT Mrs Zilpha the wife of
2 CONT Mr Theophilis
2 CONT Swetland who Died
2 CONT Augus 17th 1799 in
2 CONT the 40th year of her Age
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Almost 40 years I saw,
2 CONT Beheld this world as vain,
2 CONT Resigned to natures law,
2 CONT Imortal life to gain.'''
