1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Pvt. Jeremiah Rood=
2 CONT * BIRTH 15 Aug 1759 Lebanon, New London County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 16 Apr 1820 (aged 60) Fredonia, Chautauqua County, New York, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Pioneer Cemetery, Fredonia, Chautauqua County, New York, USA
2 CONT * GPS-Latitude: 42.4434692, Longitude: -79.3267894
2 CONT * PLOT 1480 
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 15797605  
2 CONT * BURIAL Forest Home Cemetery, Milwaukee, Milwaukee County, Wisconsin, USA
2 CONT * GPS-Latitude: 42.9997039, Longitude: -87.9454596
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 32966357 photos added by Michelle Valade Woodham
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Notes==
2 CONT There appears to be two grave markers, one in NY and another in WI that seems to be a memorial for the family summer home (see above).  The dates on the stone for Jeremiah in NY are incorrect. The Barbour Collection in CT gives a 
2 CONC birth date of 15 Aug 1759 in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut and in his Revolutionary War pension application of 29 April 1818 he states he is about 59 years of age, which correlates to his birth date being 1759 not 1753. He also
2 CONC  died in 1820, not 1830, as his estate was administered in 1821.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Jeremiah Rood 1728–1816
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Abigail Post Rood 1751–1835
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Siblings'''
2 CONT Joseph Rood 1750–184
2 CONT Capt. Joseph W Rood 1750–1843
2 CONT Hannah Rood Treadway 1756–1832
2 CONT Jeremiah Rood 1759–1820
2 CONT Olive Rood Stiles 1767–1843
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Standish Sidney Rood 1785–1880
2 CONT Harmony Rood Risley 1790–1871
2 CONT Mary Rood Woodworth unknown–1822
2 CONT
