2 CONT ===Origins
2 CONT
2 CONT JOSIAH READ OF CONNECTICUT, AND HIS DESCENDANTS.
2 CONT
2 CONT Josiah, the son of Josiah, married Grace Holloway of Marshfield, Mass., in November, 1666, — Rehoboth and Marsh field being then contiguous towns ; though the increase of inhabitants, and the incorporations of precincts and parish
2 CONC es into towns, has long since made the two places socially far distant. He settled in Norwich, Conn. Children,— Josiah, born April, 1668; William, April, 1770; Elizabeth, September, 1672 ; Experience, Feb. 27, 1675; John, Aug. 15,
2 CONC  1679; Joseph, March 12, 1681; Susanna, Sept. 20, 1685 ; Hannah, July, 1688. He died at Norwich, July 3, 1717 : Grace, his wife, died May 9,1727.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT # Norwich Vital Records, page 15, item 17.  < [https://archive.org/details/vitalrecordsofno01norwi/page/15/mode/1up Archive.Org] > “The marriag of Jofiah Reed with Grace Hollowey Was in Novembr Anno Dom 1666.” 
2 CONT # http://www.one-barton-family.us/genealogy/getperson.php?personID=I13779&tree=db 
2 CONT # The Ancestry of J.G. Williams & Ursula Miller, page 346 discusses his vital info and lists his children. < [https://books.google.com/books?id=Hgu1BAAAQBAJ&pg=PA346&lpg=PA346&dq=josiah+reed+%26+elizabeth+amsden&source=bl&ots=8ADN
2 CONC RZQff_&sig=ACfU3U3o0sbecvzhu3b99aNS1CrcbDlN_Q&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjwl4eG55PmAhXOrFkKHQW4CPYQ6AEwBnoECAoQAQ#v=onepage&q=josiah%20reed%20%26%20elizabeth%20amsden&f=false GoogleBooks] > 
2 CONT #The Descendants of Elder William Brewster, Part 1, Generations 1 through 4, Barbara Lambert Merrick, General Society of Mayflower Descendants, Plymouth MA, 2014, p. 131
