1 NOTE {geni:about_me} MAYFLOWER DESCENDANT - his great grandfather was Pilgrim William Brewster. -tcd
2 CONT
2 CONT According to The Brewster genealogy, 1566-1907 on openlibrary.org page 48 - Fourth Generation 13 - William Brewster (Benjamin, Jonathan, William) married first, at Norwich, Conn., January 8, 1692, Elizabeth daughter of Josiah and 
2 CONC Grace (Holloway) Read, and she died March 11th of same year. He married second, at Mohegan, Norwich, Conn., June 8, 1692, Patience daughter of Josiah and Grace (Holloway) Read, who was born Sept 1672 at Norwich and died at Coventr
2 CONC y, Conn., about 1740. He died at Lebanon, Conn. August 11, 1728. William Brewster removed from Norwich to Lebanon,. the following children are named in the settlement of his estate.
2 CONT # William was called 'eldest son'
2 CONT # Patience
2 CONT # Samuel
2 CONT # Ebenezer b Feb 1, 1702-3
2 CONT # Peter b Feb 17, 1706
