1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/John-Read/6000000048799647894, son of Josiah Reed and Grace Holloway.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT '''John Reed''', son of John Reed and Bethiah Cobb, was born in August 1701, probably in Taunton, Massachusetts Bay. In 1733 he was living in Wellington, Connecticut, where he married Lydia or Elizabeth Caswell on about October 7.
2 CONC  In 1751 he bought 80 acres of land in Tolland, Connecticut.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT John Reed and his wife  had seven children: Matthew, Abigail, Shubael, Mary, Hannah and Huldah.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT
2 CONT *”The Chaffee Genealogy, Embracing the Chafe, Chafy, Chafie, Chafey, Chafee ... “By William Henry Chaffee.   Page 567.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=cFc5AAAAMAAJ&vq=Bethia%20Cobb&pg=PA567#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks]
2 CONT
2 CONT * The Granberry family and allied families, including the ancestry of Helen (Woodward) Granberry, based on data collected by and for Edgar Francis Waterman and compiled by Donald Lines Jacobus. [https://hdl.handle.net/2027/wu.8906
2 CONC 2880992?urlappend=%3Bseq=320 Hathitrust]
