2 CONT Bicknell, Thomas Williams. A History of Barrington, Rhode Island, Snow & Farnham Printers, Providence, 1898.
2 CONT Murray, Thomas Hamilton. "Matthew Watson, an Irish settler of Barrington, R.I., 1722" in The Journal of the Irish-American Historical Society 3 (1898) pp.130-135.
2 CONT Rounds, H. L. Peter. Vital Records of Swansea, Massachusetts to 1850 (New England Historic Genealogical Society, 1992)
