3 CITY Windham
3 STAE Connecticut
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1 JUN 1816
2 ADDR
3 CITY Plains Township
3 STAE Pennsylvania
3 CTRY United States
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of Stephen Fuller and Hannah Moulton. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Abbott, married November 4, 1762, Windham, CT. John was born in 1741 and died in 1778, PA when he was killed by Indians near his home. Alice was destitute and forced to walk the 300 miles back to her CT home with her 
2 CONC 9 surviving children. Alice returned to Plains, PA years later and married Stephen Gardiner.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Stephen Gardiner, III, son of Stephen Gardiner, Jr. and Frances Congdon. Alice and Stephen were married about 1785 in Pennsylvania. They are buried together.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of John and Alice:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. Alice Abbott born April 17, 1763, CT, died January 16, 1808, CT. She married Amos Utley in 1790. Children: Truman (1792), Amos Jr. (1793-1882, OH), Mira (1796), Sabina (Elijah) Hartshorn (1797), Lucius (1799), Lester (1801-1805
2 CONC ), Erastus (1803), Jared (1804) 
2 CONT
2 CONT 2. Abigail Abbott born December 15, 1764, CT, died February 5, 1790, Hampton, Windham, CT (see CT birth/death record
2 CONT
2 CONT 3. Celinda Abbott Taylor born May 20, 1766 CT, died December 2, 1854, PA. She married Reuben Taylor 1759-1849. Children: John Abbott Taylor 1791-1867.
2 CONT
2 CONT 4. Stephen Abbott born December 6, 1767, CT, died June 19, 1770, Ashford. CT. Buried in Ashford, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 5. Charles Abbott born June 3, 1769, CT, died 1853, Delaware Co, Ohio. He married Lorana Manville. Children: Charles Jr, Caroline, Lyman and Lorana.
2 CONT
2 CONT 6. Stephen Abbott born April 19, 1771, CT, died July 22, 1853 PA? He married Abigail Searl July 14, 1799. She was born June 25, 1779, died June 2, 1842. Children: John (1800), William (1802), Lucy (1805-1806), Elizabeth (1806), St
2 CONC ephen (1809), Charles born/died 1814.
2 CONT
2 CONT 7. Abigail Abbott born about 1773, CT, died ?
2 CONT
2 CONT 8. Reuben Abbott born about 1774, died January 1, 1863, Mansfield, CT.
2 CONT
2 CONT 9. Lydia Abbott born about 1775, CT, died ? She married Artemas Swetland born 1773. Children: Augustus born 1794 and 5 other children.
2 CONT
2 CONT 10. Sarah Abbott born February 28, 1778, CT, died August 7, 1866. She married James Kennedy on April 16, 1800. James was born 1775, died 1864. Children: Catherine (1804-1879), Lyman (1806), John (1808), Thomas (1811), Stephen (181
2 CONC 4)
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial location from "The Michael Shoemaker (Schumacher) Book, pg 66.* Reference: [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/110612552/alice-gardner Find A Grave Memorial] - [https://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''M
