2 NOTE From http://www.open-sandwich.co.uk/places_to_visit/villages/ash.htm
3 CONT
3 CONT The Village of Ash
3 CONT The village of Ash, also known as Ash-Next-Sandwich, is 3 miles from Sandwich, on the Roman road to Canterbury. Nearby is an ancient Saxon cemetery at Guilton.
3 CONT
3 CONT The church of St. Nicholas, parts of which date back to approx. 1190, has a 15th century tower and a spire which can be seen for many miles around.
