2 CONC y, Elizabeth Petty Bentley.  Page 199.  "CURTIS, Thomas (1619-1706?) & 1/wf Elizabeth ?; b 1644;  Scituate/ York, ME.   "CURTIS, Thomas (1619-1706?) & 2/wf Abigail ?."
