2 CONC Pope ...Published 1900 by C.H. Pope in Boston . Written in English. Page 93.
2 CONT * [http://www.geni.com/documents/view?doc_id=6000000031783482968 A genealogy of the Curtiss family: being a record of the descendants of widow Elizabeth Curtiss,] who settled in Stratford, Conn., 1639-1640 by Frederic Haines Curti
2 CONC ss. Published 1903 by Rockwell and Churchill Press in Boston . Written in English.  Page 38-39
