4 CONT ...planter, York, proprietor, grand jury man in 1649; took oath of allegiance to Mass. govt. 22 Nov. 1652; signed the petition to Mass. govt. in 1654 and that to Cromwell in 1657. Sold land to Henry Lamprill, cooper, 18 March, 168
4 CONC 3-4.
