1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/William-Curtis/6000000036859851101
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: William has been placed in the family of Thomas and Richardene Curtis with the baptism record of 29 April 1627 at St. Nicholas Church, Ash-next-Sandwich, Kent, which says he was the son of Thomas. However, there is a burial 
2 CONC record for William, son of Thomas, also in Ash, on 16 September 1630.[1] There is no other Thomas Curtis on record living in Ash at this time. It's possible there was a mistake when the event was recorded in the parish register. T
2 CONC his is more likely to be true given that there is no further record of Stephen and there is of William.
