2 CONT ===Gilbert Brooks 
2 CONT * BIRTH	9 Nov 1690 Scituate, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA DEATH	6 Dec 1768 (aged 78) Scituate, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA BURIAL	 First Parish Cemetery Norwell, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA MEMORIAL ID	14276
2 CONC 7352 ·
2 CONT * son of Nathaniel & Elizabeth (Curtis) Brooks
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT md. 1st, c. 1713, Elizabeth Taylor, who died sometime between the date of her father's will (where she is mentioned with her husband Gilbert by name, along with her sister Mary and Mary's husband Nathaniel Brooks -- Gilbert's brot
2 CONC her) [17 March 1717/18] and Gilbert's marriage to Abigail Stockbridge [12 March 1718/19]. Elizabeth's last known child, Gilbert, Jr, was christened in July 1718/19, and it is unknown if Elizabeth had died by then or not.
2 CONT
2 CONT md. 2nd, Scituate, 12 Mar. 1718, Abigail, dau. of Charles & Abigail (Tilden) Stockbridge. She was b. Scituate, 22 Mar. 1694-5 & d. before 1754.
2 CONT
2 CONT md. 3rd, Scituate, 22 Jan. 1754, Mrs. Marcy Curtis, who was b. c. 1717 & d. Scituate, 26 Feb. 1818, aged 101 years.
2 CONT
