2 CONT * Birth:	Nov 9 1690 - Scituate
2 CONT * Parents:	Nathaniel Brooks, Elizabeth Curtis
2 CONT * Wife:	Elizabeth Brooks; Abigail Stockbridge; Mercy, widow of a Mr. Curtis 
2 CONT * Death:	1768
2 CONT
2 CONT According to Savage, he left many descendants at Scituate
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Brooks-10682
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert, son of Nathaniel and Elizabeth (Curtis) Brooks, was born at Scituate, MA on November 9, 1690.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married first Elizabeth (unknown) about 1713. They had two children: William and Gilbert. She died prior to March 12, 1718/19 when he remarried to Abigail Stockbridge.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married second Abigail, daughter of Charles and Abigail (Tilden) Stockbridge, at Scituate on Marcj 12, 1718/19. They resided at Scituate where they had seven children: Benjamin, Ebenezer, Mercy, Ruth, Elizabeth, Abigail, and Ex
2 CONC perience. Abigail died prior to January 22, 1754, the date Gilbert remarried to Mercy (unknown) Curtis.
2 CONT
2 CONT Gilbert's will, dated March 16, 1767, names wife Mercy; sons William, Benjamin and Charles; daughters Ruth Thomas, Elizabeth Brooks, Abigail Lapham, Experience Randall, Rachel Heal, and Eunice Brooks; and children of son Gilbert, 
2 CONC deceased. He also appoints son William as guardian to son Benjamin (non compos mentis).
2 CONT
2 CONT He died at Scituate on December 6, 1768 at the age of 78 and is buried at First Parish Cemetery at Norwell, MA (formerly known as South Parish Cemetery at Scituate).
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT Robert S. Wakefield, FASG, John Bradley Arthaud, MD, FASG, et. al., revs., Mayflower Families Through Five Generations, Richard Warren, Volume 18, Part 2 of 3, 2nd Ed., (Plymouth, MA: General Society of Mayflower Descendants, 2011
2 CONC ), pp. 128-129 Vital Records of Scituate Massachusetts to the year 1850, (Online Database: AmericanAncestors.org, New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2001-2016), (birth) Vital Records of Scituate Massachusetts to the year 1
2 CONC 850, (Online Database: AmericanAncestors.org, New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2001-2016), (2nd & 3rd marriages) Vital Records of Scituate Massachusetts to the year 1850, (Online Database: AmericanAncestors.org, New Engl
2 CONC and Historic Genealogical Society, 2001-2016), (death) Plymouth County, MA: Probate File Papers, 1686-1881, Gilbert Brooks, Scituate, 1768, No. 2979, Online database. AmericanAncestors.org. New England Historic Genealogical Societ
2 CONC y, 2015. (From records supplied by the Massachusetts Supreme Judicial Court Archives.) Find A Grave, Memorial #142767352
2 CONT
