1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family of Samuel Tilden & Sarah Curtis:
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Tilden. Born on 23 Apr 1700 in Marshfield, MA.60 Lydia was baptized in the Second Church of Scituate, in 1701.52 Lydia died in Kingston, MA, on 6 Apr 1742; she was 41.288
2 CONT
2 CONT Aft Oct 1727 Lydia first married Robert Cooke (19387) , son of Francis Cooke (6991) (5 Jan 1662/3-bet 15 May 1736 and 18 Sep 1746) & Elizabeth Latham (9936) (ca 1655-16 Nov 1730).252 Born ca 1691 in Plymouth, MA.252 Robert was bap
2 CONC tized in Plymouth, MA, on 16 Apr 1693.252 Robert died in Kingston, MA 20 Jan 1731/2.252 Occupation: Yeoman.
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include:
2 CONT #Samuel Cooke (Died soon) (1 Jul 1729-30 Jul 1729)
2 CONT #Simeon Cooke (21 Sep 1730-aft 1 Jan 1783)
2 CONT
2 CONT 11 Apr 1741 (Int) Lydia second married John Faunce (13555) , son of Joseph Faunce (4624) (14 May 1653-18 Jan 1728) & Judith Rickard (25761) (ca 1657-), in Kingston, MA.288 Born on 3 Dec 1683 in Plymouth, MA.63 John died in Kingsto
2 CONC n, MA, on 18 Nov 1751; he was 67.288
2 CONT
2 CONT Child of John and Lydia (Tilden) Faunce:
2 CONT # Benjamin, b. 19 Mar 1742 at Kingston, d. there 3 Jul 1777, m. at Marshfield 13 Apr 1764 Lydia Trouant (d. 30 Mar 1808 æ. 64 at Kingston).288
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
