2 CONT # https://mathcs.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr07/rr07_069.html#P10007 cites 
2 CONT ##62. “Plymouth Colony vital records,” Mayflower Descendant, Transcribed by George Ernest Bowman, various volumes. Transcribed form marriages appearing in the Court Orders, and from “Marriages, Births and Burials”
2 CONT ##63. Plymouth Vital Records.
