2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sarah Holmes formerly Tilden===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 6 Sep 1702 in Marshfield, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Samuel Tilden and [mother unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Samuel Tilden jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Ephraim Holmes — married 1 Jan 1734 in Marshfield, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Ephraim Holmes II, Sarah (Holmes) Carver and Levi Holmes
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 23 Mar 1773 in Kingston, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
