1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John was born in 1682.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Sarah Billing on August 7, 1707. They had five children of record.
2 CONT
2 CONT His daughter Hannah married into the Sumner family. Years later William Sumner Appleton wrote genealogies of both families. [1]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Badcock-118
2 CONT
2 CONT John Badcock (1682 - 1721) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===John Badcock===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 21 Nov 1682 in Milton, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Samuel Badcock and Hannah (Eames) Badcock
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Hannah (Badcock) Vose, James Babcock, Mary (Badcock) Vose, Elizabeth (Babcock) Sumner and Samuel Badcock
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Sarah (Billing) Badcock — married 7 Aug 1707 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of John Badcock and Hannah (Badcock) Sumner
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 21 Dec 1721 at age 39 in Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Badcock-118 created 9 Jan 2014 | Last modified 17 Dec 2020
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ The family of Badcock of Massachusetts, page 6
