1 TITL Dea.
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Deacon George Barbour was born on 5 December 1684 at Medfield, MA.2,3 He was the son of John Barbour and Abigail (?). Deacon George Barbour married Anna Taylor, daughter of Richard Taylor and Hannah Rice.1 Deacon G
2 CONC eorge Barbour died on 17 March 1746/47 at Medfield, MA.2,4
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Deacon George Barbour and Anna Taylor
2 CONT # John Barber+
2 CONT # Ann Barbour+
2 CONT
2 CONT ===notes===
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: GEORGE BARBOUR (1684-1747) born in Medfield, MA, was the fourth child o f JOHN BARBOUR (1649-1688). He inherited his father's property and apparently lived all his life there. He was at various times town Selectman and Repr
2 CONC esentative to the General Court. In 1725 he was chosen Deacon of his Church.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
