2 CONT ** [S787] Medfield MA, Medfield, MA, Vital Records, p. 19
2 CONT ** [S787] Medfield MA, Medfield, MA, Vital Records, p. 194.
2 CONT * http://www.genealogy.com/forum/surnames/topics/barber/5280/
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Barbour-40
2 CONT
2 CONT Deacon George Barbour aka Barber, Barbur
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 5 Dec 1684 in Medfield, Norfolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of John Barbour and Abigail (Badcock) Morse
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Abial (Barbour) Haven
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Anne (Taylor) Barbour 
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of John Barber and Anne Barbour
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 17 Mar 1747 in Medfield, Norfolk, Massachusetts Bay Province
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 4 Dec 2017 | Created 1 Jun 2011
2 CONT
2 CONT George was born to John and Abigail Badcock Barber in Medfield on December 5, 1684.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT George married Anne Taylor of Sudbury, reportedly in Sudbury, although that event has not yet been found in Sudbury or Medfield vital records.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children
2 CONT
2 CONT George and Anne had, in Medfield:[3]
2 CONT
2 CONT John, b. August 27, 1708 Ann, b. December 15, 1726 Death
2 CONT
2 CONT Deacon George Barbur died in Medfield on March 17, 1746-7.[4]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
