2 CONT Per Kathy (KAVANAGH) Guinn:
2 CONT Joanna SAWIN is NOT the correct Johanna/Johanah/Johannah LYON who married William MACKINTOSH Jr․ (06/16/1700-01/03/1725) on June 21, 1721 recorded in Boston. 
2 CONT
2 CONT The LDS research is mistaken in listing Johanna SAWIN as wife to William MACKINTOSH․
2 CONT
2 CONT Johanna LYON MACKINTOSH MACKERWITHEY would be mother to William (later, Colonel) McINTOSH and Jeremiah MACKINTOSH/McINTOSH and become a young widow in 1725․ She would marry John MACKERWITHEY, neighbor and family friend in 1729, si
2 CONC x months after the death in January 1729 of his 1st wife, Elizabeth (HAWS/HARRIS)․ They had 2 more children together, Johanna and John, Jr․ who was under guardianship for developmental issues․ After her husband John's death in 175
2 CONC 6, she disappears from Dedhams records but she DID NOT die in Natick in 1765 - that is NOT the correct Johanna․ 
