2 CONC  of Holliston Massachusetts to the End of the Year 1849. Boston: NEHGS,Archive.org (Pages 111, 116, 159). ↑ 3.0 3.1 3.2 Dedham, Mass. & Hill, Don Gleason. (1886) The Early Records of the Town ... Dedham, Parts 1 & 2. Dedham, MA: D
