2 CONC 172). ↑ Parker, Bill. (Apr 09, 2010) "Capt Joseph Morse" Find A Grave Memorial# 50857365 ↑ Williams, Alicia Crane. Early New England Families, 1641-1700. AmericanAncestors.org NEHGS, (Joseph Morse (m. 1638), Page 5). ↑ Medfield, (
