1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT ''Updated 25 August 2023''
2 CONT
2 CONT From https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Comstock-151
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Comstock''', the daughter of William Comstock (b.ca. 1595-d. 1683) and his wife Elizabeth, was baptized on 18 Dec 1631, at St. Margaret's, Uxbridge, Hillingdon, Middlesex, England.  'Elizabeth, filia William Comstoc??
2 CONC  ' (See image of baptismal record, below.). Her death was recorded in the Vital Records of Saybrook, Connecticut Colony (under the heading, “The marriage the Children of Edward Shipton”): “His wife d. about the middle of Jully, 16
2 CONC 59.” 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Shipman (d. 1697) married twice, and had three children by his first wife and five by the second.
2 CONT
2 CONT Edward Shipton was married to '''Elisabeth Comstock''' (bef 1631-15 July 1659), in the beginning of January, 1650/51. She was the daughter of William Comstock and (probably) Elizabeth Daniel.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Comstock and Edward Shipman, recorded at Saybrook:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Elizabeth, b. May, '51; (1652-1683). Married John Hobson on December 3, 1672 in Guilford, Conn.
2 CONT # Edward, b. about the middle of February, '54; (1654-1711). Married Abigail.
2 CONT # William, b. June, '56 (1656-1725). Married Alice Hand (1670-?) on November 26, 1690 in Saybrook, Conn.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT “His wife d. about the middle of Jully, 1659.”
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Origins 
2 CONT
2 CONT Some sources assert that Elizabeth Shipman was born in Hull, City of Kingston-upon-Hull, Yorkshire, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://ntgen.tripod.com/bw/comst_index.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Earliest Record:  1637. Per Comstock Family in America, and also Stiles: "... he [Willam Comstock]  is recorded as having been one of the twenty-six men from Wethersfield in the expedition commanded by Capt. John Mason, that captu
2 CONC red the Pequot Fort at Mystic, Connecticut, May 26, 1637, killing about five hundred Indians."
2 CONT
2 CONT *1   William Comstock 1595 - 1683 ..  +Unknown 1595 - 
2 CONT *2nd Wife of William Comstock: ..  +Elizabeth [Daniel?] 1608 - 
2 CONT *3rd Wife of William Comstock: 
2 CONT *..  +Which Wife Mom, ? 1595 - 
2 CONT **........... 2   Elizabeth Comstock 1633 - 1659 
2 CONT **...............  +Edward Shipton/Shipman 1633 - 
2 CONT
