1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Comstock and Edward Shipman, recorded at Saybrook:
2 CONT
2 CONT * (2) Elizabeth Shipman, b. May, '51; (b May 1652 - d 1683 at Saybrook, Conn.) Residence: Chester, Conn.  Married Dec. 3, 1672 at Guilford, Conn. to John Hobson (d July 3, 1701) (his 2nd) son of John Hobson of Rowley, Mass. Childr
2 CONC en - at least
2 CONT **(3) Elizabeth Hobson Starr (b June 22, 1674 at Guilford, Conn. - d Jan. 27, 1752 at Guilford, Conn.) Residence, in 1692, "Crooked Lane" Married 1694 Comfort Starr, Jr. (b Nov. 15, 1666 - d May 1, 1743 at Guilford, Conn.) a taylo
2 CONC r from Middletown, Conn. and son of Comfort and Marah (Weld) Starr Children
2 CONT ***(4) Elizabeth Starr Fowler (b Nov. 26, 1695) Married Ebenezer Fowler
2 CONT ***(4) Seven others
2 CONT ** (3) Abigail Hobson - d young
2 CONT
