2 CONT 6 December 1679–22 May 1760 (Age {age})
2 CONT
2 CONT When Eldad Pomeroy was born on 6 December 1679, in Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Caleb Pomeroy, was 38 and his mother, Hepzibah Baker, was 33. He married Sarah Waite on 20 
2 CONC December 1705, in Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 3 daughters. He died on 22 May 1760, in Nonatuck, Northampton, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONC  Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 80.
