1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ''''''New England families, genealogical and memorial: a record of the ..., Volume 2 edited by William Richard Cutter
2 CONT *http://books.google.com/books?id=1M8UAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA882&lpg=PA882&dq=Thankful+Phelps+Pomeroy+1710&source=bl&ots=QxvCbVFMys&sig=nYlIol-Xoqk8TnQfejl_2FmB28A&hl=en&ei=p32KTdelDYimsQO4_dmcDA&sa=X&oi=book_result&ct=result&resnum=3&ved=
