2 CONT *Pg. 146
2 CONT *''''''22. CALEB4 POMEROY (Samuel,3 Caleb,3 Eltweed1), born Oct. 2, 1707, in Northampton, married Nov. 15, 1733, Thankful, born in 1710, in Northampton, died in Southampton, daughter of William and Thankful (Edwards) Phelps. He wa
2 CONC s a farmer in Easthampton. He died in Southampton, in 1783.
2 CONT *   Children:
