2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Jonathan
2 CONT
2 CONT When Jonathan Brown was born on 31 December 1716, in Salem, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, John Brown, was 33 and his mother, Mary Elsy, was 32. He married Abigail Russell on 10 September 17
2 CONC 41, in Brimfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 7 daughters. He died on 26 September 1799, in Brimfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States, at the a
2 CONC ge of 82, and was buried in Brimfield Cemetery, Brimfield, Hampden, Massachusetts, United States.
