2 CONT Birth: 	Jan. 23, 1694 Hebron Tolland County Connecticut, USA Death: 	1794 Hillsdale Columbia County New York, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Noah Phelps, Sr. was the son of Timothy Phelps and Martha Crow. 
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Anne Dyer, daughter of Henry and Mary Dyer of Boston, MA, and Lebanon, CT. His wife's grandparents were Samuel Dyer and Anne Hutchinson.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
