2 CONT ##Marriage: "New England Marriages to 1700" Volume: Volume 1; Page: 289; Original Text: CALKINS, Samuel (-1720) & Hannah GIFFORD; Nov 1691, 16? Nov; Norwich, CT/Lebanon, CT {Norwich VR 41; Gifford 87; Sv. 1:350; Waterman (1939) 66
2 CONC 1}NAmerican Ancestors Record (accessed 5 July 2025) Hannah Gifford marriage to Samuel CALKINS in 1691 in Norwich, New London, Connecticut, United States.
2 CONT ##Vital Records of Norwich, 1659-1848 (Society of Colonial Wars in the State of Connecticut, Hartford, 1913) Part 1, Page 19. < [https://books.google.com/books?id=QPULAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA19 GoogleBooks] > 
2 CONT ##Find A Grave: Memorial #https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/47838456
2 CONT # WikiTree contributors, "Samuel Calkins Sr. (1663-aft.1739)," WikiTree: The Free Family Tree, (https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Calkins-58 : accessed 13 November 2025). cites 
