2 CONT The Life Summary of {shortName}
2 CONT
2 CONT When Lieut. Stephen Calkins was born on 4 April 1706, in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Samuel Calkins Sr., was 42 and his mother, Hannah Gifford, was 36. He married Elizabeth Heath 
2 CONC in 1731. He registered for military service in 1747. He died on 4 July 1781, in Sharon, Litchfield, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 75, and was buried in Sharon, Litchfield, Connecticut, United States.
