1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/person-1007125_201977311_201977311/hannah-phelps-born-northam MyHeritage Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Sep 1 2016, 22:07:49 UTC''
