2 CONT https://mathcs.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr15/rr15_387.html
2 CONT
2 CONT * 33850. Hannah Northam. Born on 29 May 1724 in Colchester, CT.399 Hannah died in Hebron, CT.
2 CONT * On 16 Sep 1742 when Hannah was 18, she married Timothy Phelps (32610) , son of Timothy Phelps (18144) (29 Jan 1692/3-28 Sep 1768) & Hannah Calkins (15843) (4 Jul 1694-), in Hebron, CT.316 Born on 29 Jun 1718 in Hebron, CT.316 Ti
2 CONC mothy died aft 1800 in Charlton, Saratoga County, New York. Occupation: farmer.
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * 1800 Federal Census. Charlton, Saratoga County, New York
2 CONT * Roll 27, page 1073
2 CONT * Familty of Timothy Phelps
2 CONT *     1 male 45 and over [Timothy, 82]
2 CONT *     1 female 45 and over [Hannah, 76]
2 CONT * Timothy, their son is listed right below them in the census register.
2 CONT * 
2 CONT * From The Phelps Family of America:260 
2 CONT *     (#456) Timothy Phelps, b. Hebron, Ct., 29 June, 1718, m. Hannah Northman, 16 Sept. 1742. She died in Hebron Ct.
2 CONT *     Mr. Phelps settled in Hebron, Ct. He was a farmer. Late in life he removed with some of his children to Charlton, Saratoga Co., N.Y., where he died. Said to have been 109 years old, by one of his grand-children.
2 CONT *     Children, b. Hebron, Ct.:
2 CONT *     i. Hannah, b. 2 Dec., 1743, m. Andrew Mann.
2 CONT *     ii. Sarah, b. 2 Dec., 1745, m. Washburn, or Streeter.
2 CONT *     iii. Rachel, b. 26 Dec., 1746, m. Streeter, or Washburn.
2 CONT *     iv. Timothy, b. 29 Dec., 1749, m. Persis Baxter.
2 CONT *     v. Asa, b. 10 Jan., 1754, m. Susan Weld. [#1294]
2 CONT *     vi. Samuel, b. 22 Sept., 1759, m. Lydia Porter.
2 CONT *     vii. Jehiel, b. 22 Sept., 1762.
2 CONT * Their children include:
2 CONT * 48141i. Hannah Phelps (29 Dec 1743-)
2 CONT * 48142ii.  Sarah Phelps (2 Dec 1745-)
2 CONT * 48143iii.  Rachel Phelps (26 Dec 1746-)
2 CONT * 48144iv.  Timothy Phelps (29 Dec 1749-3 Jul 1830)
2 CONT * 48145v. Asa Phelps (10 Jan 1754-1826)
2 CONT * 48146vi.  Samuel Phelps (22 Apr 1759-15 Oct 1826)
2 CONT * 48147vii. Jehiel Phelps (22 Sep 1762-6 Sep 1830)
2 CONT --------------------
