1 NOTE {geni:about_me} *'''Military History:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''American Revolutionary War:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Service:  CONNECTICUT    Rank: PRIVATE Birth:  12-29-1749    HEBRON CONNECTICUT Death:  7-3-1830     POMPEY NEW YORK Service Description:  1) SULLIVAN'S DIVISION
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources:'''
2 CONT
2 CONT [http://services.dar.org/public/dar_research/search_adb/?action=full&p_id=A090249 Service: Listing at D.A.R. Revolutionary War ]
2 CONT
2 CONT * Reference: [http://person.ancestry.com/tree/58139821/person/32129762118 Ancestry Genealogy] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 31 2016, 22:16:07 UTC''
2 CONT
2 CONT Private, served under Sullivan, Connecticut.
2 CONT * Reference: [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=5380649 Find A Grave Memorial] - [http://www.geni.com/projects/SmartCopy/18783 SmartCopy]: ''Aug 31 2016, 22:22:27 UTC''
