2 CONT 48147. Jehiel Phelps. Born on 22 Sep 1762 in Hebron, CT.260 Jehiel died in Cortland, Cortland County, New York, on 6 Sep 1830; he was 67.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jehiel, also called Hial, Phelps.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1790 Federal Census. Cambridge, Albany County, New York Roll 6, page 313 Family of Hiel Phelps
2 CONT     1 male under 16 [Timothy]
2 CONT     1 male 16 and over [Jeheil]
2 CONT     1 female [Olive]
2 CONT
2 CONT 1810 Federal Census. New Lisbon, Otsego County, New York Roll 24, page 154 Family of H. Phelps
2 CONT     1 male under 10
2 CONT     1 male 10-15
2 CONT     1 male 16-25
2 CONT     1 male 45 and over [Jehiel]
2 CONT     2 females under 10
2 CONT     1 female 10-15
2 CONT     1 female 26-44
2 CONT
2 CONT 1820 Federal Census. New Lisbon, Otsego County, New York Roll 74, page 120 Family of Hial Phelps
2 CONT     1 male 10-15
2 CONT     1 male 26-44
2 CONT     1 male 45 and over [Jehiel]
2 CONT     2 females 10-15 Timothy Phelps is listed on the same page.
2 CONT
2 CONT 1830 Federal Census. Solon, Cortland County, New York Roll 88, page 14 Family of Hial Phelps
2 CONT     1 male 20-29
