2 CONT
2 CONT Some information regarding Jeheil Phelps and his family was provided by Anne Townsend of Cayuga, New York, 18 Feb 1999:
2 CONT     I have related Phelps in Cortland County, that married into my Livingston
2 CONT     family. Lois Livingston, m. William H. Phelps and had son Arthur D. William H. 
2 CONT     was s/o John Phelps and Elsie Finn. John was s/o Jehiel Phelps and Olive ?.
2 CONT     Jehiel, was s/o Timothy Phelps and Hannah Northman. Thomas and Asa were
2 CONT     brothers...And I am also related through Noah Phelps, and his wife Ann Dyer,
2 CONT     through their daughter Ann Phelps, who m. Thomas Landers, as his 1st. wife,
