2 CONT     Chenango Co., NY. Jehiel married Olive Mudge. Born ca 1765. Olive died in 1820. Their children include: 56660i. Timothy Phelps (ca 1789-) 56661ii. Aaron M. Phelps (ca 1793-10 Mar 1849) 56662iii. Elias Phelps (ca 1795-) 56663iv
