3 CITY Lebanon
3 STAE Connecticut
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} '''Margaret (Dewey) Phelps''' was born to parents Nathaniel and Margaret on 5 May 1702 in Lebanon, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 18 January 1721, she married Cornelius Phelps in Lebanon.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Death & Burial===
2 CONT
2 CONT Numerous on-line trees and websites show a death date of 4 January 1762 and a death place of Hebron, Connecticut. 
2 CONT
2 CONT However, no primary source record of her death can be found in the MyHeritage, American Ancestors, Ancestry.com, or FamilySearch repositories. The [https://www.ancestry.com/search/collections/2557 Barbour Collection] shows no Marg
2 CONC aret Phelps dying anywhere in Connecticut in 1762. The [https://www.familysearch.org/en/cemeteries/sites/38728/andover-road-cemetery?page=0&pageSize=50&relativesOnly=false&relativeId=&showOriginal=false&sortOrder=asc&searchText=Ph
2 CONC elps Andover Road Cemetery] webpage on FamilySearch shows no listing of a Margaret Phelps. The [https://halecollection.com/806-1-old-cemetery-records.htm Hale Collection] for Hebron also shows no record of her burial. From 26 Dece
2 CONC mber 2014 through 17 June 2026 (the date of this writing), [https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/140486446/margaret-phelps FindAGrave] volunteers have found no stone to photograph at Andover Road Cemetery.
2 CONT
2 CONT The proposed date of death is likely due to this Margaret being confused with the Margaret Dewey of Westfield, Massachusetts who was b. 12 February 1706 and d. 4 January 1762, and who married David Moseley, with a son also by that
2 CONC  name. (See SAR Membership #53659.)
2 CONT
2 CONT Until a trustworthy source is identified, this profile will not show a date or place of death, nor a place of burial.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Sources==
2 CONT
2 CONT * Margaret Dewey in the Connecticut Town Birth Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection) 
2 CONT ** Name: Margaret Dewey; Gender: Female; Birth Date: 5 May 1702; Birth Place: Lebanon, Connecticut; Father: Nathl [Nathaniel]; Mother: Margaret.
2 CONT * Cornelius Phelps in the Connecticut, Town Marriage Records, pre-1870 (Barbour Collection).
2 CONT ** Name: Cornelius Phelps; Marriage Date: 18 January 1721; Marriage Place: Lebanon, Connecticut; Spouse: Margaret Dewey.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Note===
2 CONT
2 CONT The book ''Life of George Dewey, Rear Admiral, U.S.N., and Dewey Family History'' by Adelbert Milton Dewey and Louis Marinus Dewey discusses the above-mentioned Margaret Dewey of Westfield, Massachusetts, ''not'' this one. Be care
2 CONC ful to not use it as a source for this profile.
