2 CONC r Strong, "daughters of Mr. Strong ;" Elizabeth Lyman; Sarah Edwards; wife of John Alvord; William Holton; Nathaniel Alexander; Jonathan Root; Mary Munden; wife of John Searl; Elizabeth Edwards; Abel Janes; Thomas Lyman; John Root
2 CONC ; Samuel Langton; Samuel Wright; Joseph Wright; wife of Joseph Edwards; Esa-iah (Hezekiah) Root; Benoni Stebbins. The prisoners were all admonished and ordered to pay clerk's fees, 2s. 6d. each, and "soacquitted." The wife of Samu
