2 CONT Brief Life History of Abigail
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT When Abigail Pomeroy was born on 5 January 1683, in Westfield, Hampshire, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Joseph Pomeroy, was 30 and her mother, Hannah Lyman, was 22. She married Issac Lyman in 1700
2 CONC , in Hampden, Hampden, Penobscot, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 1 daughter. She died on 3 June 1709, in New London, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 26, and wa
2 CONC s buried in Lebanon, New London, Connecticut Colony, British Colonial America.
