1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =John Hutchinson=
2 CONT * BIRTH 21 Feb 1683 Northampton, Hampshire County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 9 Feb 1727 (aged 43) age 42 Columbia, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Old Yard Cemetery, Columbia, Tolland County, Connecticut, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 46763559 Photos by JH
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Inscription'''
2 CONT IN MEMORY
2 CONT of Mr. John Hutchison a person to
2 CONT whom God gave peculiar strength
2 CONT of Natural abilities & sanctified
2 CONT them by his grace for an useful 
2 CONT Life But the Lord of Life was
2 CONT pleased to deny the World the
2 CONT the long use of those Gifts Calling
2 CONT him out of this life with a comfort-
2 CONT able hope and Expectation of A
2 CONT Better on the 9th day of February
2 CONT A.D. 1727 in the 43rd year of his age.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouse'''
2 CONT Hepzibah Washburn Hutchinson 1683–1777 (m. 1708)
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children'''
2 CONT Timothy Hutchinson 1718–1758
2 CONT
