1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Biography:
2 CONT Anna/Anne Carter was born April 1, 1725, in Weston, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, a daughter of Thomas Carter and Abigail Locke. Anna married Jonathan Hutchinson, born October 19, 1719, in Hebron, Connecticut (married 14 Fe
2 CONC b 1745 in Tolland, Connecticut ), a son of Joseph and Mary Hutchinson. Anna died four days after the birth of her only child:
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Huchason, II, born February 10, 1746, in Tolland, Connecticut. Jonathan married Elanor Post, on September 11, 1766, in Tolland county, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT Research Notes:
2 CONT Although Find A Grave indicates that Jonathan, Jr. is the son of his father's second wife, Hannah Sawyer, this is incorrect.
2 CONT
2 CONT Jonathan Huchason, Sr. married Hannah Sawyer on September 7, 1747, in Tolland County, Connecticut.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources:
2 CONT ↑ "Connecticut, Deaths, 1640-1955", database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7KV-QWR : 11 June 2020), Anna Huchason, 1745
2 CONT ↑ "Connecticut, Deaths, 1640-1955", database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F732-JX7 : 11 June 2020), Jonathan Huchason, 1745
2 CONT ↑ "Connecticut, Deaths, 1640-1955", database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7LW-44V : 11 June 2020), Jonathan, Jn.r Hutchinson, 1766
2 CONT ↑ Find A Grave: Memorial #45244495 Jonathan Hutchinson
2 CONT ↑ "Connecticut, Deaths, 1640-1955", database, FamilySearch (https://www.familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7LW-9TT : 11 June 2020), Jonathan Huchason, 1747
