2 CONC 5 Jan 1680/1, Marshfield, MA, d. ca 1706, Little Compton, RI; m. 16 Jun 1702 Martha Wilbore, dau/o Joseph & Ann (Brownell) Wilbore, b. 20 Aug 1684; m2 24 Oct 1707, Thomas Burgess, who m2 1721, Patience (-?-) 
2 CONT
