2 CONC  [3] ABSTRACTS OF BRISTOL COUNTY, MA PROBATE RECORDS, 1687-1745, by H.L. Peter Rounds 1987 [4] LITTLE COMPTON FAMILIES pub. by Little Compton Historical Society from Records Compiled by Benjamin Franklin Wilbour, 1967 [6] VITAL RE
2 CONC CORD OF RHODE ISLAND, 1636-1850, Vol. 4, Parts 4-7, James H. Arnold, 1893 a. Little Compton brths, p. 106 b. Tiverton births, p. 68 c. Little Compton Intentions & Marriages, p. 21
