2 CONT Sarah Keene's parents were Joseph Keene born circa 1689 - died 5 Nov 1767 in Kittery, York, Maine and Abigail Andrews born circa 1710. Joseph & Abigail were married 19 April 1733 in Scarborough, Cumberland, Maine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah married Nathan Closson Oct 4, 1756 Portsmouth Rockingham, New Hampshire by Rev. Samuel Haven.
2 CONT
2 CONT The New England Historical & Genealogical Register, 1847-2011 Name: Nathan Clossen Event Type: Marriage Marriage Date: 4 Oct 1756 Marriage Place: Portsmouth, Rockingham, New Hampshire, USA Spouse Name: Sarah Cane
2 CONT
2 CONT Children:  Abigail b 1757 Mary b abt. 1761 Mercy b 1760 John b 1764 Nehemiah b abt 1768 Grace b 1770 Jane b abt 1772 Sally b 1775 Josiah b 1764
2 CONT
