2 CONT The Life Summary of John
2 CONT
2 CONT When John Closson was born on 5 March 1764, in Sedgwick, Hancock, Maine, United States, his father, Nathan Closson, was 43 and his mother, Sarah Keene, was 24. He married Keturah Tobin about 1785, in Deer Isle, Hancock, Maine, Uni
2 CONC ted States. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 5 daughters. He died on 12 March 1854, in Deer Isle, Hancock, Maine, United States, at the age of 90, and was buried in Clossen Cemetery, Deer Isle, Hancock, Maine, United S
2 CONC tates.
