2 CONC oton, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 6 daughters. He lived in Massachusetts, United States in 1663. He died on 28 January 1713, in Lynn, Essex, Massachus
2 CONC etts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, at the age of 49, and was buried in Western Burial Ground, Lynn, Essex, Massachusetts, United States.''''''
