2 CONT Brief Life History of Mary
2 CONT
2 CONT When Mary Breed was born on 24 August 1664, in Lynn, Essex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Allen Breed Jr., was 33 and her mother, Mary Sargent, was 27. She married Thomas Lewis on 25 October 1686,
2 CONC  in Groton, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 6 daughters. She died on 19 January 1736, in her hometown, at the age of 71, and was buried in Western Burial 
2 CONC Ground, Lynn, Essex, Massachusetts, United States.
