1 NOTE {geni:about_me} === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT == Biography ==
2 CONT David Day was born 18 July 1710 in Colchester, New London, Connecticut.<ref>"Connecticut Births and Christenings, 1649-1906," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7HM-YDQ : 3 December 2014), David Day, 
2 CONC 18 Jul 1710; citing ; FHL microfilm unknown.</ref><ref name="ColchesterBC">White, Lorraine Cook, ed. ''The Barbour Collection of Connecticut Town Vital Records.'' Vol. 1-55. Colchester. Baltimore, MD, USA: Genealogical Publishing 
2 CONC Co., 1994-2002.</ref>  
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Hannah Kellogg 20 November 1740. 
2 CONT He died about 12 September 1775.<ref>"Connecticut Deaths and Burials, 1772-1934," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7ZC-VZQ : 3 December 2014), David Day, 12 Sep 1775; citing Colchester, Connecticut,
2 CONC  reference ; FHL microfilm 3,113.</ref><ref>"Connecticut Deaths and Burials, 1772-1934," database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:F7N8-TNP : 3 December 2014), Lieut. David Day, 15 Sep 1775; citing Colchester
2 CONC , Conn., reference pg 156; FHLmicrofilm 3,327.</ref>
2 CONT
2 CONT == Sources ==
2 CONT <references />*[http://bigelowsociety.com/rod/day.htm BIGELOW, Roger John. "The Day Family"]
2 CONT
