1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Son of William Cobb and Anne (Willis) Cobb. They were married at Taunton,MA on Apr 24,1737.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, first, on Oct 10,1765 at Norton,MA, Hannah Bassett. She was born on Sept 25,1747 at Bridgewater,MA, a daughter of Benjamin Bassett and Hannah Macomber. She died on Jul 31,1770 at Warwick,MA.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married, second, on Nov 12,1771 at Warwick,MA, Priscilla Burnett. She was born on Jan 17,1747/48 at Sutton,MA, a daughter of Dr. Robert Burnett and Anna (Wilkins) Burnett. She died in 1819 at Stockton, Chautauqua Co., NY, and i
2 CONC s buried at Greenwood Cemetary there.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children(by first marriage): Hannah Cobb Pelton (first wife of [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=13125906 Joseph Pelton]) and David Cobb Jr.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children(by second marriage): Josiah Cobb, Anna Cobb Spinning(first wife of [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=7382636 Benjamin Spinning]), Jonathan Cobb, Rachel Cobb Shepard, Robert Cobb(husband of [http://www
2 CONC .findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=105199303 Nancy Shaw Cobb]), James Cobb, Eunice Cobb Smith, Williams Cobb, and Anne Cobb.
