2 CONT Joseph TILDEN b: BEF 1621 in Tenterden, co. Kent, England
2 CONT Mary TILDEN b: in Tenterden, co. Kent, England
2 CONT Sarah TILDEN b: in Tenterden, co. Kent, England
2 CONT Judith TILDEN b: in Tenterden, co. Kent, England
2 CONT Lydia TILDEN b: in Tenterden, co. Kent, England
