1 NOTE  Huckstep is spelled a variety of ways, including Hucstep, Hucstepe, Huckstepe, etc.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Huckstep (Stephen2, Lawrence1) was born in Tenterden, Kent, England,
2 CONT before February 11, 1587/8 (chr. date). Lydia died in Massachusetts, at age
2 CONT unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married twice.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 1) Nathaniel Tilden circa 1606 in Tenterden, Kent,
2 CONT England. Nathaniel was born before July 28, 1583 (chr. date) in Tenterden,
2 CONT Kent, England. Nathaniel was the son of Thomas Tilden and Alice Bigge. Nathaniel
2 CONT died 1641 in Scituate, MA, at age 57. He was christened July 28, 1583 in
2 CONT Tenterden, Kent, England. Nathaniel's estate was probated September 6, 1641 in
2 CONT General Court, Plymouth Colony. Birth, death, and marriage dates from "The
2 CONT Abridged Compendium of American Genealogy", Vol. III. Birthdate and parents IGI
2 CONT Batch 8479802-24; christening 28JUL1583 Batch 7210529-74.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married 2) Timothy Hatherly after 1640/1 in Scituate, MA. Timothy was born date
2 CONT unknown in England. Timothy died October 24, 1666 in Scituate, MA, at age
2 CONT unknown. Timothy's estate was probated October 30, 1666 in General Court,
2 CONT Plymouth Colony.
2 CONT She was christened February 11, 1587/8 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT Lydia Huckstep and Nathaniel Tilden had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Thomas4 Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before October 23,
2 CONT 1608 (chr. date). His body was interred January 19, 1618/9 in Tenterden, Kent,
2 CONT England. He was christened October 23, 1608 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Mary Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before May 20, 1610
2 CONT (chr. date). Mary died date unknown in Massachusetts, at age unknown. She
2 CONT married Thomas Lapham March 13, 1636/7 in Scituate, MA.(15) Thomas was born
2 CONT circa 1610 in probably, Kent, England. Thomas died 1648 in Scituate, MA, at
2 CONT age 38. Thomas's estate was probated October 1, 1651 in Plymouth
2 CONT Colony. She was christened May 20, 1610 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. Joseph Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before January 12,
2 CONT 1611/2 (chr. date). His body was interred March 15, 1611/2 in Tenterden, Kent,
2 CONT England. He was christened January 12, 1611/2 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. Sarah Tilden was born in Tenderden, Kent, England, before June 13, 1613
2 CONT (chr. date). Sarah died March 20, 1676/7 in NC, at age 63. She
2 CONT married George Sutton March 13, 1636/7 in Massachusetts.
2 CONT She was christened June 13, 1613 in Tenderden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. Joseph Tilden was born in Tenderden, Kent, England, before April 29,
2 CONT 1615 (chr. date). Joseph died May 1670 in probably, Scituate, MA, at age 55.
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Twisdem November 20, 1649 in probably, Scituate, MA.
2 CONT Elizabeth was born date unknown. Elizabeth died date unknown at age unknown.
2 CONT He was christened April 29, 1615 in Tenderden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. Stephen Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before March 31,
2 CONT 1617 (chr. date). His body was interred October 21, 1619 in Tenterden, Kent,
2 CONT England. He was christened March 31, 1617 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT vii. Thomas Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before January 19,
2 CONT 1618/9 (chr. date). Thomas died 1705 in Marshfield, MA, at age 86. He married
2 CONT twice. He married Elizabeth Bourne circa 1653 in probably, Marshfield, MA.
2 CONT Elizabeth was born circa 1618 in maybe, Kent, England. Elizabeth was the
2 CONT daughter of Thomas Bourne and Elizabeth Bassenden?. Her body was interred
2 CONT December 12, 1663 in Marshfield, MA.(22) He married Mary Holmes January 24,
2 CONT 1664/5 in probably, Marshfield, MA. Mary was born circa 1640. Mary died date
2 CONT unknown at age unknown. He was christened January 19, 1618/9 in
2 CONT Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT viii. Judith Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before October
2 CONT 22, 1620 (chr. date). Judith died date unknown at age unknown. She married
2 CONT Abraham Preble date unknown. Abraham was born date unknown. Abraham died date
2 CONT unknown at age unknown.
2 CONT She was christened October 22, 1620 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT ix. Winifred Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before October
2 CONT 20, 1622 (chr. date). Her body was interred September 14, 1627 in Tenterden,
2 CONT Kent, England. She was christened October 20, 1622 in Tenterden, Kent,
2 CONT England.
2 CONT
2 CONT x. Lydia Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before May 30, 1624
2 CONT (chr. date). Her body was interred September 15, 1624 in Tenterden, Kent,
2 CONT England. She was christened May 30, 1624 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT xi. Lydia Tilden was born in Tenterden, Kent, England, before September 28,
2 CONT 1625 (chr. date). Lydia died date unknown at age unknown. She married Richard
2 CONT Garrett date unknown. Richard was born date unknown. Richard died date unknown
2 CONT at age unknown. She was christened September 28, 1625 in Tenterden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT xii. Stephen Tilden was born in Tenderden, Kent, England, before October
2 CONT 11, 1629 (chr. date). Stephen died August 22, 1711 in Scituate, MA, at age
2 CONT 81. He married Hannah Little January 25, 1660/1 in Scituate, MA.)
2 CONT Hannah was born circa 1635 in Massachusetts. Hannah died May 13, 1710 in
2 CONT Scituate, MA, at age 74. He was christened October 11, 1629 in Tenderden, Kent, England.
2 CONT
2 CONT
