2 CONC &GSfn=george&GSmid=46960918&GRid=28555387&  George A. Sutton, ] born April 12, 1613, England. Died April 12, 1669, Albermarle County, Perquimans District, North Carolina. Son of [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GR
2 CONC id=54917584  Ambrose Sutton ] and [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=54917751  Sarah Warner. ]     
