2 CONC in/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=32391477  John Washburn ] and [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=42076043  Elizabeth Mitchell. ] 
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter [http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=132336239  Elizabeth Lapham. ] Married John Studley.
2 CONT
2 CONT More on George Sutton, Served as a servant in the party of Nathaniel Tilden , of Tenterden , Co. Kent , England .  He sailed in 1634 on the " Hercules, "  of Sandwich , Co. Kent , England.  He may have been one of those poorer Pur
2 CONC itans who often worked their passage to America with  wealthier relatives or friends .  Within two years of the settlement group at Scituate he married Sarah Tilden , daughter of Nathaniel  Tilden.   
2 CONT
2 CONT Notes: On all the researches I did on George Sutton never saw that he " George " has a ( Twin ) brother.
2 CONT
