2 CONC tained by James A. Streeter (contributor 47287380). Vital Records of Scituate Massachusetts to the year 1850, two volumes, (Boston: New England Historic Genealogical Society, 1909), 2:280 (marriage) L. Vernon Briggs, History and R
2 CONC ecords of the First Congregational Church, Hanover, Mass., (Boston: Wallace Spooner, Printer, 1895), p. 183 (death), 286 (burial)
