1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Mary Raynesford (1632 - 1694)
2 CONT *Birth 	1 Jun 1632 	Boston, Massachusetts  
2 CONT *Gender 	Female 
2 CONT *Died 	12 Apr 1694 	Falmouth, Massachusetts  
2 CONT *Father 	Edward Raynesford,   d. Deceased  &=Mother 	Mary,   d. Deceased 
2 CONT *Family 1 	James Percival,   d. 1692 
2 CONT *Family 2 	William Bassett, II,   b. 1624, Plymouth, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. 10 Jun 1670, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA  - Married 	1652 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary and her twin brother Joshua were on June 1, 1632, in Boston. Joshua died three months later in September 1632. Their mother, the wife of Edward Rainsford, died in June 1632, probably from complications from the birth of the t
2 CONC wins. Mary's father, Edward Rainsford, remarried before 1634. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary Rainsford married (1) William Bassett II in 1653 in Duxbury, Plymouth County, Massachusetts. He died in 1670. Mary married (2) James Percival of Sandwich. <br/
2 CONT
2 CONT Mary and William had the following children:
2 CONT * 1. Mary Bassett,   b. 21 Nov 1654, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. Bef 1692 
2 CONT * 2. William Bassett, III,   b. 1656, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. 29 Sep 1721 
2 CONT *  	3. John Bassett,   b. 1658, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. Deceased 
2 CONT *  	4. Thomas Bassett,   b. 1659, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. Deceased 
2 CONT * 5. Sarah Bassett,   b. 1662, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. Deceased 
2 CONT *  	6. Richard Bassett,   b. 1665, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. Deceased 
2 CONT * 7. Nathan Bassett,   b. 1667, Sandwich, Massachusetts, USA ,   d. 16 Nov 1743, Chilmark, Martha's Vineyard, Massachusetts 
2 CONT
2 CONT James and Mary had the following children:
2 CONT
2 CONT #James, b. January 18, 1671/2 at Sandwich,[4][10] m. February 18, 1695/6 Abigail Robinson at Sandwich,[10] d. May 19, 1738 at East Haddam, Connecticut[10]
2 CONT #John,[4] b. probably about 1673 at Sandwich, m. June 3, 1703 Mary Bourne at Sandwich,[10] d. after April 3, 1738 at Barnstable, Massachusetts[10]
2 CONT #Elizabeth, b. September 10, 1675 at Sandwich, m. August 25, 1704 Joseph Ashley at Falmouth, d. before January 1, 1728/9 at Rochester 
2 CONT
