1 NOTE {geni:about_me} From http://wc.rootsweb.ancestry.com/cgi-bin/igm.cgi?op=GET&db=sanford%2Dshulsen&id=I7109
2 CONT
2 CONT Since we lack a date for Sarah's death, we can only guess at which children are by which wife. Otis obtained the names of the three older children from the probate records, and thought they were probably born in Falmouth, and the 
2 CONC remaining seven in Eastham. The move to Eastham about 1691 may have coincided with his marriage to Jane. Therefore I have assigned the first four children to Sarah, and the last six to Jane.
