2 PLAC Marshfield, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Province
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Mercy was the daughter Peregrine White [born onboard the Mayflower in 1620; died 1704 in Marshfield, MA] and Sarah Bassett.
2 CONT
2 CONT Mercy was married to William Sherman on Feb. 3, 1697.  They had six children.
2 CONT
2 CONT Descendant of Mayflower passengers Peregrine White, William White, Susanna (Winslow) White.
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Family 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://mathcs.clarku.edu/~djoyce/gen/report/rr04/rr04_328.html
2 CONT
2 CONT 8386. William Sherman. Born on 19 Apr 1672 in Marshfield, MA.60 William died in Marshfield, MA, on 26 Feb 1740; he was 67.31 Occupation: Yeoman.
2 CONT
2 CONT On 3 Feb 1697 when William was 24, he married Mercy White, daughter of Peregrine White (Nov 1620-20 Jul 1704) & Sarah Bassett (ca 1628-22 Jan 1711), in Marshfield, MA.60 “William Sherman & Mercy White were married feb. 3^d 1697”. 
2 CONC Born ca 1670 in Marshfield, MA.31 Mercy died in Marshfield, MA on 12 Jun 1739.31
2 CONT
2 CONT Their children include:
2 CONT #Thankful Sherman (10 Apr 1699-28 Sep 1739)
2 CONT # Sarah Sherman (8 May 1701-7 Aug 1768)
2 CONT #Mary Sherman (Twin, died unmarried) (1 Jun 1711-aft 1781)
2 CONT # Abigail Sherman (Twin, died unmarried) (1 Jun 1711-aft 1781)
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
2 CONT *The Mayflower Descendant:” Volume 25, 1923.  Massachusetts Society of Mayflower Descendants Staff.  Page 133.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=S4kSUt-FlcYC&lpg=PA133&ots=K5raCJjxCN&dq=Mercy%20(White)%20Sherman&pg=PA133#v=onepa
2 CONC ge&q&f=true GoogleBooks]
2 CONT * “Representative Men and Old Families of Southeastern Massachusetts: Containing Historical Sketches of Prominent and Representative Citizens and Genealogical Records of Many of the Old Families ... “ J.H. Beers & Company, 1912.  
2 CONC Page 1519.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=GHIWAAAAYAAJ&lpg=PA1519&ots=1q0yahvJRj&dq=Mercy%20(White)%20Sherman&pg=PA1519#v=onepage&q&f=true GoogleBooks]
2 CONT * https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/159090258/marcy-sharman
2 CONT * http://www.cyberancestors.com/cummins/ps38/ps38_453.htm --------------------
