2 CONT Dorcas (Joyce) Bassett was born on 19 Sep 1640, in Yarmouth, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony. She was the daughter of John Joyce and Dorothy (Cotchet) Joyce.
2 CONT Marriage
2 CONT
2 CONT Dorcas married Nathaniel Bassett about 1661, in Yarmouth, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony.
2 CONT
