2 CONT 28 Oct 1690; d. on 26 Jan 1742, in Truro, Barnstable County, Massachsetts Bay Colony.
2 CONT 2. Ruth Bassett, b. cir. 1673, in Yarmouth, Plymouth County, Massachusetts Bay Colony; d. Jan 1710, in Barnstable County, Province of Massachusetts Bay Colony.
2 CONT 3. Samuel Bassett , b. abt. 1676, in Yarmouth, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony; d. bef. 23 Feb 1760, in East Greenwich, Kent County, Rhode Island.
2 CONT 4. Joseph Bassett, b. 25 Sep 1677, in Yarmouth, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony; d. 6 Jan 1750, in Yarmouth, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony.
2 CONT 5. Nathaniel Bassett, b. 25 Sep 1677, in Yarmouth, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony; d. bef. 27 Feb 1745, in Chatham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony.
2 CONT 6. Hannah (Bassett) Covell, b. 1678, in Yarmouth, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony; d. abt. 1729, in Eastham, Barnstable County, Massachusetts Bay Colony; m. Joseph Covell on 1 Mar 1704, in Eastham, Barnstable County, M
2 CONC assachusetts Bay Colony.
