2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel Bassett. Born BET 1674 AND 1678 Yarmouth, Barnstable Co., Massachusetts, USA. Died BEF 23 FEB 1760 East Greenwich, Kent Co., Rhode Island, USA. He was the son of Nathaniel Bassett and Dorcas Joyce.
2 CONT
2 CONT He married Elizabeth Jones. Born BET 1678 AND 1681 probably, East Greenwich, Kent Co., Rhode Island, USA. Died BEF 1742 Rhode Island, USA. Children of Samuel Bassett and Elizabeth Jones are:
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel b: 7 Apr 1700, North Kingstown, Washington Co., Rhode Island. d: 1766 probably, Coventry, Kent Co., Rhode Island, USA.
2 CONT Joseph b: 10 Dec 1702
2 CONT William b: 17 Oct 1704
2 CONT Elizabeth b: 5 Mar 1708
2 CONT Hannah b: 14 Jul 1710; m. 18 Aug 1834, Richard Biddlecomb
2 CONT Sarah b: 22 Nov 1712
2 CONT Ruth b: 25 Jun 1715
2 CONT Dorcas b: Abt 1717
2 CONT Death
2 CONT
2 CONT He passed away before 1760.
