2 CONT Brief Life History of Sarah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Sarah Bassett was born about 1682, in Yarmouth, Barnstable, Plymouth Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Nathaniel Bassett I, was 54 and her mother, Dorcas Joyce, was 43. She married John Nickerson on 11 July 1706, 
2 CONC in Harwich, Barnstable, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 3 sons and 1 daughter. She died after 1747, in Ridgefield, Fairfield, Connecticut, United States.
