2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Bassett-303
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Bassett was born 1682 in Yarmouth, Barnstable, Massachusetts to Nathaniel Bassett (1628-1710) and Dorcas Joyce (1644-1707).
2 CONT
2 CONT She was mentioned in her father's will dated 08 January 1709/10: "I give and bequeath unto six of my children viz. Mary Mulford, Samll Bassett, Hannah Covell, Joseph Bassett, Sarah Nickerson & Nathaniel Bassett all the remainder o
2 CONC f my estate to be divided amongst them so that each of my sd three sons have double to each of my sd three daughters in value & my said three daughters each one a single share thereof only my will is that they provide and set up s
2 CONC ome suitable Grave Stones to my Grave after my burial."[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah as a widow had her taxes allowed her in Chatham in 1722 and lived in East Harwich in 1726.
2 CONT
2 CONT “On febuary the 9day 1727/8 Then John Rogers and widdow Sarah nickerson both of Harwich had their intention of marriage entered in this book… April 18 day 1728 
2 CONT
2 CONT Then John Rogers and Sarah Nickerson both of Harwich were married in Harwich by me Joseph Doane Justice Peace”
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah was living in 1744 when she was mentioned in a deed by her son Eleazer Rogers.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah (Bassett) Nickerson (1682 - aft. 1744) 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Sarah Nickerson formerly Bassett===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1682 in Yarmouth, Barnstable, Plymouth Colony
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Nathaniel Bassett and Dorcas (Joyce) Bassett
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Mary (Bassett) Mulford, Ruth Bassett, Nathaniel Bassett, Joseph Bassett, Hannah (Bassett) Covell, William Bassett and Samuel Bassett
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of John Nickerson — married before Jan 1710 [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Reuben Nickerson, Jeremiah Nickerson and Sarah (Nickerson) Cole
2 CONT
2 CONT Died after 1744 after age 62 in Harwich, Barnstable, Province of Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Bassett-303 created 7 Feb 2011 | Last modified 2 Mar 2017
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT ↑ Barnstable County Probate Records, Vol. 3:144-148
2 CONT The Nickerson Family- Pauline Wixon Derick, Ed., The Nickerson Family Assoc., Inc., 1976- p. 34
2 CONT Harwich V.R.
