2 CONT Brief Life History of Benjamin C
2 CONT
2 CONT When Benjamin C Leonard was born in 1725, in Middleborough, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Joseph Leanard, was 33 and his mother, Eunice Cushman, was 34. He married Bethiah Drake about 17
2 CONC 55, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 10 daughters. He died on 22 October 1818, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 9
2 CONC 3, and was buried in Massachusetts, United States.
