1 NAME Ruth /Eustis/
2 GIVN Ruth
2 SURN Eustis
2 _MARNM (Whittemore)
1 SEX F
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT RUTH EUSTIS WHITTEMORE Kendall 1698-1765
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Eustis Whittemore was born on the 2nd of February 1698 the daughter of William Eustis (1659-1736) and Sarah CUTLER Eustis (1666-1748) of Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Eustis Married FIRST: Joseph Whittemore on the 30th of April 1724 at Boston, Middlesex, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth EUSTIS and Joseph WHITTEMORE were the parents of 7 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 - Samuel Whittemore 26 Mar 1732
2 CONT 2 - Ruth Whittemore 19 Feb 1724/25
2 CONT 3 - Joseph Whittemore, JR 19 Nov 1726
2 CONT 4 - Hannah Whittemore 20 Sep 1728
2 CONT 5 - Abigail Whittemore 2 Aug 1730
2 CONT 6 - Mary Whittemore 6 Feb 1733/34
2 CONT 7 - Nathan Whittemore 16 Sep 1735
2 CONT Ruth EUSTIS Whittemore Married SECOND: Abraham Kendall 1712-1799 son of Jacob KENDALL 1659–1717 and Alice Hassell 1665–1691.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth and Abraham Kendall were the Parents of a daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 - Elizabeth Kendall 1739–1784
2 CONT Ruth EUSTIS Whittemore Kendall died on the 17th of June 1765 Rumney Marsh, Rumney Marsh, Chelsea, Suffolk, Massachusetts and was buried at the Meetinghouse Hill Cemetery in Dunstable, Middlesex County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio and research by 8th Great Granddaughter, Carole Anne Brown-44556 Whittemore on the 28th of September 2016.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Eustis-44
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Ruth (Eustis) Kendall (1698 - 1765)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Kendall formerly Eustis aka Whittemore
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 2 Feb 1698 in Winnissemmet, Chelsea, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of William Eustis and Sarah (Cutler) Eustis
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Mary (Eustice) Townsend, Sarah (Eustis) Baldwin, Joseph Eustis and Thomas Eustis
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Joseph Whittemore — married 30 Apr 1724 (to 30 Dec 1735) in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Abraham Kendall — married 4 Jun 1737 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Ruth (Whittemore) Macomb, Joseph Whittemore, Hannah (Whittemore) Kendall, Abigail (Whittemore) Wright, Samuel Whittemore, Mary (Whittemore) Hartshorn, Nathan Whittemore and Elizabeth Kendall
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 17 Jun 1765 in Dunstable, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Eustis-44 created 30 Apr 2016 | Last modified 19 Aug 2020
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Sources
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Book: A bicentennial history of the James Whittemore Family of Union, New York 1776-1976 by Kenneth Robert Whittemore, JR.
