1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/94210884/israel-whittemore
2 CONT
2 CONT Capt. Israel Whittemore, son of Jeremiah and Patience (Reed) Whittemore was born in Weston, Middlesex, Massachusetts 10 July 1732, and he died in Weston on 19 September 1812. He married in Watertown, Middlesex, Massachusetts on 1 
2 CONC May 1755, Abigail Brown.
2 CONT
2 CONT A Revolutionary War soldier, and a Selectman of Weston, MA
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Israel & Abigail (Brown) Whittemore (all born in Weston)
2 CONT 1. Abigail, b. 22 March 1756; died 15 November 1775
2 CONT 2. Lois, b. 11 September 1758, married Benjamin Carter
2 CONT 3. Patience, b. 27 August 1760; died 6 January 1782
2 CONT 4. Aaron, b. 13 July 1762; married Lucy (Hewes) Sanderson
2 CONT 5. John, b. 18 April 1764
2 CONT 6. Anna, b. 24 August 1767, married Abijah Whitney, d. in Weston 5 April 1819
2 CONT 7. Sally, b. 1 October 1770; married Nathan Child
2 CONT
2 CONT Source: Vital Records of Weston, Massachusetts
2 CONT http://www.ma-vitalrecords.org/MA/Middlesex/Weston/
