1 NOTE {geni:about_me} 
2 CONT
2 CONT RUTH EUSTIS WHITTEMORE Kendall 1698-1765
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Eustis Whittemore was born on the 2nd of February 1698 the daughter of William Eustis (1659-1736) and Sarah CUTLER Eustis (1666-1748) of Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Eustis Married FIRST: 
2 CONT Joseph Whittemore on the 30th of April 1724 at Boston, Middlesex, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth EUSTIS and Joseph WHITTEMORE were the parents of 7 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 - Samuel Whittemore 26 Mar 1732
2 CONT 2 - Ruth Whittemore 19 Feb 1724/25
2 CONT 3 - Joseph Whittemore, JR 19 Nov 1726
2 CONT 4 - Hannah Whittemore 20 Sep 1728
2 CONT 5 - Abigail Whittemore 2 Aug 1730
2 CONT 6 - Mary Whittemore 6 Feb 1733/34
2 CONT 7 - Nathan Whittemore 16 Sep 1735
2 CONT Ruth EUSTIS Whittemore Married SECOND: Abraham Kendall 1712-1799 son of Jacob KENDALL 1659–1717 and Alice Hassell 1665–1691.
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth and Abraham Kendall were the Parents of a daughter:
2 CONT
2 CONT 1 - Elizabeth Kendall 1739–1784
2 CONT Ruth EUSTIS Whittemore Kendall died on the 17th of June 1765 Rumney Marsh, Rumney Marsh, Chelsea, Suffolk, Massachusetts and was buried at the Meetinghouse Hill Cemetery in Dunstable, Middlesex County, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Eustis-44
2 CONT
