2 CONT Ruth (Eustis) Kendall (1698 - 1765)===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Ruth Kendall formerly Eustis aka Whittemore
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 2 Feb 1698 in Winnissemmet, Chelsea, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of William Eustis and Sarah (Cutler) Eustis
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of Mary (Eustice) Townsend, Sarah (Eustis) Baldwin, Joseph Eustis and Thomas Eustis
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Joseph Whittemore — married 30 Apr 1724 (to 30 Dec 1735) in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts Baymap
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of Abraham Kendall — married 4 Jun 1737 in Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Ruth (Whittemore) Macomb, Joseph Whittemore, Hannah (Whittemore) Kendall, Abigail (Whittemore) Wright, Samuel Whittemore, Mary (Whittemore) Hartshorn, Nathan Whittemore and Elizabeth Kendall
2 CONT
2 CONT Died 17 Jun 1765 in Dunstable, Middlesex, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Eustis-44 created 30 Apr 2016 | Last modified 19 Aug 2020
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Bio and research by 8th Great Granddaughter, Carole Anne Brown-44556 Whittemore on the 28th of September 2016.
