1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT
2 CONT === Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Jane Elliot''' was born 4 April 1658 at Taunton, Massachusetts, and died there on  9 Nov 1689.  She was the daughter of James Bell and Esther Lugg.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Thomas Eliot "of Swansea, Taunton, and Reheboth {Massachusetts} married Jane Bell in Boston, Massachusetts by 1678/9. [1].  Thomas Eliot was born about 1652 in Rehoboth, Massachusetts and died there 23 May 1700. [4]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Jane & Thomas Elliot's children, born Boston, Massachusetts:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Abigail Elliott, born 12 February 1678[2]
2 CONT #Thomas Elliot, b. 1681 [3]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT ==concerns==
2 CONT '''not a son of https://www.geni.com/people/Jacob-Eliot-Jr/6000000003941239586
