2 CONT https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Kingsbury-66
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah (Kingsbury) Crossman was born on February 1st 1635 in Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts to Joseph Kingsbury and Millicent (Ames) Kingsbury. She is the sister of Mary (Kingsbury) Cooper, Elizabeth (Kingsbury) Brewer, Joseph King
2 CONC sbury, Eleazar Kingsbury, John Kingsbury and	Nathaniel Kingsbury. She married Robert Crossman on May 24th 1652 in Dedham, Norfolk, Massachusetts. Her children are: Sarah (Crossman) Woodward, John Crossman, Mary (Crossman) Gould, R
2 CONC obert Crossman, Joseph Crossman Sr., Nathaniel Crossman, Eleazer Crossman, Elizabeth Crossman, Samuel Crossman, Mercy (Crossman) Thrasher, Thomas Crossman and Susanna Crossman. Sarah died on November 24th 1686 in Taunton, Bristol,
2 CONC  Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Profile last modified 25 Jan 2017 | Created 30 Dec 2010
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT She died 9 JUN 1684, Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts; age 49.[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Robert Crossman 25 MAY 1652 in Dedham MA.[2]
2 CONT
2 CONT She died 24 NOV 1686 in Taunton, Bristol County, MA
2 CONT
