1 NAME Robert Crossman, of Taunton
1 SEX M
1 BURI
2 PLAC Plains Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Taunton
3 STAE Massachusetts
3 CTRY United States
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1620
2 ADDR
3 STAE England
1 DEAT
