1 NOTE {geni:about_me} https://ancestors.familysearch.org/en/K255-STT/sarah-crossman-1653-1696
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Crossman
2 CONT Female
2 CONT 2 March 1653–after 29 June 1696
2 CONT •
2 CONT K255-STT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Sarah
2 CONT When Sarah Crossman was born on 2 March 1653, in Dedham, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Robert Crossman, was 31 and her mother, Sarah Kingsbury, was 18. She married John Woodward on 11 November 167
2 CONC 5, in Rehoboth, Bristol, Plymouth Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 7 sons and 1 daughter. She died after 29 June 1696, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, and
2 CONC  was buried in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
