2 CONT
2 CONT ===Biography===
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Mercy (Taunton Proprietors Records); Mercye (Plymouth Colony Records) Crossman [Crosman in both records] was born 20 March 1669/70 in Taunton,[1] Bristol County, Province of Massachusetts Bay. Her parents were Robert Crossman and 
2 CONC Sarah Kingsbury.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married John Thrasher 26 January 1686/7 in Taunton.
2 CONT
2 CONT She died about 1693-1764, or alternatively, after 1697. Both dates were presented without sources, and no investigation has been made..
2 CONT
2 CONT Mercy (Crossman) Thrasher (1670 - aft. 1697)
