2 CONT Brief Life History of David
2 CONT When David White was born on 27 June 1731, in Raynham, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, John White Jr, was 49 and his mother, Elizabeth Bell Crossman, was 39. He married Bethia Daggett on 26
2 CONC  October 1749. He died on 13 May 1831, in Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 99.
