2 CONT Brief Life History of Sarah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Sarah Briggs was born on 10 September 1669, in Taunton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, William Briggs, was 24 and her mother, Sarah Macomber, was 23. She married John Lane on 21 Janua
2 CONC ry 1691, in Hingham, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 5 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 12 November 1727, in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial Americ
2 CONC a, at the age of 58, and was buried in Norton Common Cemetery, Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
2 CONT
