2 CONT William Briggs
2 CONT
2 CONT Genealogical and Family History of the State of Connecticut: A Record of the Achievements of Her People in the Making of a Commonwealth and the Founding of a Nation. Volume I Briggs (II) William Briggs , of Taunton, Massachusetts 
2 CONC , thought to be son of Clement Briggs , and mentioned by Savage as probably brother of Clement 's son Jonathan , settled with others of this family in Taunton . He married, in November, 1666 , Sarah Macomber . Children, born in Ta
2 CONC unton : William , January 25, 1667-68 , mentioned below; Thomas (twin), September 9, 1669 ; Sarah (twin), September 10, 1669 , a day later than her brother; Elizabeth , March 14, 1671 ; Hannah , November 4, 1672 ; Mary , August 14
2 CONC , 1674 ; Matthew , February 5, 1675 ; John , March 19, 1680
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT From ''Genealogical and Family History of the State of New Hampshire'':
2 CONT
2 CONT >John Lane married second about 1693 Sarah Briggs who was admitted to the church in Norton on profession of faith in 1718 and died November 12 1727 aged eighty three years.
