1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Not the same as https://www.geni.com/people/Elizabeth-Briggs/6000000139675938031
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth was born to William Briggs and Sarah Macomber on March 14, 1671[1][2]
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Macomber Briggs, daughter of Williams Briggs and Sarah Macomber married Elkanah Bobet, son of Edward Bobet and Sarah Tarne on 25 June 1689 in Tauton, Bristol County, Massachusetts. It is the children of Elkanah and Eliza
2 CONC beth who begin using Babbitt as a last name instead of Bobet.
2 CONT
2 CONT They had ten children. Elizabeth died on August 15, 1729, in Berkeley, Bristol, Massachusetts, at the age of 58.
2 CONT
