1 NOTE {geni:about_me} DEACON MATTHEW BRIGGS
2 CONT
2 CONT The first of several Deacon Matthew Briggs in Bristol County, "Matthew was the son of William and Sarah (Macomber) Briggs.  He started the family businesses of a metal foundry, blacksmithing, and built a gristmill".  Deacon Matthe
2 CONC w Briggs is interred at the Dighton Town Cemetery in Dighton, MA.  Additionally interred at the Dighton Town Cemetery are spouse Abigail (Burt) Briggs (1676 - 1752).
2 CONT
2 CONT Data per Find A Grave Memorial #70616262 / Created May 30, 2011 by Dennis Hockman
