1 NOTE {geni:about_me} When Deacon Timothy Briggs II was born on 27 April 1745, in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Timothy Briggs I, was 32 and his mother, Marcy Briggs, was 28. He married
2 CONC  Abigail Pattin on 22 June 1770, in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 2 daughters. He died on 10 November 1819, in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts, Unit
2 CONC ed States, at the age of 74, and was buried in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts, United States.
