2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of William
2 CONT
2 CONT When William Ames was born on 6 November 1673, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, John Ames, was 26 and his mother, Sarah Willis, was 22. He married Mary Hayward on 13 Decembe
2 CONC r 1698, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 1 son and 5 daughters. He died on 20 November 1712, in his hometown, at the age of 39.
