2 CONT ===Hannah Ames
2 CONT * Birth: 1692 - West Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts 
2 CONT * Death: Jan 10 1767 - Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts
2 CONT * Parents: John Ames and Sarah Willis
2 CONT * Siblings: ...haniel Ames, Elizabeth Field (born Ames), Captain Thomas William Ames, Susan "anne" Rountree (born Ames), Sarah Field (born Ame... 
2 CONT * Husband: David Packard (1687-1755)  - David Packard and Hannah Ames were married on '''December 17, 1712'''.  They were wed in '''Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts'''.  He  was the son of Zaccheus Packard and Sarah How
2 CONC ard.
2 CONT
2 CONT All of the children of David and Hannah (Ames) Packard were born in '''Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts'''.
2 CONT
2 CONT ''(Note: Specifically, they were born in the area known as the North Parish of Bridgewater, which later incorporated as North Bridgewater and is today the city of Brockton).''
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''David Packard, Jr.''' (1713–1785) — m. 1st Mehitabel Richards (1736); m. 2nd Dorothy Bassett (1767)
2 CONT *'''William Packard''' (1715–1805) — m. Sarah Richards (1740)
2 CONT *'''Hannah (Packard) Brett''' (1718–1802) — m. Samuel Brett (1737)
2 CONT *'''Capt. Isaac Packard''' (1720–1792) — m. Abigail Porter (1745)
2 CONT *'''Mary (Packard) Richards''' (1722–1791) — m. Daniel Richards (1740)
2 CONT *'''Ebenezer Packard''' (1724–1803) — m. Sarah Perkins (1746)
2 CONT *'''Abiah Packard''' (1727–1809) — m. Phebe Paine (1758) ''(Note: Often duplicated as Sr./Died Young in unmerged internet pedigrees; David's 1754 will identifies one living son named Abiah)''
2 CONT *'''Mehetabell (Packard) Brett''' (1730–1787) — m. Simeon Brett (1748)
2 CONT *'''Jane (Packard) Kingman''' (1734–unknown) — m. Matthew Kingman (1755)
2 CONT
2 CONT Inscription: Hannah, wid. David, June 10, 1767, in 75th y.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
