1 NAME Elizabeth /Mitchell/
2 GIVN Elizabeth
2 SURN Mitchell
2 _MARNM Washburn
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE 27 AUG 1627
2 ADDR
3 CITY Duxbury
3 STAE Plymouth Colony
3 CTRY Colonial America
1 BURI
2 DATE AFT 5 DEC 1684
2 PLAC Plymouth Cemetery
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bridgewater
3 STAE Massachusetts
3 CTRY United States
1 DEAT
2 DATE 5 DEC 1684
2 ADDR
3 CITY Bridgewater
3 STAE Plymouth Colony
3 CTRY Colonial America
1 OCCU Wife/Mother, Keeping House
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Descendant of Mayflower passenger Francis Cooke 
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Mitchell is an English/Scottish name, meaning "descendant of Michael, as in the archangel, one who is God-like, a large man"
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Elizabeth Mitchell''' was born in Plymouth Colony in about 1629, the daughter of Experience Mitchell and Jane Cooke, and granddaughter of Francis Cooke, of the "Mayflower".  See Volume 12 of the "Mayflower Families Through Five
2 CONC  Generations" for full detail on Francis Cooke and his descendants, including James Washburn and his son Moses Washburn 
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT John and Elizabeth were among the original settlers of what is referred to today as "Old Bridgewater". They settled in the area that is today the central portion of the town of Bridgewater. "Old Bridgewater" was officially incorpo
2 CONC rated in 1656.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth died between 1681 and 1684. She died before her father, and thus not mentioned in his will. When and where exactly is not known, and neither is her place of burial.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.findagrave.com/cgi-bin/fg.cgi?page=gr&GRid=42076043
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth Mitchell, the first child of Experience Mitchell and Jane Cooke Mitchell was born in Plymouth, Plymouth Colony about 1628. Some sources give a date of August 27, 1628. No contemporary record is available to confirm the e
2 CONC xact date. Elizabeth was the granddaughter of Mayflower Pilgrim Francis Cooke.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth marries John Washburn on 6 Dec 1645. They had 11 children.
2 CONT
2 CONT # John Washburn Jr @1646
2 CONT # Thomas Washburn @1648
2 CONT # Samuel Washburn @1651
2 CONT # Joseph Washburn 7 July 1653
2 CONT # Johnathan Washburn @1655
2 CONT # Benjamin Washburn @1658
2 CONT # Mary Washburn @1661
2 CONT # Elizabeth Washburn @1664
2 CONT # Jane Washburn @1670
2 CONT # James Washburn 15 May 1672
2 CONT # Sarah Washburn @1675
2 CONT
