1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Descendant of Mayflower passenger Francis Cooke
2 CONT ----
2 CONT AKA SEALY
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth WASHBURN (daughter of John WASHBURN and Elizabeth MITCHELL)  died on 27 Feb 1741/1742 in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT Married
2 CONT # James HAWARD son John HAWARD & Martha HAYWARD. James died in 1690 on an Expedition to Canada.
2 CONT # about 1692 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts to Edward Selee, his parents unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth and James had 3 children:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. Elizabeth HAWARD born 16 Jan 1686 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts. She married Thomas BUCK son of Benjamin BUCK. (See Descendants of Isaac Buck for the family of Elizabeth and Thomas BUCK.)
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. Mercy HAWARD born 27 Feb 1688 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts. Mercy died 26 Jan 1705 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT iii. James HAWARD born 26 Jan 1689 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts. James married Elizabeth WALLIS. He died 9 May 1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT Elizabeth and Edward Selee had two children:
2 CONT
2 CONT + 2 M i. Benjamin SELEE was born on 5 Mar 1693. He died on 5 Feb 1749.
2 CONT
2 CONT + 3 M ii. John SELEE was born on 10 Apr 1697. He died on 3 Dec 1783.
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
