2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Washburn, Thomas Washburn Sr., Samuel Washburn Sr., Joseph Washburn Sr., Jonathan Washburn, Benjamin Washburn, Mary (Washburn) Kinsley, Jane (Washburn) Orcutt, James Washburn Sr. and Sarah (Washburn) Ames
2 CONT
