2 CONC ld: @I3286@ Marriage: Date: 06 DEC 1645 Place: Duxbury, Plymouth, Massachusetts Death
2 CONT
2 CONT Death: Date: 27 Feb 1742 Place: Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts "Mayflower Births & Deaths" shows Death as 27 Feb 1742, Age: 82 in Norton, Bristol, Massachusetts
2 CONT
