2 CONT Jane Orcutt formerly Washburn
2 CONT
2 CONT Born 1666 in Duxbury, Plymouth Colony, New England
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of John Washburn Jr. and Elizabeth (Mitchell) Washburn
2 CONT
2 CONT Sister of John Washburn, Thomas Washburn Sr., Samuel Washburn Sr., Joseph Washburn Sr., Jonathan Washburn, Benjamin Washburn, Elizabeth (Washburn) Seely, Mary (Washburn) Kinsley, James Washburn Sr. and	Sarah (Washburn) Ames
2 CONT
2 CONT Wife of William Orcutt Jr. — married before 28 Jul 1690 (to 10 Sep 1694) in Hingham, Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Mother of Joanna (Orcutt) Edson and Elisabeth (Orcutt) French
2 CONT
2 CONT Died before 21 Sep 1698 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Province of Massachusetts Bay
