1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Capt Abiel Packard=
2 CONT * BIRTH 29 Apr 1699 Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * DEATH 1 Jun 1774 (aged 75) Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Ashland Cemetery, Brockton, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 43209313 Photos by Stan Arnold & Chip5610
2 CONT
2 CONT ==Biography==
2 CONT When Captain Abiel Packard was born in 1699, and he was christened on April 29, 1699, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Zacheus Packard Sr., was 48 and his mother, Sarah Howa
2 CONC rd, was 50. He married Sarah Ames on 11 January 1722/23, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 8 sons and 2 daughters. He died on 1 June 1774, in Brockton, Plymouth, Massachusett
2 CONC s, United States, at the age of 75, and was buried in Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Parents'''
2 CONT Zaccheus Packard 1651–1723
2 CONT Sarah Howard Packard 1648–1737
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Spouses'''
