2 CONT Sarah Ames and Capt. Abiel Packard had children:[106]
2 CONT
2 CONT 709 iii Joshua4 Packard, born on 26 July 1730 in Bridgewater,[169] married Mehitabel5 Alden, daughter of Samuel4 and Abiah4 (Edson) Alden, of Titicut, MA,[170] in Jan. 1755.[171] She was born on 27 Apr. 1732 in Bridgewater,[172] a
2 CONC  grand­daughter of Deacon Joseph3 and Hannah3 (Dunham) Alden (Jr.),[173] and of Capt. Josiah3 and Sarah3 (Packard) Edson, of South Bridgewater.[174] They moved to Maine,[175] probably before 1790.[176] They had children:[177]
2 CONT
2 CONT Caleb Packard, born on 5 Mar. 1758 in Bridgewater,[178] baptized on 13 Aug. 1758 in North Bridgewater.[179][1]
2 CONT Joshua Packard (Jr.), born on 27 Aug. 1759 in Bridgewater,[180] baptized on 7 Oct. 1759 in North Bridgewater.[181][1]
2 CONT Ralph Packard, baptized on 13 Sept. 1761 in North Bridgewater.[182]
2 CONT Lebbeus Packard, baptized on 19 May 1765 in North Bridgewater.[183]
2 CONT Mehitabel Packard, baptized on 16 Oct. 1768 in North Bridgewater.[184]
