2 CONT The Life Summary of Daniel
2 CONT
2 CONT When Daniel Packard was born on 9 May 1742, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, his father, Abiel Packard, was 43 and his mother, Sarah Ames, was 40. He married Hannah Perkins on 14 July 1
2 CONC 765, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 2 sons and 4 daughters.
