2 CONT Born 9 May 1742 in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Abiel Packard Sr. and Sarah (Ames) Packard
2 CONT
2 CONT Brother of Josiah Packard Sr., Abiel Packard Jr., Joshua Packard, Thomas Packard, Timothy Packard, Sarah (Packard) Snell, Elizabeth (Packard) Edson, Eliab Packard, John Packard and Benjamin Packard
2 CONT
2 CONT Husband of Hannah (Perkins) Packard — married 14 Jul 1765 in North Bridgewater, Plymouth County, Massachusetts, British America
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Hannah (Packard) Bannister, Abigail (Packard) Howard, Daniel Packard and Verren Packard
2 CONT
2 CONT Died [date unknown] [location unknown]
2 CONT
2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Christening Date: 16 May 1742  Christening Location: Brockton, Plymouth, Massachusetts  Death Date: Unknown[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Ames and Capt. Abiel Packard had children:[106]
2 CONT
2 CONT 714 viii Daniel4 Packard, born on 9 May 1742 in Bridgewater,[351] baptized on 16 May 1742 in North Bridgewater,[352] married Hannah Perkins on 14 July 1765 in North Bridgewater.[353] No death or probate records were found for him 
2 CONC in Plymouth County, and he supposedly “went westward.”[354] He may have been the Daniel Packard living in Wilbraham, Hampshire (now Hampden) Co., MA, in the 1790 federal census.[355] They had children:[356]
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Daniel Packard and Hannah Perkins were:
2 CONT
2 CONT i. . Hannah Packard, born on 12 Oct. 1766 in Bridgewater.[357] "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:VQ6J-XR7 : 15 January 2020), Daniel Packard in entr
2 CONC y for Hannah Packard, 1776.
2 CONT
2 CONT ii. . Abigail Packard, born on 28 June 1768 in Bridgewater.[358] iii. Daniel5 Packard (Jr.), born on 18 June 1770 in Bridgewater,[359] married Zibeah Robinson, probably daughter of Gain Robinson (Jr.),[360] and moved to Pelham, MA
2 CONC .[361] No death record was found for either of them in Pelham, MA. "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:V5NC-DH6 : 14 January 2020), Daniel Packard in 
2 CONC entry for Daniell Packard, 1770.
2 CONT
2 CONT iv. . Rhoda Packard, born on 21 May 1772 in Bridgewater.[362] "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:V5FG-R8X : 14 January 2020), Daniel Packard in entry
2 CONC  for Rhoda Packard, 1772.
2 CONT
2 CONT v. Verren Packard "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:VQ6J-BL7 : 15 January 2020), Daniel Packard in entry for Verren Packard, 1776.
2 CONT
2 CONT vi. Sarah Packard "Massachusetts Births and Christenings, 1639-1915", database, FamilySearch (https://familysearch.org/ark:/61903/1:1:VQ6J-DF8 : 15 January 2020), Daniel Packard in entry for Sarah Packard, 1777.
2 CONT
