2 CONT From John Maltby:
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph Bassett (3rd), son of Joseph and Phebe (Cushman) Bassett, married Ruth Leach, daughter of James and Hasadiah (Keith) Leach,[1] on 26 Jan. 1792 in Bridgewater.[2] She was born on 24 June 1772 in Bridgewater,[3] and died on 1
2 CONC 1 Mar. 1848 in Bridgewater, aged 76 years.[4]
