2 CONT Biography
2 CONT
2 CONT Sarah Pri­or, as Sarah Fobes, married John Eaton of Middleborough on 15 May 1780. Plymouth Colony and Massachusetts
2 CONT
2 CONT From John Maltby: Lt. Joseph Bassett (Jr.), son of Joseph and Elisabeth (Ames) Bassett, married, as his 2nd wife, Sarah (Pri­or) (Fobes) Eaton, daughter of Joseph and Ann (Moore) Prior, and widow of Josiah Fobes (Jr.), of Bridgewa
2 CONC ter, and of John Eaton, of Greenwich, CT,[1] on 14 Jan. 1798 in Bridgewater.[2] Sources
2 CONT
