1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Deborah Packard was born around 1658 in Bridgewater, Plymouth Colony (present Plymouth County, Massachusetts). Around 1676, Deborah Packard married Samuel Washburn.
2 CONT
2 CONT On July 1, 1725, Deborah (Packard) Washburn, around age 67, died in Bridgewater, Province of Massachusetts.
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''': LINK http://www.genealogyofnewengland.com/f_70.htm#289; LINK http://www.ancientfaces.com/person/deborah-packard-washburn/570349
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Deborah Packard Washburn
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth: 	1648 Death: 	unknown
2 CONT
2 CONT Deborah was born about 1648 in Hingham, Plymouth, Plymouth Colony.
2 CONT
2 CONT Deborah married Samuel Washburn about 1676 and probably in Bridgewater, Plymouth county, Plymouth Colony. They had children: Samuel - 6 April 1678 Noah - 11 July 1682 Israel - 24 February 1683/64 Nehemiah - 20 May 1686 Benjamin - 
2 CONC 17 January 1688/69 Hannah - @1689
2 CONT
2 CONT Deborah died after 1725.
2 CONT
