2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Hannah
2 CONT
2 CONT When Hannah Washburn was born in 1690, in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massachusetts, United States, her father, Sgt Samuel Washburn, was 38 and her mother, Deborah Packard, was 43. She married John Keith on 18 April 1711, in Bridgewate
2 CONC r, Plymouth, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America. They were the parents of at least 6 sons and 4 daughters. She died on 4 March 1766, in her hometown, at the age of 76, and was buried in Bridgewater, Plymouth, Massa
2 CONC chusetts, United States.
