2 CONT === GEDCOM Note ===
2 CONT == Biography == 
2 CONT Joseph was born on April 15, 1664. He was born to [[
2 CONT
2 CONT === Marriage ===
2 CONT : Marriage:   :: Date:  1686 :: Place:  Weymouth, Massachusetts (Norfolk) There are no marriage records for Joseph Shaw and Judith Whitmarsh in the [https://archive.org/stream/vitalrecordsofwe02weym#page/170/mode/2up Weymouth reco
2 CONC rds]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ===Probate===
2 CONT
2 CONT Joseph's land in Weymouth was assigned to the eldest son Joseph, on condition of paying out his siblings their shares.  The file names Elizabeth Harris, Abigail Alden, Ruth Snow, Martha Shaw, Sarah, Hannah, Ebenezer, John and Zech
2 CONC ariah.<ref>Suffolk County, MA: Probate File Papers.Online database. AmericanAncestors.org. New England Historic Genealogical Society, 2017-2019. (From records supplied by the Massachusetts Supreme Judicial Court Archives. Digitize
2 CONC d mages provided by FamilySearch.org) [https://www.americanancestors.org/DB2735/i/48704/4162-co3/69470492 Case 4162]</ref>
2 CONT
