1 NOTE 10 public member trees have John Baptist Shaw (born 1775 in Wake, NC and died 16 Sep 1815 in Wake, NC and married to Frances  McKelroy on 3 Dec 1771 in Wake, NC) as the son of Joseph Shaw, born 1715 in Maryland and died 1785 in Wa
2 CONC ke, NC.  No spouse is given.   Joseph Shaw is listed as the son of John Shaw who was born about 1700 in Antrim, Ulster or Pennsylvania, USA.
2 CONT Source: David Boudreaux
