2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail (Shaw) Alden
2 CONT * Birth: 	Jul. 17, 1695 Weymouth Norfolk County Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * Death: 	Jul. 12, 1755 Stafford Tolland County Connecticut, USA
2 CONT
2 CONT Abigail Shaw was born July 17th, 1695 in Weymouth, Massachusetts, a daughter of Joseph and Judith Whitmarsh Shaw. The family moved to Bridgewater, MA shortly after Abigail's birth. Abigail was married December 25th, 1717 in Bridge
2 CONC water to Daniel Alden. They were the parents of 10 children all born in Bridgewater:
2 CONT
2 CONT # Joseph, b. 20 Nov 1718
2 CONT # Daniel b. 5 Sep 1720
2 CONT # Abigail b. 3 Dec 1722
2 CONT # Zephaniah b. 13 Jun 1724
2 CONT # Hannah b. 23 May 1726 d. 2 Jul 1726
2 CONT # Hannah b. 17 Dec 1727 d. 26 Mar 1794
2 CONT # Mehitabel b. 23 May 1729 d. 13 Jul 1729
2 CONT # Barnabas b. 10 Sep 1732
2 CONT # Ebenezer b. 11 Aug 1734 d. 1 Jul 1755
2 CONT # Mary b. 12 May 1737 d. 6 Mar 1738
2 CONT
2 CONT The family moved to Stafford, CT in the early 1750's where Abigail died in 1755.
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links: 
2 CONT  Spouse:
2 CONT   Daniel Alden (1691 - 1767)
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:
2 CONT   Barnabas Alden (1732 - 1794)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Point here for explanation
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Old Stafford Street Cemetery  Stafford Tolland County Connecticut, USA
