1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ===Biography
2 CONT John Cary the Plymouth Pilgrim.  By Seth Cooley Cary.  Page 74.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=oDgcAAAAYAAJ&pg=PA74#v=onepage&q&f=false GoogleBooks]
2 CONT
2 CONT SECTION 15. 
2 CONT
2 CONT James Cary, son of James, Sec. 4, b. Bridgewater, 1692; m. Sarah Shaw, 1722, and d. 1762. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Children: 
2 CONT * I. Sarah, b. 1723; m. William Barrell, 1741. 
2 CONT *II. Joshua, b. 1726; d. unm. 1747. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Accoriding to [http://freepages.genealogy.rootsweb.com/~dearbornboutwell/ind15675.html citation] the Sarah Shaw daught of John and Judith was born in 1702 and not 1706 as this is in conflict her brother's Ebenzer's birth year.
2 CONT
2 CONT There is another [http://www.geni.com/people/Sarah-Lovell/6000000004536908747 Sarah Lovell (Shaw)].
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References
