1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Cemetery listing by the Erie (PA) Society for Genealogical Research on August 13, 1974.
2 CONT
2 CONT Son of Josiah and Hannah (Buttrick) Farnsworth.
2 CONT Husband of Elizabeth Willard, Mary Groover, Elizabeth Richardson, and Sarah Bassett Whitney.
2 CONT
2 CONT John had six children by three wives and six more with his fourth wife Sarah Bassette Whitney. Sarah also had three children from her first marriage. The Farnsworth/Whitney children and their descendants married into the Smith fam
2 CONC ily and went to Kane County Illinois and further west. Source: Erie County (PA) Genealogy Family Histories Smith Family 2nd Generation - Venango Twp. - Hannah.
2 CONT
2 CONT Father of Oren O., Josiah, Thomas, Polly (Van Natta), Hirman, David, Titus B., Lucetta, and Eliza Farnsworth.
2 CONT
2 CONT will for John FARNSWORTH:
2 CONT p. 145, John Farnsworth of town of French Creek, Chautauqua County, New York, died 28 Dec 1836, signed 23 Dec 1836, recorded 20 Mar 1837, court 28 Mar 1837, 4 May 1837.
2 CONT
2 CONT Land in French Creek and everything else to son Oren O. Farnsworth, on condition that he support my wife Sarah Farnsworth and my daughter Elisa Farnsworth during their natural lives.
2 CONT
2 CONT Executors: Hiram Farnsworth, Titus B. Farnsworth
2 CONT
2 CONT Witnesses: Ephraim Dean, Charles Russel
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT John F Farnsworth Birth 27 Aug 1766 in Granville, Washington, New York, United States  Death 28 Dec 1836 in French Creek, Chautauqua, New York, United States 
2 CONT
2 CONT Parents Josiah Farnsworth 1721 – 1807 Hannah Buttrick 1728 – 1810 Spouse & Children Mary Grover 1770 – 1796 Josiah G Farnsworth 1791 – 1857 Thomas Farnsworth 1793 – 1841 David G Farnsworth 1795 –  Spouse & Children Elizabeth Bessi
2 CONC e Willard 1782 – 1801 Spouse & ChildrenSarah Bassett 1775 – 1861 Mary Farnsworth 1803 – 1851 Hiram Farnsworth 1806 – 1851 Titus Farnsworth 1812 – 1879 Lusetta Farnsworth 1813 – 1855 Eliza Farnsworth 1814 –  Orin Farnsworth 1815 – 
2 CONC 1909
2 CONT
2 CONT Timeline(View details) 1766 27 Aug Birth Granville, Washington, New York, United States  1790 Age: 24 Marriage to Mary Grover Granville, Washington, New York, United States  1799 17 Mar Age: 32 Marriage to Elizabeth Bessie Willard
2 CONC  1802 Abt Age: 36 Marriage to Sarah Bassett 1836 28 Dec Age: 70 Death French Creek, Chautauqua, New York, United States  1836 Dec Burial Mina, Chautauqua, New York, United States   West Mina Cemetery
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
