1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Daughter of John F & Sarah (Bassett) Farnsworth. Married John Vannata 18 Oct 1821 Chautauqua Co., NY.
2 CONT Death: Mary died 12 Sep 1851 in Cazenovia, Cook Co., Il. (Album of Genealogy and Biography of Cook Co., Illinois, Vol. 1, 1899, pps. 69-70). Mary died of cholera in one day and was originally buried on that part of the farm lying 
2 CONC on the west side of the Desplaines River in Leyden Twp., but her son James and his two sons, Herbert and William later moved her remains and interred them in Union Ridge cemetery, Norwood Park Twp., and she is buried next to John 
2 CONC and his second wife Sarah Davidson Fish.
