2 CONT
2 CONT Ebenezer and Rebecca (Jeffries) Wentworth had children:
2 CONT
2 CONT 97. Samuel, born 15 November 1714; married Rebecca, daughter of James and Rebecca Lloyd Oliver, of Boston Mass. She was granddaughter of Nathaniel Oliver (born 1652), who married Elizabeth, daughter of Capt. Thomas Brattle. Samuel
2 CONC  removed from Portsmouth to Merrimack, N.H. about 1771, where he died childless aged about 70. His widow (as such appears in deed 17 July 1789) married a Simpson, of Merrimack, who died suddenly while on a visit to Portsmouth.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
