2 CONT
2 CONT Brief Life History of Mehitable
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT When Mehitable Nowell was born on 2 February 1637, in Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America, her father, Increase Nowell, was 43 and her mother, Parnell Gray, was 35. She married William Hilton on 16 July 165
2 CONC 9, in Charlestown, Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts, United States. They were the parents of at least 5 sons. She died on 29 September 1711, in Charlestown, Boston, Suffolk, Massachusetts, United States, at the age of 74, and was bu
2 CONC ried in Suffolk, Massachusetts Bay Colony, British Colonial America.
