2 CONC  Nov. 1639, m. Elizabeth Russell, 24 Aug. 1664, d. 12 Feb. 1680. +7. Susannah Graves, b. 8 July 1643, m. Zechariah Symmes, Jr., 18 Nov. 1669, d. 23 July 1681. +8. Joseph Graves, b. 13 April 1645, m(1) Elizabeth Maynard, 15 Jan. 16
2 CONC 65/6, m(2) Mary Ross, 1678.
