1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Susannah Graves Symmes=
2 CONT * BIRTH 8 Jul 1643 England
2 CONT * DEATH 23 Jul 1681 (aged 38) Bradford, Essex County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * BURIAL Ancient Burying Ground, Bradford, Essex County, Massachusetts, USA
2 CONT * MEMORIAL ID 21963763  Photos by Sharon Terry & Jeffrey James
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the daughter of Rear Admiral Thomas and Kathryn Gray Graves. Her father was killed aboard the St Andrew on July 31, 1653. His body was landed at Aldborough Bay, Co. Suffolk, England on Aug 8, 1653 and buried the same day; 
2 CONC he is NOT buried in Boston.
2 CONT Susannah was born in England after her parents immigrated. Perhaps her mother went to England for a stay the year Susannah's birth.
2 CONT
2 CONT She was the first wife of Rev Zechariah Symmes, Jr. with whom she had 7 children.   Daughter Sarah, born 1672-died 1710, was the first wife of Joshua Scottow. Buried next to Sarah, is the second wife of Joshua, Abigail Watkins Sym
2 CONC mes.
2 CONT
