2 CONT  Samuel , 55227 (~1640-<1644)
2 CONT  Mary , 55228 (~1642-1702)
2 CONT  Samuel , 10793 (1652-1730)
2 CONT  Elizabeth , 1540 (1645-1700) 2Hannah TYNG , 55224 Birth7 May 1640 Death28 Oct 1688, Cambridge, Middlesex, MA
2 CONT
