2 CONT # Dictionary of American Biography, vol. 8, p.417 [https://www.ancestry.com/interactive/1981/31205_Vol8-00171/25317 See link on Ancestry for Daniel and the two Vincent Gookins]
2 CONT # Transactions and Collection of AAS, vol. II, (1836). For information about the original manuscript see, Charles F. Heartman, Americana: Printed and in Manuscript (Metuchen, N.J., 1932), p. 35.
