2 CONT *History of New London, Connecticut: From the First Survey of the Coast in ... By Frances Manwaring Caulkins.  Page 415 - 416.  [https://books.google.com/books?id=HgIPz4OPYNoC&lpg=PA415&ots=aH7cSY5ACE&dq=Humphrey%20Davie%2C%20of%2
