1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Elizabeth Clarke (daughter of Thaddeus Clarke, Lt. and Elizabeth Mitton) was born 1664, and died July 02, 1690.
2 CONT
2 CONT She married Edward Tyng, Honorable on 1682 in Falmouth, Maine, son of Edward Tynge, Colonel and Mary Sayre.
2 CONT
2 CONT More About Elizabeth Clarke and Edward Tyng, Honorable: Marriage: 1682, Falmouth, Maine.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of Elizabeth Clarke and Edward Tyng, Honorable are:
2 CONT # +Mary Tyng, b. May 10, 1678, d. February 05, 1764.
2 CONT # Jonathan Tyng, b. Bet. 1678 - 1683, d. date unknown.
2 CONT # +Edward Tyng, b. 1683, d. September 08, 1755, Boston, Massachusetts.
2 CONT # Elizabeth Tyng, b. Abt. 1685, d. date unknown.
2 CONT
2 CONT -----
