2 CONT I doe by and with the advice and consent of Maj'tys council hereby order you to pay the sum above of five hundred seventy eight poundes & Twelve shillings to Stephen Sewall Esq'r. who together witht the gentelmen of the committe t
2 CONC hat Estimated and Reported the said damages are desired & directed to distribute the same in proportion as above to such of the said persons as are Living. and to those that legally represent them that are dead according as the la
2 CONC w directs & for which this shall be your Warrant. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Given under my hand at BoSton the 17th day of December 1711 
2 CONT
2 CONT J. Dudley 
2 CONT
2 CONT (Reverse) Allowance to persons who were prosecuted for witchcraft 
