2 CONT 44. Samuel Symon WILLARD Rev. (Simon , Richard , Symon , Richard , William ) was born on Jan 31 1640 in Concord, , Massachusetts. He died on Sep 12 1707 in Boston, Suffolk Co., Massachusetts. He was buried about Sep 1707. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Samuel married (1) Abigail SHERMAN daughter of John SHERMAN Rev. and Mary LAUNCE on Aug 8 1664 in Groton, MA. Abigail was born on Feb 3 1647 in Watertown, Middlesex Co., Massachusetts. She died in 1678 in Groton, , Massachusetts. 
