3 CONT Willard, Rev. Samuel [(Sim.) b. Conc. 31 Jan. 1640, H. C. 1659, m. (1) Abigail Sherman (Rev. John) 8 Aug. 1664, (2) Eunice Tyng (Edw.) ab. 1679 who d. 14 June 1720, ord. Groton, 13 July 1664, min. Old South Ch., Bost., 31 Mar. 167
3 CONC 8, d. 12 Sept. 1707, Gen.], opposed to witchcraft proceedings, 116; assisted at ordination of Rev. William Brattle, 282
