1 NAME Margaret /Rootes/
2 GIVN Margaret
2 SURN Rootes
2 _MARNM Roten (Wroughton)
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1578
2 PLAC England
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 30 MAR 1659
2 PLAC Lancaster, Virginia, USA
2 ADDR
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ----
2 CONT ===Family
2 CONT
2 CONT “Descendants of Ezekiah (RAUGHTON) RHOTEN” As compiled by  Jane A. Schwarz Combs
2 CONT
2 CONT http://freepages.rootsweb.com/~combsschwarzfamily/genealogy/rhoton.html
2 CONT
2 CONT Generation No. 1
2 CONT
2 CONT 1. *EZEKIAH (RAUGHTON)1 RHOTEN was born Abt. 1594, and died Abt. 1630.  He married *MARGARET DAUSON Bet. 1623 - 1624.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children of EZEKIAH RHOTEN and MARGARET DAUSON are: 
2 CONT *2. i. *WILLIAM (I) (WROUGHTON)2 RHOTEN, b. Abt. 1630, VA; d. Abt. 1707, Dorchester Co., MD. 
2 CONT * ii. ANNE (WROUGHTON) RHOTEN, b. Abt. 1629; d. Bef. 1678; m. WILLIAM (SR) WHITE. 
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT "Maids For Virginia - as described in the "Ferrar Papers" - Margaret was one of 57 "young maids" being sent to Virginia to become "well married."
2 CONT
2 CONT "Ninth Ggm was born at Woodham Market, Suffolke, UK, raised by Mrs. Elizabeth Stevenson. Mentioned as a faithful servant."[1]
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
2 CONT Adventurers of Purse and Persons, Virginia 1607/1624/5, DORMAN, John Frederick, Vol. three, Families R-Z, pp. 847-9: Wroughton:
2 CONT
2 CONT >Transcript: Ezekiah Wroughton's widow Margaret married (2) Thomas Attowell, who held land on the south side of Warwick River Co., in 1636 and 1637, and on Cheeseman's Creek in Charles River (York) County in 1643. By Attowell she 
2 CONC had daughters Mary (who married Samuel Gooch with prenuptial agreement 16 March 1652/3?) - and died 26 Oct. 1657) and Frances (who married, with prenuptial agreement) 14 Oct. 1653, Thomas Roots, chirurgeon (surgeon) of Lancaster C
2 CONC ounty, who survived her and left Will 25 Jan. 1660/1 - 14 March 1660/1? neither of whom left children. Margaret married (3) Edward Grimes who arrived in Virginia before 16 Dec. 1631, settled on Keth's (Skiffes) Creek in Warwick.[2
2 CONC ]
2 CONT
2 CONT ===References 
2 CONT * https://www.wikitree.com/wiki/Dauson-3 cites 
2 CONT # https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/152239504/margaret-raughton 
