2 CONT *https://sites.rootsweb.com/~rhutch/richard_hutchinson.html cites:
2 CONT *_The Hutchinson Family: or the Descendants of Barnard Hutchinson, of Cowlam, England_, compiled by Perley Derby, Essex Institute Press, 1870, Salem, Massachusetts, pp. 6-7.
2 CONT *_The Pioneers of Massachusetts, by Charles Henry Pope, pp. 249-250.
2 CONT *_Story of the Hutchinsons_, by John Wallace Hutchinson," published in 1896.
2 CONT *The new england historical & genealogical register volume xxii Page 248 [https://books.google.com/books?id=M2sFAAAAQAAJ&lpg=PA248&ots=z42rzzf4ra&dq=james%20standish%20sarah%20hutchinson&pg=PA248#v=onepage&q=james%20standish%20sar
2 CONC ah%20hutchinson&f=true GoogleBooks]
2 CONT *https://nutfieldgenealogy.blogspot.com/2016/11/surname-saturday-hutchinson-of-salem.html?m=1
