2 CONT Brief Life History of Azor
2 CONT
2 CONT Azor Gale was a prominent Sea Captain, who, with his wife Mary Roots He had over a dozen children.
2 CONT He and his family lived in Marblehead Massachusetts, where he died in 1728.
