0 @N6000000003122782930@ NOTE Had largest library in Colony.  Alternated with Capt. Miles Standish as deputy in General Court.  Fought in Pequot War, 1637.  A Pilgrim.  Arrived in Plymouth, November 1621, on ship "Fortune" (second ship to arrive in Plymouth wi
1 CONC th 35 passengers).  Resided in Plymouth, Mass., 1621.  One of 54 original proprietors of Bridgewater, Mass., 1648.   1627 - Undertaker.  1633 - Freeman.  1655 - Built place for public meetings.  1658 - Constable.  First Bassett an
1 CONC cestor in America.
