1 CONC and Children the Children of my Daughter Ruth late deced viz/ William Keen, Levi Keen, Abel Keen, Samuel Keen, Josiah Keen and Grace Cole"; granddaughters Silvine Sprague and Grace Sprague; grandson William Sprague.
